avatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:46:34Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:46:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add v2 onboarding loading screen while creating workspace (#22152)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc7b1d10-7495-4f21-9311-4c22c0f14771\n\nAdds the full-screen loading screen shown while a new workspace is being\ncreated in the v2 sign-up flow (`SignInUpV2`), building on the v2\n\"Create your workspace\" step.\n\nHow it works:\n- Submitting the v2 create-workspace form marks the flow as v2\n(`isOnboardingV2State`) and creates the workspace. The flag is carried\nacross the cross-subdomain redirect with an `onboardingV2=true` URL\nparam, so v2 users land on a new `/workspace-activation-v2` route\ninstead of v1''s `/workspace-activation`.\n- `WorkspaceActivationV2` runs the real `activateWorkspace` mutation on\nmount and renders the loader: a pulsing Twenty logomark above a stack of\nstatus messages that shift up one at a time, cycling once per second.\nThere is no faked/minimum duration; it advances to the next onboarding\nstep as soon as the workspace is activated.\n- On activation failure it shows a \"Workspace creation failed\" screen\nwith a Retry button.\n\nv1 onboarding is unchanged. Storybook:\n`Modules/Auth/SignInUpWorkspaceActivationV2`.\n\nNote: The flashes will be fixed in later PRs\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22152?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"a24213ba222cafedda5f7ff2d16c42186a14132a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/a24213ba222cafedda5f7ff2d16c42186a14132a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f","verification":{"payload":"tree a24213ba222cafedda5f7ff2d16c42186a14132a\nparent ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1782463594 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782463594 +0000\n\nAdd v2 onboarding loading screen while creating workspace (#22152)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc7b1d10-7495-4f21-9311-4c22c0f14771\n\nAdds the full-screen loading screen shown while a new workspace is being\ncreated in the v2 sign-up flow (`SignInUpV2`), building on the v2\n\"Create your workspace\" step.\n\nHow it works:\n- Submitting the v2 create-workspace form marks the flow as v2\n(`isOnboardingV2State`) and creates the workspace. The flag is carried\nacross the cross-subdomain redirect with an `onboardingV2=true` URL\nparam, so v2 users land on a new `/workspace-activation-v2` route\ninstead of v1''s `/workspace-activation`.\n- `WorkspaceActivationV2` runs the real `activateWorkspace` mutation on\nmount and renders the loader: a pulsing Twenty logomark above a stack of\nstatus messages that shift up one at a time, cycling once per second.\nThere is no faked/minimum duration; it advances to the next onboarding\nstep as soon as the workspace is activated.\n- On activation failure it shows a \"Workspace creation failed\" screen\nwith a Retry button.\n\nv1 onboarding is unchanged. Storybook:\n`Modules/Auth/SignInUpWorkspaceActivationV2`.\n\nNote: The flashes will be fixed in later PRs\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22152?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPjxqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyV0QAASs7Sw9PgnYzI/SA2gzFGfY\nFpXUhmtE3Ycd4K4w5UwYWYXDCaL2EzC9bApGWYm8iNXEVZrzeLkEKKyQd3k3s7eG\nSciM7TQPCPOfSb0pJVDPbRVaeueVF4/zEafTnkcjrZVQqM9ZbFSM1C9tnTKep4rG\nYYZSqBdNnI+puSfW/AGVPKcRHbu9nerKRmCTcbuqK8hWxKWbwzxWLnWVY1eoOJiT\no6J+6qQIxn/ee85FEaNhsTJ11bdO3SjJn9mDa65MQvlYcbTSHPMIlL6xNFA80lNN\nSGkpdnGsmt0mPAhA+/Yuy3Srhx5czmXL01DkxbWre364FGMStRBszmx3Vs9gbE63\nYx6o4LR3e+hcCD5+rmm3he+ksa4xZejKQDihGNnXp2u6SLM2OsoJrk1V7kzZlUZR\n4x+1JTqvNtDUTX4+LdF1V48GAtEtxp+d3CbAslqbQwa2md6yff/OMOA5hyKYkwJ7\nM54U2wMenqgs1r5RY+Oiode11rtZNXJCeL1b7dIe//wlvR0bm3b4tOaQpoXfaf2T\njNQfk9FVE53SNfProtOewxyIcbmInx8IGQZmww7IT0V2Z6QpSUjV0RSTtX7kP3Fa\nTXohACbCPvqj1+ZZ5WZ708vfQRzQ/zFUpttw++b4xR3FuE8wpmrZ1AAI3eRadNCt\nUl2LBsVIN2O9Pn4uPJwk\n=v4MR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T14:47:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f","node_id":"C_kwDOTG3Rw9oAKGNiNDlhN2EwNTNmMGUyNDRiYzI4NGExYTVmOTVlOTBhYWVlYWVjOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521","sha":"ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521"}],"sha":"cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111741062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Akash5908","id":111741062,"login":"Akash5908","node_id":"U_kgDOBqkIhg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akash5908","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:42:10Z","email":"venomkr020@gmail.com","name":"Akash!"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:42:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: hide \"Create Workspace\" button when multi-workspace is disabled (#22202)\n\n## Description\n\nThis PR fixes a bug where the \"Create Workspace\" button was\nunconditionally rendered in the workspace switcher dropdown, even when\nsingle-workspace mode was active (`IS_MULTIWORKSPACE_ENABLED=false`).\n\nThis created a confusing \"dead-end\" action for users, as clicking the\nbutton would do nothing (because the backend correctly blocks workspace\ncreation in this mode, and the frontend skips the redirect).\n\n### Changes made\n- Imported the `isMultiWorkspaceEnabledState` atom from client-config.\n- Evaluated `isMultiWorkspaceEnabled` inside\n`MultiWorkspaceDropdownDefaultComponents`.\n- Conditionally rendered the \"Create Workspace\" `<MenuItem>` only if\nmulti-workspace is enabled.\n\nCloses #22139\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22202?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"3877abe58e58482046fa02afbd5146bf0fb08449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/3877abe58e58482046fa02afbd5146bf0fb08449"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521","verification":{"payload":"tree 3877abe58e58482046fa02afbd5146bf0fb08449\nparent b625bd199598ab38ffa8f43e1678e1259f11f751\nauthor Akash! <venomkr020@gmail.com> 1782463330 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782463330 +0200\n\nfix: hide \"Create Workspace\" button when multi-workspace is disabled (#22202)\n\n## Description\n\nThis PR fixes a bug where the \"Create Workspace\" button was\nunconditionally rendered in the workspace switcher dropdown, even when\nsingle-workspace mode was active (`IS_MULTIWORKSPACE_ENABLED=false`).\n\nThis created a confusing \"dead-end\" action for users, as clicking the\nbutton would do nothing (because the backend correctly blocks workspace\ncreation in this mode, and the frontend skips the redirect).\n\n### Changes made\n- Imported the `isMultiWorkspaceEnabledState` atom from client-config.\n- Evaluated `isMultiWorkspaceEnabled` inside\n`MultiWorkspaceDropdownDefaultComponents`.\n- Conditionally rendered the \"Create Workspace\" `<MenuItem>` only if\nmulti-workspace is enabled.\n\nCloses #22139\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22202?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPjtiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYCoQAF5dlWz7dxp/ZJV0RErcubCx\nhPyhbQmXp+u74UHdO9ig/vJ9FGzpnaf/Z1YgqpNLHVw70DrOJZfTOFkTUWcLwDEM\nvqisNgKJ4mSQMsV1on1OxWv8aYI/Nei3b4DcUUQkWiHark2lBQNN50+O5TAjMhvd\nx/x7ixgpP9cs3hzvdsT3TIvDK1uIdzRVSP8voxFWL29GUhivwEJTvOyftRk4kmx4\nnHKQki61rrAK48uXhHEsdqdnjzj/cuUbEo4Mc1S2AmWpJ/e+Q4MiHOb28kTEwTv7\nPPV6dB7Ll6t6sArfpwNX77HaLFYO4IpW29uR+Kmlptn1xCpJTgKuZReNfzSKQWoD\nyGd0tEJcW/PvN1M/XEm8kI/R5uPJnPXlZFrXw/zqk0xnlK2wsB7vb5k9hPtySJdx\nX7ISBp7sfYAAhbiXgc6Im9xnj6eIKJzyq+nCPdYLUyfm/ohSKciUrZAsUJw4c47A\nYFUxw/DdyBf8VTbTMiIqKuubwovMbPHv8aEGz364GfMFxZFLZwyx68b2VC4qrYWM\nN6HfV7GXVuSeSaUV7BydYNjKtXzj2k2bTl1ZDSi6mZ6LJSLVnikqIzKwKai7Ca73\ne+g4nkuLroUsBArnBB33XLRMJv2YeLR9OhNZ3+XAHjM38bMDAOiagwVmHzYYBiVh\nFTvY1vZqG4Pp5YaLDRYB\n=pL36\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T14:47:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":