w","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/2aeacf341fc391c5fb0f4ed3d0ec46da6ad55919","node_id":"C_kwDOTG3Rw9oAKDJhZWFjZjM0MWZjMzkxYzVmYjBmNGVkM2QwZWM0NmRhNmFkNTU5MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/db5338cf324ead0550089a80e51f30bceb724cb4","sha":"db5338cf324ead0550089a80e51f30bceb724cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/db5338cf324ead0550089a80e51f30bceb724cb4"}],"sha":"2aeacf341fc391c5fb0f4ed3d0ec46da6ad55919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/2aeacf341fc391c5fb0f4ed3d0ec46da6ad55919"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81605929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abdulrahmancodes","id":81605929,"login":"abdulrahmancodes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNjA1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/db5338cf324ead0550089a80e51f30bceb724cb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:55:50Z","email":"81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdul Rahman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:55:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat: group records by many to one relation (#22123)\n\n## Group records by relation (Kanban + Table)\n\nAdds grouping by `MANY_TO_ONE` relation fields on both board and table\nviews, reusing the existing `ViewGroup` storage (`fieldValue = related\nrecord id`).\n\n- **New group** record picker to create relation-backed groups (board\ncolumn + table row)\n- Relation-aware group headers (name/avatar), filtering, and drag-drop\n(writes the FK join column) — all using one canonical `${name}Id` column\n- Sort menu hides alphabetical options when grouping by a relation (no\ncomparable title)\n- A group whose backing record no longer exists renders a \"Deleted\" chip\ninstead of a blank header\n- **Backend:** allow `MANY_TO_ONE` relations as the Kanban\n`mainGroupByField` in the flat-view validator\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/267077a6-2667-4506-b178-eee420a16f20\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22123?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"ee4c0913aced5c7af591f39e54ff0ca9782a7fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/ee4c0913aced5c7af591f39e54ff0ca9782a7fef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/db5338cf324ead0550089a80e51f30bceb724cb4","verification":{"payload":"tree ee4c0913aced5c7af591f39e54ff0ca9782a7fef\nparent 108cc5b6a57113732d61304fded4c9c5b26889b2\nauthor Abdul Rahman <81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com> 1782388550 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782388550 +0200\n\nFeat: group records by many to one relation (#22123)\n\n## Group records by relation (Kanban + Table)\n\nAdds grouping by `MANY_TO_ONE` relation fields on both board and table\nviews, reusing the existing `ViewGroup` storage (`fieldValue = related\nrecord id`).\n\n- **New group** record picker to create relation-backed groups (board\ncolumn + table row)\n- Relation-aware group headers (name/avatar), filtering, and drag-drop\n(writes the FK join column) — all using one canonical `${name}Id` column\n- Sort menu hides alphabetical options when grouping by a relation (no\ncomparable title)\n- A group whose backing record no longer exists renders a \"Deleted\" chip\ninstead of a blank header\n- **Backend:** allow `MANY_TO_ONE` relations as the Kanban\n`mainGroupByField` in the flat-view validator\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/267077a6-2667-4506-b178-eee420a16f20\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22123?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPRdGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5zcQAIBg64VOYqdawjgF8L3BHuR2\nOF1+CWuk7RcNHmM5VvnVjYDudv2FPlZfElDNEWX7pZ8P+xDXKXFTXwK8cSz6cTUd\nHvYK+SbMyrmjhOWkHkDCeFm2eENPh5JpY9yl/r2uvrfVqaofrlhKJ1mipT3SJ3oD\nzBcOa3y9fIf3Zg0JhnMovMwo6tsRRcxhuweoiiILPmG321QOLgNABsrvqBPnpK2+\noC/mAWvojz8WmnbrJ5Aptq2HOoH+