,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/db5338cf324ead0550089a80e51f30bceb724cb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1834158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Weiko","id":1834158,"login":"Weiko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzQxNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/108cc5b6a57113732d61304fded4c9c5b26889b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:53:58Z","email":"corentin@twenty.com","name":"Weiko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:53:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"API key creation triggers unnecessary ORMEntityMetadatas cache recomputation (#22168)\n\n## Context\n\nCreating an API key only changes role/apiKey-related data, but the\nworkspace migration runner was also invalidating and recomputing the\nmetadata caches (`ORMEntityMetadatas` and `graphQLResolverNameMap`) on\nit.\n\nThe root cause is a single `if` block in\n`getLegacyCacheInvalidationPromises` that gated **all** caches with an\n`||` condition combining the metadata and role/permission conditions:\n\n```ts\nif (\n  shouldIncrementMetadataGraphqlSchemaVersion ||\n  shouldInvalidateRoleMapCache ||\n  shouldInvalidateRolesPermissionsCache\n) {\n  // recomputes role caches AND ORMEntityMetadatas + graphQLResolverNameMap\n}\n```\n\nSo any role-only change (such as API key creation, which sets\n`shouldInvalidateRoleMapCache`) also recomputed `ORMEntityMetadatas` —\nan expensive recomputation that does not depend on role data.\n\n## Fix\n\nSplit the combined block into two independent blocks, each gated by its\nown condition:\n\n- `shouldIncrementMetadataGraphqlSchemaVersion` → invalidate/recompute\nonly the metadata-derived caches: `ORMEntityMetadatas` and\n`graphQLResolverNameMap`\n- `shouldInvalidateRoleMapCache ||\nshouldInvalidateRolesPermissionsCache` → invalidate/recompute only the\nrole/permissions caches\n\n`graphQLResolverNameMap` is built from `flatObjectMetadataMaps` (see\n`WorkspaceResolverNameMapCacheService`), so it is grouped with\n`ORMEntityMetadatas` in the metadata block rather than the role block.\n\n## Result\n\n- Role-only changes (e.g. API key creation) no longer trigger\nunnecessary `ORMEntityMetadatas` / `graphQLResolverNameMap`\nrecomputation.\n- Metadata-only changes no longer recompute the role/permissions caches.","tree":{"sha":"216f905d269a0f98c36124212e8a4ef554ec4b0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/216f905d269a0f98c36124212e8a4ef554ec4b0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/108cc5b6a57113732d61304fded4c9c5b26889b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 216f905d269a0f98c36124212e8a4ef554ec4b0f\nparent 19bbd59b5393596349b3e561eebb7e2ba402614c\nauthor Weiko <corentin@twenty.com> 1782388438 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782388438 +0200\n\nAPI key creation triggers unnecessary ORMEntityMetadatas cache recomputation (#22168)\n\n## Context\n\nCreating an API key only changes role/apiKey-related data, but the\nworkspace migration runner was also invalidating and recomputing the\nmetadata caches (`ORMEntityMetadatas` and `graphQLResolverNameMap`) on\nit.\n\nThe root cause is a single `if` block in\n`getLegacyCacheInvalidationPromises` that gated **all** caches with an\n`||` condition combining the metadata and role/permission conditions:\n\n```ts\nif (\n  shouldIncrementMetadataGraphqlSchemaVersion ||\n  shouldInvalidateRoleMapCache ||\n  shouldInvalidateRolesPermissionsCache\n) {\n  // recomputes role caches AND ORMEntityMetadatas + graphQLResolverNameMap\n}\n```\n\nSo any role-only change (such as API key creation, which sets\n`shouldInvalidateRoleMapCache`) also recomputed `ORMEntityMetadatas` —\nan expensive recomputation that does not depend on role data.\n\n## Fix\n\nSplit the combined block into two independent blocks, each gated by its\nown condition:\n\n- `shouldIncrementMetadataGraphqlSchemaVersion` → invalidate/recompute\nonly the metadata-derived caches: `ORMEntityMetadatas` and\n`graphQLResolverNameMap`\n- `shouldInvalidateRoleMapCache ||\nshouldInvalidateRolesPermissionsCache` → invalidate/recompute only the\nrole/permissions caches\n\n`graphQLResolverNameMap` is built from `flatObjectMetadataMaps` (see\n`WorkspaceResolverNameMapCacheService`), so it is grouped with\n`ORMEntityMetadatas` in the metadata block rather than the role block.\n\n## Result\n\n- Role-only changes (e.g. API key creation) no longer trigger\nunnecessary `ORMEntityMetadatas` / `graphQLResolverNameMap`\nrecomputation.\n- Metadata-only changes no longer recompute the role/permissions caches.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPRbWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4AoQACBU9Kp6TzK1dDQ8xpEY4XZ9\nb0Bf3YGETXMY1cbvh48VpH4jjm9pv7hlUcfF6RaUxwTGNOFA9AeSAAtO9DLozINC\n7k8O3CTDetcSkdLXzOPNrjF5totMcL/2vmaeyBTqZyZsX/PbKgNg5YSjQDizzY14\niaBm4pr6HEZjjjqKuNrpMRnA5Z1HlFkqF+TN+Pba8jBQzpe9VjIrsrMyTC6s5z9u\nvKMmZmB/Z5RqQl/QDzZOL1NTLKsVHvk5LeBxXG4j9alQqOc88A5o91Cebp4ZBZbI\n4GQ6HhBYbwSc4S/N4SRnIxL0RWh0EhBDnTCq/RyjmyGsoGjlff/6GP6M55Agac5D\nE2VEUrcJI4oQgyGE6nP1RNI7PB2EhrXvwQIaXLk6zx26oN3dMMUUvPzRG9IdrMI3\n6q6hZ5SuAzluNMOqOGkCTVTbbhnWUs/uF5lHz3UqMK2C+bDlnc4GptGwOkJJ5aP4\n3M80y