el/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/19bbd59b5393596349b3e561eebb7e2ba402614c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:31:00Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:31:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Support CSS imports in front-components via runtime style injection (#22150)\n\nFront-components compile to a remote-dom worker, so a CSS import like\n`import ''twenty-ui/style.css''` can''t load a stylesheet and was breaking\nthe build at the manifest step.\n\nThis makes the build inline an imported CSS file as a runtime `<style>`\ninjection that flows through the existing style bridge into the host.\nBecause the CSS is bundled alongside that same build''s hashed class\nnames, an app''s styling matches its own twenty-ui version regardless of\nwhich version the host ships — no server, manifest, or host changes\nneeded.\n\nThe manifest extractor keeps the no-op CSS loader (it executes the\nbundle in Node, where `document` is undefined); the inject plugin runs\nonly in the real build and the dev watcher.","tree":{"sha":"bad1eaee75290ec44c59226b2eda957df5d10775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/bad1eaee75290ec44c59226b2eda957df5d10775"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/19bbd59b5393596349b3e561eebb7e2ba402614c","verification":{"payload":"tree bad1eaee75290ec44c59226b2eda957df5d10775\nparent 2af5370749ac0d5afdb9fd57e6c8477e62f0b5c3\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1782387060 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782387060 +0200\n\nSupport CSS imports in front-components via runtime style injection (#22150)\n\nFront-components compile to a remote-dom worker, so a CSS import like\n`import ''twenty-ui/style.css''` can''t load a stylesheet and was breaking\nthe build at the manifest step.\n\nThis makes the build inline an imported CSS file as a runtime `<style>`\ninjection that flows through the existing style bridge into the host.\nBecause the CSS is bundled alongside that same build''s hashed class\nnames, an app''s styling matches its own twenty-ui version regardless of\nwhich version the host ships — no server, manifest, or host changes\nneeded.\n\nThe manifest extractor keeps the no-op CSS loader (it executes the\nbundle in Node, where `document` is undefined); the inject plugin runs\nonly in the real build and the dev watcher.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPRF0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjk0QAGqKeJuAfTmi39kpgeib0RNK\nlf8zK40bc0GEiFFxRGAuV1H8gQYJcKnEd5Sfw3GZcssitQ5LKdYB2xjdwJN2DxFx\nFkiDmyA6afbR+PwKXnGVnRDwlrIjJzH/BBXF2GzT5Rwv1yXqE7DaBSfLYR8MkHpd\nyMMGtWaUIDjXQ6CIffkw/nPdzWU7gGxyiJbs2m9y/Ah/bCWSljPkGlhPoEiD0rjG\nQFT8EvVriEZ/NHKeMQB0AlR8WtLLZIeQBiwehGCRE+5PHpajkLXunC97sf8MEnfn\nlRiK076sjWmIHaLkpRNJZamwFpDkAs+C7Nw2dqSYu5NkzTdfUbx3lDcqNYbMCv2A\n/gcBOXvd7OxVjJbRj06kxgjyLO9Zc57kFX6h+BsvgwVj+gj4687AXviklXgZZ0O7\nhua6m0w5CkCyrZLkAWguI94i9bbY/LP1TtMZduvZKvbsyTLkTJuXjJMeXX4Px+sH\nWtVtqoRJf/4C1VeBuwaT3tV7m6cBCZHMA/sae4YcLZgu5X7V5/qDVUVe4enDc+U8\nKMvUBHLU0t44GswhQ2cwsWVyVpTW/bBHuzFnGjQWN4VW46ruWTqWHkY4VE3HfJGq\nL1fjxM8CzrEq+IkeJJZEjsQBALDuKdexHmryAmDI9UT0JJUYSPM73nbWmn+Pwpwz\nWfc28Uyu1xd29dRWSncC\n=/Mcf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T14:47:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/19bbd59b5393596349b3e561eebb7e2ba402614c","node_id":"C_kwDOTG3Rw9oAKDE5YmJkNTliNTM5MzU5NjM0OWIzZTU2MWVlYmI3ZTJiYTQwMjYxNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/2af5370749ac0d5afdb9fd57e6c8477e62f0b5c3","sha":"2af5370749ac0d5afdb9fd57e6c8477e62f0b5c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/2af5370749ac0d5afdb9fd57e6c8477e62f0b5c3"}],"sha":"19bbd59b5393596349b3e561eebb7e2ba402614c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/19bbd59b5393596349b3e561eebb7e2ba402614c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11599358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rashad","id":11599358,"login":"rashad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTk5MzU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rashad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/2af5370749ac0d5afdb9fd57e6c8477e62f0b5c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:20:53Z","email":"11599358+rashad@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rashad Karanouh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:20:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"v1.1.16 — Restore Partner slug in side panel and Notes tab (#22165)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Package version:** `1.1.16`\n\n- Adds **slug** to the Partner record-page `FIELDS_WIDGET` view so it\nappears in the side panel for admins and partners (partners remain\nupdate-locked on slug via `partner.role.ts`).\n- Restores the **Notes** tab on the custom Partner `RECORD_PAGE` layout\n— the marketplace v2 layout replaced the platform default but only\nincluded Home + Timeline.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `yarn lint` in `packages/twenty-apps/internal/twenty-partners` — 0\nerrors\n- [ ] `yarn twenty dev --once` on a local partners workspace — sync\nsucceeds\n- [ ] Admin: open a Partner record full page → slug visible under Name\nin side panel; **Notes** tab present and can create a linked note\n- [ ] Partner role (My Profile): slug visible, not editable; Notes tab\nworks\n- [ ] After merge: `deploy` + `install` on prod partners workspace\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22165?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"40883d25e5c43fe98612a691c71f0fb24587fd42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/40883d25e5c43fe98612a691c71f0fb24587fd42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/2af5370749ac0d5afdb9fd57e6c8477e62f0b5c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 40883d25e5c43fe98612a691c71f0fb24587fd42\nparent 1284099940ae29e63c98923a2bc33ee7f7c9f476\nauthor Rashad Karanouh <11599358+rashad@users.noreply.github.com> 1782386453 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782386453 +0200\n\nv1.1.16 — Restore Partner slug in side panel and Notes tab (#22165)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Package version:** `1.1.16`\n\n- Adds **slug** to the Partner record-page `FIELDS_WIDGET` view so it\nappears in the side panel for admins and partners (partners remain\nupdate-locked on slug via `partner.role.ts`).\n- Restores the **Notes** tab on the custom Partner `RECORD_PAGE` layout\n— the marketplace v2 layout replaced the platform default but only\nincluded Home + Timeline.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `yarn lint` in `packages/twenty-apps/internal/twenty-partners` — 0\nerrors\n- [ ] `yarn twenty dev --once` on a local partners workspace — sync\nsucceeds\n- [ ] Admin: open a Partner record full page → slug visible under Name\nin side panel; **N