ithub.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/a20ebfa8807ee2abbef3f6e35242cc6191e04fed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:29:45Z","email":"martmull@hotmail.fr","name":"martmull"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:29:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(applications): remove the application custom settings tab (#22156)\n\n## Summary\n\nRemoves the application **custom settings tab** feature. This is one\nhalf of #22059, split out so it can be reviewed/merged independently\nfrom the variable-types enrichment.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Remove the `SettingsApplicationCustomTab` component and its tab\nentry/rendering in `SettingsApplicationDetails`.\n- Stop syncing `settingsCustomTabFrontComponent` from application\nmanifests — `ApplicationManifestMigrationService` now only syncs the\ndefault role.\n- Deprecate the now-unused fields (kept for backward compatibility, no\nlonger read or synced):\n- `ApplicationDTO.settingsCustomTabFrontComponentId` (GraphQL\n`@deprecated`)\n-\n`ApplicationManifest.settingsCustomTabFrontComponentUniversalIdentifier`\n- the `settingsCustomTabFrontComponentId` column comment on\n`ApplicationEntity`\n\nThe DB column is intentionally **not dropped**, so existing\ninstallations upgrade cleanly.","tree":{"sha":"9f903979c97074ea95f6186cd61402c9e48af403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/9f903979c97074ea95f6186cd61402c9e48af403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/a20ebfa8807ee2abbef3f6e35242cc6191e04fed","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f903979c97074ea95f6186cd61402c9e48af403\nparent 5a657129f01f19ddfcc0b2d24b9e08b93d9242ef\nauthor martmull <martmull@hotmail.fr> 1782383385 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782383385 +0200\n\nfeat(applications): remove the application custom settings tab (#22156)\n\n## Summary\n\nRemoves the application **custom settings tab** feature. This is one\nhalf of #22059, split out so it can be reviewed/merged independently\nfrom the variable-types enrichment.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Remove the `SettingsApplicationCustomTab` component and its tab\nentry/rendering in `SettingsApplicationDetails`.\n- Stop syncing `settingsCustomTabFrontComponent` from application\nmanifests — `ApplicationManifestMigrationService` now only syncs the\ndefault role.\n- Deprecate the now-unused fields (kept for backward compatibility, no\nlonger read or synced):\n- `ApplicationDTO.settingsCustomTabFrontComponentId` (GraphQL\n`@deprecated`)\n-\n`ApplicationManifest.settingsCustomTabFrontComponentUniversalIdentifier`\n- the `settingsCustomTabFrontComponentId` column comment on\n`ApplicationEntity`\n\nThe DB column is intentionally **not dropped**, so existing\ninstallations upgrade cleanly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPQMZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX3IQAHbsgnzL9Av4FAyZBIOIZPhy\nAmWUb+NuoZusz0SP6Iai+Hzoo/SwskS0MnnQ2Exbpl/YlOxvr9uHDZNjwQZtrVii\njIWdhZcBRcIswnisvsx0MsY7wqtLu4m0pS3RpBZTQ+52GG55cXuhHcnFp5lUlz7h\ne45fBWJHq2cLVA66kKgxCEHITzAtmitEt00XgZYX2iyUWQcgRTyMQM2Q2xA4Hjox\nO7/qUJv7T3BNfSPNEpiE2GuGVt4AQmN212XmGUmop4kSjbBXleVu0nQAQ80HYQ/t\nkhjJ7PmOC+megaJrNz32aPaywGDfH5cWUerwuF4d/ojhIY7/P1LvZim2Id6bfbX5\n736fqpXedwfLb6Eu+QrrzQMajfcsqc6JUZgy7stXW5hhK5uthH3+PLoghECOyfSb\n2jPv5pI41dZKkpcpgSh5xAt7ob1hwORF1xrq4G7a063m7/zNFvSDR/5poskwQvk2\n2S58awAH5s6kVAgjQT+HiwTKtmOJqnawvuApLu8/f1Y8964d9ZHzgjxdSNLeXEUU\nsJZUgNmfrAgevqlVNKFfcORtbrft1031paP9YNL1lfL3v74Qm1fqnRZzGpxO9yNV\njMov62Kz+LXTqjgZ+kUnx9JcqZ9c121c8QHFQnuwQ93PUvxsgv8RGYp8QdUH2yWG\n9KU7Sz3JSA6y7BP8VEYp\n=zuqD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T14:47:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/a20ebfa8807ee2abbef3f6e35242cc6191e04fed","node_id":"C_kwDOTG3Rw9oAKGEyMGViZmE4ODA3ZWUyYWJiZWYzZjZlMzUyNDJjYzYxOTFlMDRmZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commit/5a657129f01f19ddfcc0b2d24b9e08b93d9242ef","sha":"5a657129f01f19ddfcc0b2d24b9e08b93d9242ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/5a657129f01f19ddfcc0b2d24b9e08b93d9242ef"}],"sha":"a20ebfa8807ee2abbef3f6e35242cc6191e04fed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/a20ebfa8807ee2abbef3f6e35242cc6191e04fed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/commits/5a657129f01f19ddfcc0b2d24b9e08b93d9242ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:24:22Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:24:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Split website stepper into home-stepper and product-stepper sections (#22149)\n\nReorganizes the flat `sections/stepper/` (30 files — two distinct\nsteppers plus shared code) into two product-feature-style sections, and\nmoves the shared code to the shared layers.\n\n- **`sections/home-stepper/`** — the home-page stepper. Renamed\n`Stepper` → `HomeStepper` (and the home components → `HomeStepperLottie`\n/ `HomeStepperSteps` / `HomeStepperVisualFrame`) for symmetry with\n`ProductStepper`. Shell at the root + `components/`/`data/`/`utils/` +\nbarrel.\n- **`sections/product-stepper/`** — the product-page stepper, same\nstructure.\n\nThe 3 files both steppers shared can''t live in a shared *section* —\n`check-conventions` forbids a section importing another section. So they\nmoved to the shared layers:\n- `StepperProgressRail`, `StepperSwipeDeck` → `ui/`\n- `useBreakpointStepSync` → `platform/motion`\n\nBoth consumer pages repointed (`@/sections/home-stepper`,\n`@/sections/product-stepper`); the row-gap allowlist in\n`check-conventions.mjs` updated to the new paths; explanatory comments\nstripped across the moved files (CSS-in-template comments and `''use\nclient''` kept).\n\nPure reorganization — no behavior change. typecheck + lint + build all\ngreen.","tree":{"sha":"b28020a1878365582c73a40d96cae8963f4383f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/trees/b28020a1878365582c73a40d96cae8963f4383f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vaishnav1906/IDDA-CRM/git/commits/5a657129f01f19ddfcc0b2d24b9e08b93d9242ef","verification":{"payload":"tree b28020a1878365582c73a40d96cae8963f4383f2\nparent 904d3d6bff656bb480d1729af6459a906d37e86e\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1782383062 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782383062 +0200\n\nSplit website stepper into home-stepper and product-stepper sections (#22149)\n\nReorganizes the flat `sections/stepper/` (30 files — two distinct\nsteppers plus shared code) into two product-feature-style sections, and\nmoves the shared code to the shared layers.\n\n- **`sections/home-stepper/`** — the home-page stepper. Renamed\n`Stepper` → `HomeStepper` (and the home components → `HomeStepperLottie`\n/ `HomeStepperSteps` / `HomeStepperVisualFrame`) for symmetry with\n`ProductStepper`. Shell at the root + `components/`/`data/`/`utils/` +\nbarrel.\n- **`sections/product-stepper/`** — the product-page stepper, same\nstructure.\n\nThe 3 files both steppers shared can''t live in a shared *section* —\n`check-conventions` forbids a section importing another section. So they\nmoved to the shared layers:\n- `StepperProgressRail`, `StepperSwipeDeck` → `ui/`\n- `useBreakpointStepSync` → `platform/motion`\n\nBoth consumer pages repointed (`@/sections/home-stepper`,\n`@/sections/product-stepper`); the row-gap allowlist in\n`check-conventions.mjs` updated to the new paths; explanatory comments\nstripped across the moved files (CSS-in-template comments and `''use\nclient''` kept).\n\nPure reorganization — no behavior change. typecheck + lint + build all\ngreen.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPQHWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdrcQAKM3eUhHvyNV64oyZZkc+0sS\nl9Nw/b4L58estZum+HWlNg64ntOf5XJVuPekSLdOa6kjVoqjYAfJ45omcxZ0QTQr\nDF8UMhW5V1a7K5oW7Gai06sRvDoNorTitIVmPKpBGLyxeOOLHhnVN21MU6bdBLRD\nUZt8hgo