ithub.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/62d2cc1e6105c3f60b85c447aae0a2d797f36402"}],"sha":"1b063fbc6013e5ab3335fab20349b337d6a4f161","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/1b063fbc6013e5ab3335fab20349b337d6a4f161"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/62d2cc1e6105c3f60b85c447aae0a2d797f36402/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:05:18Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:05:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add evidence-gated NeurIPS research execution plan (#86)\n\n* docs: add NeurIPS research execution plan\n\n* docs: cite venue dates, fix split claims, relocate research plan\n\nAddresses review feedback and verification gaps in the NeurIPS execution\nplan:\n\n- Cite the ICLR 2027 call for papers for the September 2026 deadline that\n  rules the venue out, instead of asserting an uncited date.\n- Note that E&D is a recent rename of the Datasets and Benchmarks track,\n  so Gate 0 must re-verify the track name as well as the dates.\n- Stop asserting an official split for CODE-ACCORD, which does not\n  publish one; require a frozen split (official where published,\n  preregistered otherwise) in the suite table, the source ledger, Gate 0,\n  and the definition of done.\n- Add the open-access CODE-ACCORD preprint alongside the paywalled\n  Scientific Data article, and record its corpus size as a guardrail\n  against resting a claim on a small corpus.\n- Flag DeonticBench as a 2026 preprint whose artifacts, license, and\n  official scoring must be confirmed before it counts as a core family.\n- Move the plan to docs/research/ so the repository root keeps matching\n  docs/STRUCTURE.md, update the layout map, and repoint the\n  implementation-seam links.\n- Fence the two indented code blocks to match the repository''s Markdown\n  style.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdc299a25a8cfdbe1dd3d1ec39eb9d26ed092f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/cdc299a25a8cfdbe1dd3d1ec39eb9d26ed092f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/62d2cc1e6105c3f60b85c447aae0a2d797f36402","verification":{"payload":"tree cdc299a25a8cfdbe1dd3d1ec39eb9d26ed092f10\nparent 5179de7cdfab4182eea1c0964ee319db7d2add1a\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1787137518 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787137518 -0700\n\ndocs: add evidence-gated NeurIPS research execution plan (#86)\n\n* docs: add NeurIPS research execution plan\n\n* docs: cite venue dates, fix split claims, relocate research plan\n\nAddresses review feedback and verification gaps in the NeurIPS execution\nplan:\n\n- Cite the ICLR 2027 call for papers for the September 2026 deadline that\n  rules the venue out, instead of asserting an uncited date.\n- Note that E&D is a recent rename of the Datasets and Benchmarks track,\n  so Gate 0 must re-verify the track name as well as the dates.\n- Stop asserting an official split for CODE-ACCORD, which does not\n  publish one; require a frozen split (official where published,\n  preregistered otherwise) in the suite table, the source ledger, Gate 0,\n  and the definition of done.\n- Add the open-access CODE-ACCORD preprint alongside the paywalled\n  Scientific Data article, and record its corpus size as a guardrail\n  against resting a claim on a small corpus.\n- Flag DeonticBench as a 2026 preprint whose artifacts, license, and\n  official scoring must be confirmed before it counts as a core family.\n- Move the plan to docs/research/ so the repository root keeps matching\n  docs/STRUCTURE.md, update the layout map, and repoint the\n  implementation-seam links.\n- Fence the two indented code blocks to match the repository''s Markdown\n  style.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhY3uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHIYQAHA9SaR57EnmhEXSdMas3KfT\nm7a5yo8aD/TdBJsUUhGL4SrKvvs2YG99q3rbQlMA/oaQnYmIFN9HLBLsIMSPtzii\n93vtKQNpu7lgJcwzTOtu5SVJxvd/1dOlZWraescmxhI7Ag16/t5BfKbL5Lst17OG\nYwBraCOeoHgdq+suxaLqOKkODcJa+oeG/Wl6kDh92JM9xSDxeHh61xIN8LtOnS9h\n7/8e6v4Z2syVj1100x4IoFi67glUVw/sp41bsP9GzL25X1VDUzBObz/sPndn6AA+\nZ1tOUSBJilpbRuYbTaXtKrePCAfvdsvWUsxNZoBbxlCRTbTJRO6jBUqz2Yfn59R4\ntcRQ+VFeXROxtIs2la+ZsBa3tSksOJg/A0p/ssMZ1//mIXQn3+1KhPTlvY7VBvY1\nTywk/huOkkkeScvX4yHsnPSSPpUw2vy/NZ4846j/AAXsoB7YoPTpZU3/91l7pKu0\nHTRJjy1ny92YeiSu3IYlMEvBqCOSt3oHWjcYZA2qkfPV/AEwCCtz5fsj57I/qqmH\nv1qcmtbEO0ZxtchOFUv+3FoxZVhBFVNTFaJsKA55eMmwgrcpdE4A9p73o/hDIzI6\nKXp/BcFhSLy13E1FoBWYNsq8BaLplAvDcjfjiR6x4WHORIoxViUbdaUY2uRcA/Q+\