himi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/fd642d70a22fbb209b48165985c992d8635ba0d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKGZkNjQyZDcwYTIyZmJiMjA5YjQ4MTY1OTg1Yzk5MmQ4NjM1YmEwZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/416c05fb4e063d9fcdead57dbd61bd2384d75731","sha":"416c05fb4e063d9fcdead57dbd61bd2384d75731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/416c05fb4e063d9fcdead57dbd61bd2384d75731"}],"sha":"fd642d70a22fbb209b48165985c992d8635ba0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/fd642d70a22fbb209b48165985c992d8635ba0d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/416c05fb4e063d9fcdead57dbd61bd2384d75731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T17:28:04Z","email":"reza.rahimi.cs@gmail.com","name":"rrahimi-uci"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T17:28:04Z","email":"reza.rahimi.cs@gmail.com","name":"rrahimi-uci"},"message":"ci: bound artifact retention so uploads stop filling the shared quota\n\nNone of the five upload-artifact steps set retention-days, so all defaulted to\n90 days. At ~3.9 MB per run that accumulated to 419.2 MB across 548 unexpired\nartifacts (~108 runs) -- and because GitHub Actions meters artifact storage per\nACCOUNT rather than per repository, that consumed 84% of the 500 MB Free\nallowance and blocked artifact uploads in this account''s other repositories with\n\"Failed to CreateArtifact: Artifact storage quota has been hit\".\n\nRetention now reflects what each artifact is for:\n\n  allure-pipeline / allure-explorer / allure-shell / allure-pipeline-ui -> 1 day\n      These are inputs to the allure-report job in the SAME run (it declares\n      needs: on all four and downloads allure-*), so they have no value once the\n      report renders.\n  allure-report -> 14 days\n      The rendered report is the artifact a human actually reads.\n\nSteady state becomes roughly 2.4 MB x 14d for the report plus ~1.5 MB of\nsame-day inputs, instead of unbounded 90-day growth.\n\nThe existing 419.2 MB backlog was cleared separately (542 artifacts dated\n2026-06 to 2026-07 deleted, newest render of each group kept), taking the account\nfrom 474.6 MB to 59.2 MB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e910366692a1c739f4ed7362c42b1a2c8b96904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/1e910366692a1c739f4ed7362c42b1a2c8b96904"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/416c05fb4e063d9fcdead57dbd61bd2384d75731","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/follo