s: add suite-shell README; document the frontend code-splitting (#24)\n\nBrings the docs current with this session''s work and fills the one app that had\nno README.\n\n- New apps/shell/README.md: what the suite shell is, how to run it, the dev\n  proxy map (verified against vite.config.ts), how it embeds the pipeline/\n  explorer/assistant micro-frontends, its routes, structure, and the\n  code-splitting performance characteristics.\n- apps/pipeline/ui/README.md + docs/ARCHITECTURE.md: document the production\n  build''s route-level lazy loading and manualChunks vendor/markdown splitting\n  (added in the page-load perf work).\n- README.md: link the new shell README from the Documentation table.\n\nValidated: no brand markers; all internal links resolve; shell proxy paths and\nports match vite.config.ts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b546d976745a7fa7d9f063a9465057c4b58477ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/b546d976745a7fa7d9f063a9465057c4b58477ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/54474e1e9be93b73db095d21e557503b99d863a9","verification":{"payload":"tree b546d976745a7fa7d9f063a9465057c4b58477ed\nparent a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1782783916 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782783916 -0700\n\ndocs: add suite-shell README; document the frontend code-splitting (#24)\n\nBrings the docs current with this session''s work and fills the one app that had\nno README.\n\n- New apps/shell/README.md: what the suite shell is, how to run it, the dev\n  proxy map (verified against vite.config.ts), how it embeds the pipeline/\n  explorer/assistant micro-frontends, its routes, structure, and the\n  code-splitting performance characteristics.\n- apps/pipeline/ui/README.md + docs/ARCHITECTURE.md: document the production\n  build''s route-level lazy loading and manualChunks vendor/markdown splitting\n  (added in the page-load perf work).\n- README.md: link the new shell README from the Documentation table.\n\nValidated: no brand markers; all internal links resolve; shell proxy paths and\nports match vite.config.ts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQx+sCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnsAQAJPhWUIxbgZQJeEU6OtqHIm2\nCksRs3MHri43S8+hFSwypFhpVLnaEMgp76eBji5T6KH1CeC6L/jlAQbB3XqGp1UV\npcZecH+71b8i9S/4W3vqXqjzO8ezXKRGk6cWnNA5zLU9CvvaRDQlm0HQ0rHZ6HWG\nmzPhW6GdKDYZq60btHFgCIjzAJrakWFbVExn79auwAPGQLM/Op7sSkrOS31VGAxU\nLn2YCrvMRAL0xbo956hBQboqvzkOHljM7ASA6aVlWxhu9l+sGVKwZp36UyAeAFGt\nLAF4gNqogxYJny2beVPB7n8Gmt1Ak6V/iRDZuz12oECTfNnXc513C7OW0M7dSRj4\ncE0MBLhdIyTKOfegug+Rz1yrJjyyD5YMP9Soqkp3XlYdztQK5Wdyf7l9o4xL6nkh\njfumShJ4nXg0hC6IjVyyyohqi1P1RhxglumTLZQgStmqHpsR3ZDpttsGy/x/tkGh\ngaIlNjS1V9m7plrhxz6qp652x0NB00iUwKg0b877EIWR407Ob+qdeXNI8yRv2/XV\njeCgu95CwwoDmDmMlKqUaEisxzMFW+86lj4tF1uF60yG7OtVemFwMCTMJkO2/2P1\nsOZq3K1s+U5RDGJiV1h0syhDFyqXVUU83TNv0J+sQHjFZu+EYYjMYnBV3s7uD/Qo\now98HGauNO60fGSyVnSL\n=1bh+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-30T01:45:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/54474e1e9be93b73db095d21e557503b99d863a9","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKDU0NDc0ZTFlOWJlOTNiNzNkYjA5NWQyMWU1NTc1MDNiOTlkODYzYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445","sha":"a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445"}],"sha":"54474e1e9be93b73db095d21e557503b99d863a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/54474e1e9be93b73db095d21e557503b99d863a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:15:01Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:15:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(ui): code-split routes and isolate vendor chunks for faster page loads (#23)\n\nBoth React apps shipped a single eager bundle that loaded every page (and its\nheavy libs) up front — pipeline-UI 570 kB (166 kB gz), shell 377 kB (107 kB gz).\n\n- Route-level code splitting via React.lazy + Suspense in both App.tsx: each\n  page now loads only when first navigated to.\n- manualChunks isolates the framework (react/react-dom/react-router) into one\n  long-lived, cache-friendly chunk, and in pipeline-UI splits the heavy\n  markdown/syntax-highlighting stack into its own chunk that loads only on the\n  Documents/Prompts routes (not the landing Dashboard).\n\nResult: pipeline-UI initial JS ~166 kB → ~85 kB gz (markdown 47 kB gz deferred);\nshell pages load on demand with the framework cached separately. The >500 kB\nchunk-size warning is gone. Tests green (shell 50, pipeline-UI 29); builds pass.\n\nNote: react-force-graph-2d/force-graph are unused (the Explorer page embeds the\ngraph explorer via iframe), so they were already tree-shaken out — left in\npackage.json for now; removable in a separate cleanup.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b2d56590e76546026cd070bf9314dada18ec48d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/1b2d56590e76546026cd070bf9314dada18ec48d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b2d56590e76546026cd070bf9314dada18ec48d\nparent ad046075d11b28b57d4db4b04897eeb4f93b3fa5\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1782782101 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782782101 -0700\n\nperf(ui): code-split routes and isolate vendor chunks for faster page loads (#23)\n\nBoth React apps shipped a single eager bundle that loaded every page (and its\nheavy libs) up front — pipeline-UI 570 kB (166 kB gz), shell 377 kB (107 kB gz).\n\n- Route-level code splitting via React.lazy + Suspense in both App.tsx: each\n  page now loads only when first navigated to.\n- manualChunks isolates the framework (react/react-dom/react-router) into one\n  long-lived, cache-friendly chunk, and in pipeline-UI splits the heavy\n  markdown/syntax-highlighting stack into its own chunk that loads only on the\n  Documents/Prompts routes (not the landing Dashboard).\n\nResult: pipeline-UI initial JS ~166 kB → ~85 kB gz (markdown 47 kB gz deferred);\nshell pages load on demand with the framework cached separately. The >500 kB\nchunk-size warning is gone. Tests green (shell 50, pipeline-UI 29); builds pass.\n\nNote: react-force-graph-2d/force-graph are unused (the Explorer page embeds the\ngraph explorer via iframe), so they were already tree-shaken out — left in\npackage.json for now; removable in a separate cleanup.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQxiVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJbsQAIovgnI0HwhvWNBTDhxffcUu\nGRuNvwuX0veGRdnGdrZERT0+Iw8ef1HE5hWd2xkhPA6Q6sYJv5e34bxo8wWWTLd7\nEU7lAVa0RDW67v4fkCyloUsGGoWb81GDgAgEd/p2KyI9A4VQlHSRi+mAJXGN/Dup\nJzsbF8c29mYhRaEuc+fDPxM8dSCb3CLOG/2IoTJV+Nk1RUXdaxfq6HUZq7gyUGSm\nr8eU9W9DqFesZjHjNT33c1H0emGN5x9RP5R+gplHGlS2CDm7zzxWjILk6XFQCdPq\nJw/kUdZJB9Co1lE4Lq2csuE9TYDkXtZUZEGFOqmkp+SnJDeJH7Hj0u0HCqv3TzSw\nhQYhCggF/ahgR8awHmXuTvP4+c5iBk9HOmo7gBSkyCGo6XWYNpN60Mx1vUsK8bEE\n96ZzCm3QtLSBpEA5WVJqZJykGyVUu/l+/gRf7bUVPWEuwFWUh/wTgfI7MmCkMeZ0\nXRu9A7syCyOHsI2M6ZvTe0kEp0H8mwoPEmz9Amf2qkGQRGrut/AKYzUaD8sh+l7k\nZ1hdzXZrcqIYc/QFYPAGIxaoSojJXdsgmSoGJQrpvNisJkS9vTPkPxOrGf9kMAYz\nALEG88vbOg6K44KnIucZVN7XsTI/abH/2Kg5LYkDECYAGJXBya813hXH3O0A+U+z\n0ZcN2FjAdJj+hR4rTPDf\n=6bvU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-30T01:15:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKGEyNjE4MWJkOTVmZTU1OGQ1Yzc2NzljNTI1OThmMDJmNWYwY2U0NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/ad046075d11b28b57d4db4b04897eeb4f93b3fa5","sha":"ad046075d11b28b57d4db4b04897eeb4f93b3fa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/ad046075d11b28b57d4db4b04897eeb4f93b3fa5"}],"sha":"a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/a26181bd95fe558d5c7679c52598f02f5f0ce445"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/ad046075d11b28b57d4db4b04897eeb4f93b3fa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:50:31Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:50:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(pipeline-cli): report the real _merged/ output path; correct --workers help (#22)\n\nTwo CLI inaccuracies surfaced during the docs validation pass:\n\n- compare.py printed and built its summary output path under `_joined/`, but\n  agents 7-10 (e.g. agent_10 SetOperationsVisualizer) write under\n  `_merged/<subfolder>/`. The reported \"Output Location\" and the\n  file://.../index.html link therefore pointed at a directory that is never\n  created. Point both at `_merged/` to match the agents. Guarded by\n  tests/test_compare_output_path.py.\n- extract.py''s --workers help (and the docstring) claimed \"default: 20\", but the\n  flag defaults to None and each agent falls back to the configured\n  pipeline.max_workers (30). Corrected the help text to state the real default.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce53fa9f02dcda9ac628f179b854c9b9efd49b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/ce53fa9f02dcda9ac628f179b854c9b9efd49b48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/ad046075d11b28b57d4db4b04897eeb4f93b3fa5","verification":{"payload":"tree ce53fa9f02dcda9ac628f179b854c9b9efd49b48\nparent 0903368d813ca81e4dc1ed817b14d2fe5f9bc7f1\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1782780631 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782780631 -0700\n\nfix(pipeline-cli): report the real _merged/ output path; correct --workers help (#22)\n\nTwo CLI inaccuracies surfaced during the docs validation pass:\n\n- compare.py printed and built its summary output path under `_joined/`, but\n  agents 7-10 (e.g. agent_10 SetOperationsVisualizer) write under\n  `_merged/<subfolder>/`. The reported \"Output Location\" and the\n  file://.../index.html link therefore pointed at a directory that is never\n  created. Point both at `_merged/` to match the agents. Guarded by\n  tests/test_compare_output_path.py.\n- extract.py''s --workers help (and the docstring) claimed \"default: 20\", but the\n  flag defaults to None and each agent falls back to the configured\n  pipeline.max_workers (30). Corrected the help text to state the real default.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQxLXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjuoQAK5sJ1tRoK25qCurdtwxeb7z\nAj19PEZ9BrOoKE60ljC5bGnsrcAn2VpsTa6ucRHCsmYWTgk3HtcKrajIs9JWVkv5\nqwhbqFFEKHRgnx/KSPtWsRjR/7JC2XenG2ggn8Q5WIJoYPgU8gQS/YwqApxIqYRt\nXAwjnh5wHbgD5yX47F+Y2BeyHWIz3KaTAy7f1n5Yb4IFl8S7u785yjqv/7cAUyb4\nNpdz8dpsHrn8VdSHCkibq2cg/xYuYmqR9sdhjOlKhP8ZBt1ulWxwAFtri04C8b+P\nbU2nRIgyYowKkjuvYAMfsZABMcIz5rALTDN4OY+V3YI6iHiuX8wpigREKexRn9Bg\n8mJy4/JWp9dimJKdQiwwZ4WQyNeDlGqw+qPNeX8wnuInPgniiQPUlAs/lRUYDzKf\nD5yPkcMaiZc94cAUJ2mhw7hileH86JL2XPDwQKEyO+QLwzSU+0vMuN5aqtGtTvZ2\n4yEJRuf+hfqc/jcT5IBIGSYc99/hYrBYq1Th400RMYOkub3l0zAENGPV3EfW8QvJ\noh0Px5Et4bz+f5cbYz34GPfsESKu6H2