.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/186ffeb7c0356abeb183a8f976833f35b43c4a93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:54:30Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:54:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: overhaul all documentation — accurate, consistent, professional (#14)\n\nFull pass over every Markdown/HTML doc (24 files, net -880 lines) to make them\ncorrect, clean, and beautiful. Fixes accumulated staleness and removes\nfabricated content.\n\nCorrections (verified against the code):\n- CLI: every reference uses cli/extract.py (agents 1-6) and cli/compare.py\n  (agents 7-10) — the old knowledge_graph_generation.py / join_graphs.py names\n  are gone everywhere (incl. DOCKER/ARCHITECTURE diagrams and volume mounts).\n- Tests: e2etests/ -> tests/integration/, uitests/ -> tests/e2e/ (CONTRIBUTING,\n  explorer READMEs) with short \"renamed from\" notes; pytest tests/ unit layout.\n- Paths: pre-reorg cd assistant|frontend|pipeline -> apps/* throughout\n  (README, docs/index.html service-start block, CONTRIBUTING).\n- OpenAI-only: removed all litellm/Anthropic mentions; model tables reflect\n  config.json (reasoning/optimizer gpt-5.2, embeddings text-embedding-ada-002),\n  noted Settings-UI configurability.\n- Ports/flags: Explorer :5000 -> :5050 fallback noted; --fresh/--clean\n  attributed to the explorer launcher (root start.sh has neither).\n- Removed invented APIs, functions, metrics, ROI/cost models, and testimonials;\n  neutralized real institution names to domain terms (mortgage/aml/healthcare/\n  commercial_lending). No brand names (cortex/jazzx) remain.\n\nBeautification:\n- README: centered header, badges, what-it-does, tables, doc map.\n- docs/ Pages site uses the p2k brand logo; consistent tables + mermaid diagrams\n  across architecture/product docs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c4d93162d810ab31c8cb8bf7859ec3b63fc6888","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/6c4d93162d810ab31c8cb8bf7859ec3b63fc6888"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/186ffeb7c0356abeb183a8f976833f35b43c4a93","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c4d93162d810ab31c8cb8bf7859ec3b63fc6888\nparent f00e6025a8cc19f84a3549f05dd34a255d6a9bf2\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1782741270 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782741270 -0700\n\ndocs: overhaul all documentation — accurate, consistent, professional (#14)\n\nFull pass over every Markdown/HTML doc (24 files, net -880 lines) to make them\ncorrect, clean, and beautiful. Fixes accumulated staleness and removes\nfabricated content.\n\nCorrections (verified against the code):\n- CLI: every reference uses cli/extract.py (agents 1-6) and cli/compare.py\n  (agents 7-10) — the old knowledge_graph_generation.py / join_graphs.py names\n  are gone everywhere (incl. DOCKER/ARCHITECTURE diagrams and volume mounts).\n- Tests: e2etests/ -> tests/integration/, uitests/ -> tests/e2e/ (CONTRIBUTING,\n  explorer READMEs) with short \"renamed from\" notes; pytest tests/ unit layout.\n- Paths: pre-reorg cd assistant|frontend|pipeline -> apps/* throughout\n  (README, docs/index.html service-start block, CONTRIBUTING).\n- OpenAI-only: removed all litellm/Anthropic mentions; model tables reflect\n  config.json (reasoning/optimizer gpt-5.2, embeddings text-embedding-ada-002),\n  noted Settings-UI configurability.\n- Ports/flags: Explorer :5000 -> :5050 fallback noted; --fresh/--clean\n  attributed to the explorer launcher (root start.sh has neither).\n- Removed invented APIs, functions, metrics, ROI/cost models, and testimonials;\n  neutralized real institution names to domain terms (mortgage/aml/healthcare/\n  commercial_lending). No brand names (cortex/jazzx) remain.\n\nBeautification:\n- README: centered header, badges, what-it-does, tables, doc map.\n- docs/ Pages site uses the p2k brand logo; consistent tables + mermaid diagrams\n  across architecture/product docs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQnkWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC0UQAAOiKlPe8RopWnXEpxtXfGaC\nl0keh0HckazRl1y825hufOtr+BpsxML+lT0jYSQgbazmI0JqCbhZ/sUBeHne9Pcu\nzbsDO/nsMrzKRVDVH44I8vJUbBLtg77H8Gqr7gwfBh2tBDktm/iIyGDuFeJgCS83\nJpcDfiWnlfDOkniKK3rS9kRINHj+zVEfIfNQkN2j194gYEtbIfGoXMhKlENJPhjt\ndK3Q4CaEEk25iPuq0GVS19G+0FmE+Cc6y2cUtu4G15J/Y28fgNB7clCIT7w/Tv7o\nVW2sPJwChY37D/I0L+TVMBSMnlW+mkJPXD1WEWWuL+eNFvrnVKPjrhhNz4UlEGZ/\nztR/otsYsBVejTM+3Y+DWJbfG1IH27ciQzhyF9Z7KhHQHhA0sAtJz7Am76ZBsxjY\nlTVca3P5PFmatZQZPFzMQ/7Y/0vpysMHXyf7VHlE8o9NQkH9XlYamxuQIWzG/X2D\nGikoNebPvSQtocMxCpv31wgLzjO2SZV65eY4f8k5qF90nRgYRBxuDjaY+tMTyreM\nYSCojo6nywwiFz6T2mHJJvzcdIoekRDBy86QVDsIyQhrbiJ66ZttBhFIRkYtcv2z\nwWQPd5Pk8yLhjAw1AE/dITnG0BaTg56W33ErKItTaPj7bbp6OJwS85Lrg4mxLKKp\noZfUqJtYQDs1zkBJmnvd\n=GRnv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-29T13:54:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":