_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/f96d80e2d3c9f5577da9edc71b6162f444824d28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T04:16:18Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T04:16:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shell): shrink shell fonts 15% + point Assistant iframe at the right port (#11)\n\nTwo issues seen in the suite shell''s Assistant + Settings views:\n\n1. Fonts too large — the shell sets its own base `html { font-size: 15.36px }`\n   (~96% of default), independent of the Explorer''s 15% reduction. Lower it to\n   13.06px (a further 15%), which scales all Tailwind rem fonts in the shell\n   (SuiteSettings, the Assistant page chrome, sidebar, etc.).\n\n2. Assistant page loaded the wrong origin — it iframes VITE_CA_URL, which\n   defaults to http://localhost:5000/app/. When CA_PORT is overridden (5000 is\n   taken by Docker/AirPlay on macOS, so the Explorer runs on 5050), the iframe\n   pointed at the wrong port. start.sh now exports VITE_CA_URL derived from the\n   resolved CA_PORT/URL_PREFIX so the embedded Assistant always targets the\n   running Explorer.","tree":{"sha":"a16e07fdb41fd7161671e5ed8282c30082ab2d32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/a16e07fdb41fd7161671e5ed8282c30082ab2d32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/f96d80e2d3c9f5577da9edc71b6162f444824d28","verification":{"payload":"tree a16e07fdb41fd7161671e5ed8282c30082ab2d32\nparent 7c96bd08fe52d99ec510cc7ea2ad66bd98845894\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1782706578 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782706578 -0700\n\nfix(shell): shrink shell fonts 15% + point Assistant iframe at the right port (#11)\n\nTwo issues seen in the suite shell''s Assistant + Settings views:\n\n1. Fonts too large — the shell sets its own base `html { font-size: 15.36px }`\n   (~96% of default), independent of the Explorer''s 15% reduction. Lower it to\n   13.06px (a further 15%), which scales all Tailwind rem fonts in the shell\n   (SuiteSettings, the Assistant page chrome, sidebar, etc.).\n\n2. Assistant page loaded the wrong origin — it iframes VITE_CA_URL, which\n   defaults to http://localhost:5000/app/. When CA_PORT is overridden (5000 is\n   taken by Docker/AirPlay on macOS, so the Explorer runs on 5050), the iframe\n   pointed at the wrong port. start.sh now exports VITE_CA_URL derived from the\n   resolved CA_PORT/URL_PREFIX so the embedded Assistant always targets the\n   running Explorer.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQfGSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg/oQAEXlyWRmFbtfiGrmTmTW6rfs\niGviYXRvPmAEZNSDVfWkr7ZnfAHjF+7ZisBK853nns9mpYa0mk5N9hDVWZ/vDXk3\n7lc3p7BbpFtqPvO7ccsExZsSQN2vBD/J/NtzgMWw+TRgINfbU2VXkvbgsMe6iAOg\nhiUs9p9wSxBWUNMXE3h8F3k9jacqOcdYRAgDZTPTQuHR6NmEOryLVL3qCZ9WD3nq\nUaFGrRMNJ71gvb7xEEO1UDGnNJvWlPe1ja44DgNRNNhbPVEmPJQRK3C0WNzUhJj0\nld7pUvMzjr1f5RAyydOLnSDkKyrXRUj1w2+nZYBfXeHSVwsgBYXhWTeG+UYoOAUJ\nLhc3Jxt/GcRtGAe4WWIqD8AaeewQv9bui1LhqeQ1ibmdXGpURjN6Av320t0RyhHA\nJmqDBD1nIDRBbEioq6STVlwCvQFLQYtTw8Twzwz8ZKH2edbglMzGQZJESIbNZB8l\nkTlzSLBE1VQCxPP3FKGGMqBOGPavE8fhUy4aZpIjKHnecA0fSLbhcZY5tYPvoA6F\n30eHP8qh2JdcD9TBTQtsl+fiI1uy4E+N+QnFP+qAhR9GMJoES4dQOpFBrtit3Y4B\n