/github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/7c96bd08fe52d99ec510cc7ea2ad66bd98845894","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKDdjOTZiZDA4ZmU1MmQ5OWVjNTEwY2M3ZWEyYWQ2NmJkOTg4NDU4OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/6faf6525e2eaebd5e9cc91b5493c3b1c88c4045a","sha":"6faf6525e2eaebd5e9cc91b5493c3b1c88c4045a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/6faf6525e2eaebd5e9cc91b5493c3b1c88c4045a"}],"sha":"7c96bd08fe52d99ec510cc7ea2ad66bd98845894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/7c96bd08fe52d99ec510cc7ea2ad66bd98845894"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/6faf6525e2eaebd5e9cc91b5493c3b1c88c4045a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:58:12Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:58:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(explorer): make graph setup work without sentence-transformers (#10)\n\n`src/main.py` commands (setup, setup-if-empty, force-clean, consistency,\npost-load checks) hard-imported `src.semantic_search`, which imports\n`sentence-transformers`. When that optional dep is absent (the default in the\nshared root venv), `python -m src.main setup-if-empty` crashed on import —\n*before loading any graph data* — so `./start.sh` reported \"Graph setup check\nskipped\" and the graphs never loaded.\n\nAdd a `_semantic_engine()` helper that returns the engine or None, and guard\nevery embedding/index step. Graph schema + data loading now always run;\nembedding indexing is skipped with a warning when semantic search is off\n(mirroring the server.py + chat-tool guards already in place).","tree":{"sha":"271b7c94b210dcaa7a824570eed33de57ceaf77a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/271b7c94b210dcaa7a824570eed33de57ceaf77a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/6faf6525e2eaebd5e9cc91b5493c3b1c88c4045a","verification":{"payload":"tree 271b7c94b210dcaa7a824570eed33de57ceaf77a\nparent 8a9d852f4ba6fc0c9011cd05e4bc74bc41050287\nauthor Reza Rahimi <145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com> 1782705492 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782705492 -0700\n\nfix(explorer): make graph setup work without sentence-transformers (#10)\n\n`src/main.py` commands (setup, setup-if-empty, force-clean, consistency,\npost-load checks) hard-imported `src.semantic_search`, which imports\n`sentence-transformers`. When that optional dep is absent (the default in the\nshared root venv), `python -m src.main setup-if-empty` crashed on import —\n*before loading any graph data* — so `./start.sh` reported \"Graph setup check\nskipped\" and the graphs never loaded.\n\nAdd a `_semantic_engine()` helper that returns the engine or None, and guard\nevery embedding/index step. Graph schema + data loading now always run;\nembedding indexing is skipped with a warning when semantic search is off\n(mirroring the server.py + chat-tool guards already in place).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQe1UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiVcQADoUteDbpA18FJ2zVPClkaBQ\nQIDtYHLs6uViiTq9NAIwwt/Bzg3eiJjgBu8B+TG62YBrcGVE7R6DZNO/GGaRxy+b\nD+ErPmTdbF4wpBVlDXFmhzPXxLAf1v9brf4+vZbRRd1aJGWpuW6byoXKQK+PoTkz\nGoAibiQ/lW0JOAYKYbCumt/ct9DHI8cZs6v+84JATZeYJG832VrHg3+NxeT15lpX\nquVbexgn3THiGAYzRj4r67fJWUjtmSy1QdBNJ9qDzbMJk+bJrkbAPQVEkSNdpWQ+\nSLvir8pOwMIwORoukG5Xp1wwTd208pOyoKm2RrGVqEmd/ENlCjmfZgpua/Pj7uX2\n+ZY6QhGY1BLUiYLebvv5xXtVw4CN5SjTYOninSmK1k3tP7Iq8+FNSG55sTaUZtT3\nuJs6Q9uiRemHLOk0lFuOcDShVeUkp7Twb0oo+dyq/ZlMLaywEX7Z1xzaVuEAw9NJ\nxOSmeVQjjeEtKoRzSAejIZAZAmIShwePChZ5/+KjAplAk84ehAwGRwTKxf4j9x20\nhUHdsJ/swvkkhyS7o3zdeZOigmCSggLSCbaIcvtWZyCT/xQwLEJyr/GI/CYRU7mQ\nhegV1qVQ1S+geBwJLN8N9ACS6+UhdAXA6rCDpOjDfYMU1oyCNJfsVWeLp6cUGiZL\nWC0n1MHr2zMm6ExUoGcB\n=4DIN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-29T03:58:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","