e is unavailable (the default\nwithout sentence-transformers), the chat''s `semantic_search` and\n`cross_graph_search` tools called `_engine.search()` on None and crashed the\nwhole turn. Guard all chat/UI search paths to degrade gracefully:\n- semantic_search tool returns an \"unavailable, use text_search\" result\n- _cross_graph_semantic returns [] (so cross_graph_search still works)\n- the /suggest endpoint falls back to structural signals only\n\nLogo: replace the Explorer logo with assets/p2k.png. Serve it as logo.png\n(route + index.html favicon/header + chat avatars + fetch interceptor all\nrepointed); remove the unused logo.svg.\n\nTypography: scale the rem-based UI down 15% via `html { font-size: 85% }`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f456a04eb83b777351575f7dd3ba2d734a846295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/f456a04eb83b777351575f7dd3ba2d734a846295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/8f8baeb05f70c6e1a6e292e0afee760c88aea1f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/8f8baeb05f70c6e1a6e292e0afee760c88aea1f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKDhmOGJhZWIwNWY3MGM2ZTFhNmUyOTJlMGFmZWU3NjBjODhhZWExZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6","sha":"b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6"}],"sha":"8f8baeb05f70c6e1a6e292e0afee760c88aea1f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/8f8baeb05f70c6e1a6e292e0afee760c88aea1f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:16:58Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:16:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"config: align pipeline settings with the reference (cortex-suite) (#6)\n\nMatch the canonical agentic/pipeline/model settings from the reference project''s\nconfig so this repo runs with the same behavior:\n\n- openai.models.reasoning / optimizer: gpt-5.2 (template already had these;\n  config.py fallbacks confirmed)\n- document_organizer.chunk_size_target 1000 -> 2000, max_chunk_size 2000 -> 3000\n- pipeline.max_workers 20 -> 30\n- semantic_matcher.max_workers 20 -> 30\n- join_graphs.max_workers 15 -> 31\n- entity_extractor.n_iterations -> 3\n\nUpdated config.example.json, the matching fallback defaults in utils/config.py,\nand the pinned expectations in test_config_no_hardcoded.py.\n\nIntentionally NOT changed: the `anthropic` section stays removed (OpenAI-only),\nand domain.available keeps this project''s 4-domain superset (mortgage, aml,\nhealthcare, commercial_lending).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c719c47d6cb1dec7cd640b0851d98cb36b89eb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/1c719c47d6cb1dec7cd640b0851d98cb36b89eb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKGI4ODIyOWZkYTAwMjFlYTczNzNmNmJiYTE3NGViMTlhNThmMzE5ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981","sha":"1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981"}],"sha":"b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/b88229fda0021ea7373f6bba174eb19a58f319d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T02:35:20Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T02:35:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(explorer): skip generated Playwright report dirs in debranding scan (#4)\n\n* test(explorer): skip generated Playwright report dirs in debranding scan\n\nThe debranding scan walks the working tree and was tripping on\ntests/e2e/playwright-report/index.html — a gitignored, generated Playwright\nreport (containing brand markers from test data) left on disk after running the\ne2e suite. It is never committed, so it is out of scope for the scan.\n\nAdd `playwright-report` and `test-results` to SKIP_DIRS, consistent with the\nother generated artifact dirs already skipped (coverage-html, allure-results,\npipeline-output, …). CI was unaffected (fresh checkout has no report); this\nkeeps local `pytest` green after running e2e tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: untrack machine-specific apps/explorer/pipeline-output symlink\n\nstart.sh creates apps/explorer/pipeline-output as a runtime symlink to\napps/pipeline/pipeline-output. It was accidentally committed (with an absolute,\nmachine-specific target) and the existing `pipeline-output/` ignore rule doesn''t\nmatch a symlink. Untrack it and add an explicit .gitignore entry so the runtime\nsymlink is never re-committed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aabf660745f4db48b78a442b1497c4fc79b324f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/aabf660745f4db48b78a442b1497c4fc79b324f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKDFmNGE3ODk3NDViYjY5OWE3NjM2YjhkZDk0ZjljYTRhMGU1Y2M5ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26","sha":"101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26"}],"sha":"1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/1f4a789745bb699a7636b8dd94f9ca4a0e5cc981"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T02:28:41Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T02:28:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(start): fall back to repo-root .venv when per-app venvs are absent (#5)\n\n* test(explorer): skip generated Playwright report dirs in debranding scan\n\nThe debranding scan walks the working tree and was tripping on\ntests/e2e/playwright-report/index.html — a gitignored, generated Playwright\nreport (containing brand markers from test data) left on disk after running the\ne2e suite. It is never committed, so it is out of scope for the scan.\n\nAdd `playwright-report` and `test-results` to SKIP_DIRS, consistent with the\nother generated artifact dirs already skipped (coverage-html, allure-results,\npipeline-output, …). CI was unaffected (fresh checkout has no report); this\nkeeps local `pytest` green after running e2e tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(start): fall back to repo-root .venv when per-app venvs are absent\n\nstart.sh hard-required per-app virtualenvs at apps/pipeline/.venv and\napps/explorer/.venv and aborted pre-flight if either was missing. The monorepo\nis commonly run from a single repo-root .venv (which already carries both apps''\nruntime deps), so a fresh checkout using that layout couldn''t start.\n\nResolve each app''s interpreter at startup: prefer the app-local .venv, else fall\nback to the root .venv. Pre-flight now errors only when neither exists, prints\nwhich venv it selected, and all launch invocations use the resolved path.\n\nNo behavior change when per-app venvs are present.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* updates\n\n* fix(start): apply repo-root .venv fallback to per-app start scripts too\n\napps/explorer/start.sh and apps/pipeline/start.sh hard-coded their app-local\n.venv (the explorer also aborted pre-flight if ./.venv was missing). Apply the\nsame resolver as the root launcher: prefer the app .venv, else the repo-root\n.venv. The pipeline launcher now starts uvicorn via `python3 -m uvicorn`\n(robust when the venv lacks the console-script shim).\n\nRunning either app standalone now works from a single root venv.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): use globalThis instead of Node `global` in CommandPalette test\n\nThe suite-shell production build runs `tsc && vite build`; tsc type-checks the\ntest sources, and `global` (a Node-only name) isn''t in the shell''s lib types,\nfailing the build with TS2304. `globalThis` is standard and typed in both\nbrowser and Node libs, so it satisfies tsc while behaving identically at runtime.\n\nFixes the \"Suite Shell · vitest + build\" CI job.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc4e48fcec0cfd7ec1b576c9733471eb01808ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/dc4e48fcec0cfd7ec1b576c9733471eb01808ab8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKDEwMWRhMmM5NDFkOGI1YmM4Mzc1NjQ3OTNjOGFlMmY4N2Q4YWZhMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633","sha":"f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633"}],"sha":"101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/101da2c941d8b5bc837564793c8ae2f87d8afa26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T02:07:22Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T02:07:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Reorganize folders & naming for readability (#3)\n\nStandardize structure and naming across the monorepo (no behavior changes;\nall unit suites stay green — pipeline 812 passed/85%, explorer 111 passed/88%).\n\nTest directories — one convention everywhere (browser/live e2e in tests/e2e/):\n- explorer: e2etests/ -> tests/integration/ ; uitests/ -> tests/e2e/ (flattened).\n- Guard CI: explorer pytest.ini ignores tests/integration + tests/e2e so\n  `pytest tests/` stays unit-only; integration keeps its own pytest.ini.\n- Update playwright testDir, run-tests.sh, and integration README run commands.\n\nPipeline — give the CLIs a home:\n- knowledge_graph_generation.py -> cli/extract.py ; join_graphs.py -> cli/compare.py\n  (new cli/ package). Add a pipeline-root sys.path bootstrap and a _ROOT\n  constant so all `agents`/`utils`/pipeline-output paths resolve regardless of cwd.\n- Update every reference: tests (test_domain_support, test_workers_option,\n  test_config_no_hardcoded), ui/backend/services/pipeline_runner.py, Dockerfiles,\n  READMEs, and the agent docs.\n\nPipeline — clarity:\n- Rename Dockerfile -> Dockerfile.cli (the batch/CLI image; Dockerfile.api is the\n  API+UI image); update apps/pipeline/docker-compose.yml.\n- Move the unreferenced agents/agent_jtbd_kg_mapper.py -> agents/experimental/.\n\nDocs:\n- Add docs/STRUCTURE.md (repo map + test conventions); link from README.\n- Refresh CLI command examples in READMEs, pipeline docs, and the Pages site.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5ae9316703d9afcbc595c8692beb664fbd57c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/b5ae9316703d9afcbc595c8692beb664fbd57c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKGYyMzJhNjQyMmRmYjIwNDc5NThhYmM4ZTBiOWMwODlmODhlY2I2MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64","sha":"396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64"}],"sha":"f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/f232a6422dfb2047958abc8e0b9c089f88ecb633"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:16:01Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:16:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Validate full pipeline + explorer E2E; raise test coverage to 85%+ all suites (#2)\n\nEnd-to-end validation and hardening across the monorepo.\n\nExplorer (JanusGraph) runtime fixes:\n- Fix init-graphs.groovy so it creates the `globals` binding when the server\n  does not inject it (JanusGraph 1.0.0), so `*_g` traversal-source aliases bind\n  instead of failing with \"not in the Graph or TraversalSource global bindings\".\n  Fixed in the generator (scripts/generate_graph_config.py) + regenerated.\n- Cap JanusGraph JVM heap + container memory in docker-compose so the server\n  is not OOM-killed on memory-constrained hosts (env-overridable).\n- Make the sentence-transformers import optional in src/server.py: graph\n  exploration + keyword search work even without the heavy ML dependency\n  (semantic search degrades gracefully, mirroring the Redis pattern).\n\nTest coverage raised to 85%+ on all four suites:\n- pipeline backend 85% (new router/helper/service tests: graphs, prompts,\n  documents, text_to_html_converter, comparisons, run_store)\n- explorer backend 88% (new cache, data_loader, graph_manifest tests)\n- shell frontend 94% (CommandPalette interaction + Sidebar render tests)\n- pipeline-UI frontend 96.5%\n- debranding scan: skip gitignored generated/data dirs; neutralize fixture names\n\nPlaywright: add Flow 14 (loaded-graph data + document-to-graph traceability,\nvalidated against live JanusGraph data) and fix 3 stale specs (renamed\nendpoints + header text). 20 explorer e2e tests pass on live data.\n\nDocs: add docs/architecture.html (Mermaid system/pipeline/data diagrams) and\nlink it from the Pages site nav.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26982720905ce8338475d98217f70779857a4131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/26982720905ce8338475d98217f70779857a4131"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64","node_id":"C_kwDOTG-nuNoAKDM5NmQ5ODA0NTliMDQzMTk5MDBhMmU5MDFlM2I2NWMzMzVlNDViNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commit/e1e0783f93de18b022ea7abc51321ab378fd0c29","sha":"e1e0783f93de18b022ea7abc51321ab378fd0c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/e1e0783f93de18b022ea7abc51321ab378fd0c29"}],"sha":"396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/396d980459b04319900a2e901e3b65c335e45b64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/e1e0783f93de18b022ea7abc51321ab378fd0c29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T19:40:52Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T19:40:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Allure + coverage test suites across all apps; fix bugs found (#1)\n\n* docs: move community health files to .github/, fix post-reorg paths in README\n\n- Move CODE_OF_CONDUCT/CONTRIBUTING/SECURITY under .github/ (GitHub convention).\n- Fix stale cd pipeline/assistant/frontend references to apps/* after the reorg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: high-coverage unit suites with Allure across all apps; fix bugs found\n\nAllure + coverage wired into every runner (pytest x2 via allure-pytest +\npytest-cov; vitest x2 via allure-vitest + @vitest/coverage-v8, upgraded to\nvitest 3). CI runs all suites with coverage, uploads each suite''s allure-results,\nand publishes a merged Allure report artifact.\n\nNew tests (≈170 added; ~886 total green):\n- pipeline: llm_client, rule_uniqueness, text_to_html_converter, graph_service,\n  run_store, prompts router. Coverage 47%→56% on utils + ui/backend.\n- explorer: gremlin_safety, cache keys/get/set, data_loader helpers, models,\n  config, manifest. Coverage 49%→62% on conf + offline src.\n- shell: config helpers, bridge origin checks, Sidebar/CommandPalette helpers,\n  ErrorBoundary, MicroFrame, useTheme, useSettings (logic layer ~50%).\n- pipeline UI: SSE reducer, inferLabel, lighten, useTheme, ErrorBoundary\n  (logic layer ~96%).\n\nBugs fixed (each covered by a regression test):\n- graph_service comparison dirs still used the removed /<provider> path → all\n  comparisons returned empty.\n- llm_client _estimate_cost matched the shortest pricing prefix, over-pricing\n  mini/dated models up to ~16×; now longest-prefix. is_reasoning_model(None) guard.\n- rule_uniqueness rewrote dependency refs onto renamed duplicates, pointing\n  deps at the wrong rule; now leaves canonical refs intact.\n- explorer cache _generate_key crashed on non-serializable kwargs.\n- data_loader aborted the whole load on non-numeric strength/confidence; now\n  coerces safely.\n- gremlin safety guard false-positived on read queries using blocked words as\n  data keys (has(''property'', x)); now strips string literals + requires step\n  calls. Extracted to src/gremlin_safety.py for isolated testing.\n- prompts router had a path-traversal read/write primitive; added segment guard.\n- graph_service domain inference let mortgage ''lend'' shadow commercial_lending.\n- impact_service severity keywords now match on word boundaries.\n- shell config: wsUrl ignored an absolute VITE_WS_BASE override; basePath\n  normalization. Sidebar active-state prefix false positive. ErrorBoundary\n  ''Try again'' now remounts so transient errors can recover.\n- ChatDrawer SSE parsing: handle CRLF and a terminal done-without-label; dead\n  event-type code removed; extracted to lib/sse.ts. usePipeline inferLabel\n  dropped leading-slash folder labels.\n\nAlso fixes stale post-reorg paths in the README and moves community docs to .github/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: add redis/python-dotenv/gremlinpython to explorer test deps\n\nThe new offline unit tests import src.cache (redis), conf.config (dotenv) and\nsrc.data_loader (gremlinpython); declare them in requirements-test.txt so a\nclean CI install can collect them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b336f7812c5c053a450ce3e252224edc40e58674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/b336f7812c5c053a450ce3e252224edc40e58674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/e1e0783f93de18b022ea7abc51321ab378fd0c29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"Us