:{"date":"2026-06-27T18:39:22Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"message":"Reorganize monorepo: group apps under apps/, tooling under tools/\n\nLayout now matches the README''s component naming:\n- frontend/  -> apps/shell      (Suite shell)\n- pipeline/  -> apps/pipeline   (extraction pipeline + API + UI)\n- assistant/ -> apps/explorer   (graph explorer)\n- video/     -> tools/video     (demo tooling)\n- assistant/architecture.md -> apps/explorer/docs/architecture.md\n\nUpdated all references: docker-compose build contexts + volume mounts,\nstart.sh/stop.sh, CI working-dirs + cache paths, .gitignore/.dockerignore\ndata-dir rules, README (+ new structure tree), docs site, PR template, and a\ncross-app docstring. Added a Project structure section to the README.\n\nVerified: pipeline 686 + explorer 24 pytest, both Vitest suites, both\nproduction builds, and `docker compose config` all pass from the new paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c00ffd69110875aba515037c5b0339c90743f7ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/c00ffd69110875aba515037c5b0339c90743f7ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/01e3d0a8b111775e90ed5a9a8e81a68e90d5949b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rra