,"name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T18:24:47Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"message":"Remove unused Explorer features: comments, share, graph lock/release\n\n- Comments: drop comments_json column, annotation comment routes/serialization,\n  get_review_status comment handling, the get_review_status ''commented'' filter,\n  and the node/edge comment UI (detail.js buttons, actions.js panels,\n  storage.js defaults, detail.css styles, tasks.js auto-comment flow).\n- Lock/release: remove GraphRelease & GraphState models, the lock guard and\n  status/releases/release/unlock endpoints, the 7 CRUD lock checks, and the UI\n  (release.js, release.css, toolbar lock badge + Release/History buttons,\n  release modal, script/style includes).\n- Share: drop the stale ''share'' wording from the welcome copy.\n- Update offline model tests; review/approval, tasks, and graph CRUD are kept.\n\nNote: live-service e2e/ui specs that referenced these flows are out of CI and\nleft for a maintainer to update against a running stack.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93dfd2b058d7246fd4d697bb589799eab34facce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/93dfd2b058d7246fd4d697bb589799eab34facce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/a98b8b8220a58bec46a08afbce57548d40e820e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http