uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/cc2b14012d57ab212b8847995f03b19dcc96c668/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T18:12:25Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T18:12:25Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"message":"Drop litellm + Anthropic (OpenAI-only); flatten pipeline output paths\n\nLLM layer:\n- Rewrite utils/llm_client.py on the official OpenAI SDK (lazy client,\n  best-effort cost estimate); remove litellm dependency.\n- Remove all Anthropic/Claude support: config provider branches,\n  get_anthropic_api_key, CLI --provider choices, interactive prompt,\n  settings/impact_agentic plumbing, .env/.example keys, docker-compose env,\n  prompt-file provider labels, and docs (incl. published docs/ site).\n\nOutput paths:\n- Flatten pipeline-output/<provider>/... -> pipeline-output/... across config,\n  agents 7-10, join_graphs, UI services/routers, and the source-name parser.\n\nFixes a latent NameError in agent_3.5''s CLI key handling. 686 pipeline tests\npass; both frontends typecheck.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cea860ff844c7133842ebc2415ec72c163911cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/7cea860ff844c7133842ebc2415ec72c163911cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/cc2b14012d57ab212b8847995f03b19dcc96c668","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user