://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/commits/6f4b6c7d48f6a7fd8ff813ce868e044632fe3638/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T17:24:12Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T17:24:12Z","email":"145064767+rrahimi-uci@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Reza Rahimi"},"message":"Fix bugs across backends & frontends; harden tests\n\nBackends:\n- pipeline: config falls back to config.example.json; add get_anthropic_api_key;\n  lazy litellm import; SQLite busy_timeout + safe migrations + empty-update guard;\n  Dockerfile seeds config.json; run agentic LLM steps off the event loop;\n  reject binary impact uploads; guard publish resp; obligations suggest 404s on\n  missing rule; enrich AML rule-type descriptions; align config.example to defaults.\n- assistant: read-only Gremlin guard (HTTP + chat tool); don''t cache graph-has-data\n  on failure; harden serve_chunk path-traversal check; validate properties/top_k;\n  None-safe LLM content; fix logging NameError in __main__ blocks.\n\nFrontends:\n- origin-checked postMessage bridge (shell + pipeline theme listener);\n  ErrorBoundary in both apps; MicroFrame load watchdog + state reset;\n  CommandPalette a11y (dialog/listbox/option) + correct scroll target;\n  usePipeline ws.onerror + cancel no longer reports false success;\n  ChatDrawer aborts stream on unmount/close; lighten() guards bad hex;\n  Documents folder row is a real button; remove dead CopilotProvider branch.\n\nTests/data:\n- pin pipeline tests to config.example.json (deterministic, no local config.json);\n  make impact analyze test use the no-LLM heuristic path. 675 pipeline tests pass.\n- keep kbs/kgs/compliance-files as tracked placeholders (data user-supplied).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6de8d7f048c9b3477e83f21f7490eefcbc2beaf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/trees/6de8d7f048c9b3477e83f21f7490eefcbc2beaf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrahimi-uci/policy-to-knowledge/git/commits/6f4b6c7d48f6a7fd8ff813ce868e044632fe3638","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145064767?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rrahimi-uci","id":145064767,"login":"rrahimi-uci","node_id":"U_kgDOCKWDPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrahimi-uci","user_vi