hub.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/ebc39849d8783ea595f0a04686bd3fe5b14a9cb6","sha":"ebc39849d8783ea595f0a04686bd3fe5b14a9cb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/ebc39849d8783ea595f0a04686bd3fe5b14a9cb6"}],"sha":"ec8c9649654011504293e9807ad718543ff6eb3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/ec8c9649654011504293e9807ad718543ff6eb3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/ebc39849d8783ea595f0a04686bd3fe5b14a9cb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:21:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:21:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci: require Node >=20 (drop Node 18 from matrix and engines)\n\nCI was red only on Node 18: jsdom@29 pulls html-encoding-sniffer@6 →\n@exodus/bytes, which is ESM-only across all published versions and can only be\nrequire()''d on a Node with require(esm) support (>= 20.19). jsdom''s own\ntransitive deps (@csstools/*, @asamuzakjp/*) already declare node >=20.19.0, so\njsdom 29 doesn''t support Node 18 at all. Node 18 is also EOL (2025-04).\n\n- engines: node >=20 (was >=18)\n- CI matrix: [20, 22] (was [18, 20, 22])\n- README maintainer note + CHANGELOG updated with the rationale.\n\nThe shipped runtime code has no require(esm); this only reflects the test\ntoolchain''s and Node''s support windows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDCNvNjZjVZRej4qFUi9xm","tree":{"sha":"00e74950d7131b72647adab51b5c2ee0043c5eb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/00e74950d7131b72647adab51b5c2ee0043c5eb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/ebc39849d8783ea595f0a04686bd3fe5b14a9cb6","verification":{"payload":"tree 00e74950d7131b72647adab51b5c2ee0043c5eb4\nparent 15e1d8de46a9ace9a9ca59204f14977ab04f9dfc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783419678 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783419678 +0000\n\nci: require Node >=20 (drop Node 18 from matrix and engines)\n\nCI was red only on Node 18: jsdom@29 pulls html-encoding-sniffer@6 →\n@exodus/bytes, which is ESM-only across all published versions and can only be\nrequire()''d on a Node with require(esm) support (>= 20.19). jsdom''s own\ntransitive deps (@csstools/*, @asamuzakjp/*) already declare node >=20.19.0, so\njsdom 29 doesn''t support Node 18 at all. Node 18 is also EOL (2025-04).\n\n- engines: node >=20 (was >=18)\n- CI matrix: [20, 22] (was [18, 20, 22])\n- README maintainer note + CHANGELOG updated with the rationale.\n\nThe shipped runtime code has no require(esm); this only reflects the test\ntoolchain''s and Node''s support windows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDCNvNjZjVZRej4qFUi9xm\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1