","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/15e1d8de46a9ace9a9ca59204f14977ab04f9dfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T09:51:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T09:51:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(export): CSV/JSON slice + annotation export, docs, release prep\n\nM7 (partial — the /bench route is intentionally skipped; the 60fps proof will\nlive in the consuming projects'' published sites and be referenced from here).\n\n- Export API (src/lib/state/export.ts): pure serializers eventsToCSV /\n  eventsToJSON / annotationsToCSV, and download helpers downloadCSV / downloadJSON\n  for the current filtered slice plus downloadAnnotationsCSV alongside the\n  existing JSON. Surfaced in <TimelineToolbar> as a \"Data\" menu; event exports\n  disable when zoomed out to buckets/heat cells (no individual rows). KML stays\n  roadmap.\n- README: new \"Categorical choropleth (regions)\" and \"Export\" sections; version\n  and release-note references bumped to 0.1.0.\n- CHANGELOG: 0.1.0 entry covering the geo half, choropleth, and export.\n- package.json: version 0.1.0.\n\nVerified in real Chromium: the Data menu downloads a well-formed events.csv\n(header + ISO time + lon/lat) from a zoomed-in map. 240 tests pass, check +\npackage clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDCNvNjZjVZRej4qFUi9xm","tree":{"sha":"2f192d992e1781b5df7e7b153038fd0bdb6d2955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/2f192d992e1781b5df7e7b153038fd0bdb6d2955"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/15e1d8de46a9ace9a9ca59204f14977ab04f9dfc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f192d992e1781b5df7e7b153038fd0bdb6d2955\nparent 346338116aefaac841363c61ab821d86c68fd014\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783417861 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783417861 +0000\n\nfeat(export): CSV/JSON slice + annotation export, docs, release prep\n\nM7 (partial — the /bench route is intentionally skipped; the 60fps proof will\nlive in the consuming projects'' published sites and be referenced from here).\n\n- Export API (src/lib/state/export.ts): pure serializers eventsToCSV /\n  eventsToJSON / annotationsToCSV, and download helpers downloadCSV / downloadJSON\n  for the current filtered slice plus downloadAnnotationsCSV alongside the\n  existing JSON. Surfaced in <TimelineToolbar> as a \"Data\" menu; event exports\n  disable when zoomed out to buckets/heat cells (no individual rows). KML stays\n  roadmap.\n- README: new \"Categorical choropleth (regions)\" and \"Export\" sections; version\n  and release-note references bumped to 0.1.0.\n- CHANGELOG: 0.1.0 entry covering the geo half, choropleth, and export.\n- package.json: version 0.1.0.\n\nVerified in real Chromium: the Data menu downloads a well-formed events.csv\n(header + ISO time + lon/lat) from a zoomed-in map. 240 tests pass, check +\npackage clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDCNvNjZjVZRej4qFUi9xm\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM5o9Vgg\nWssPuvOcKlF0IGSzkDl2JOKf8d1xGvyUKzleHZkJJko/4OPoEOUL4DmdHTrac0VwOMo4fCVUxaCv\n6Q8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T09:51:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/15e1d8de46a9ace9a9ca59204f14977ab04f9dfc","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDE1ZTFkOGRlNDZhOWFjZTlhOWNhNTkyMDRmMTQ5NzdhYjA0ZjlkZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/346338116aefaac841363c61ab821d86c68fd014","sha":"346338116aefaac841363c61ab821d86c68fd014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/346338116aefaac841363c61ab821d86c68fd014"}],"sha":"15e1d8de46a9ace9a9ca59204f14977ab04f9dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/15e1d8de46a9ace9a9ca59204f14977ab04f9dfc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/346338116aefaac841363c61ab821d86c68fd014/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T09:33:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T09:33:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(geo): categorical region choropleth layer (GeoRegionLayer)\n\nAdds a per-tick categorical choropleth to <GeoMap>, additive to the density\nheat grid. Resolves the \"implement vs. offload to Folium/GeoParquet\" decision\nin favor of an in-SDK layer: the required view is per-tick (recolors as the\ntimeline range / playhead advances), which is the dynamic-replay job static\ntools can''t do and the SDK already does.\n\nThree new primitives, mostly on existing seams:\n- Point-in-polygon aggregation: dependency-free even-odd ray cast\n  (data/regions.ts, holes + MultiPolygon) over regions projected once;\n  GeoIndex.aggregateRegions reuses the quadtree candidate walk. Time-only, so a\n  pan re-renders and a range change re-aggregates.\n- Categorical encoding: Okabe-Ito colorblind-safe palette + stable category->\n  color map (render/categorical.ts), a separate axis from the severity ramp;\n  TimelineEvent gains optional `category`.\n- Filled polygons: GeoCanvasRenderer.#drawRegions fills by dominant category\n  (count-scaled alpha, even-odd holes) as a regionLayer in GeoRenderContext.\n\nWiring is additive and non-breaking: optional DataSource.queryRegions\n(in-memory + worker with its own epoch channel and generation-keyed LRU; region\ngeometry sent only when the reference changes), <GeoMap regions/categoryColors>,\ngenerateSyntheticData({categories}) + generateGridRegions() for demos/tests.\n\nBrowser QA found and fixed a $state-proxy postMessage clone bug (regions sent\nraw threw DataCloneError; now a plain deep copy), guarded by a mock-worker\nregression. 234 tests pass, check + package clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDCNvNjZjVZRej4qFUi9xm","tree":{"sha":"c2cae3d8188d25b9abb26ab1ee6954452acad9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/c2cae3d8188d25b9abb26ab1ee6954452acad9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/346338116aefaac841363c61ab821d86c68fd014","verification":{"payload":"tree c2cae3d8188d25b9abb26ab1ee6954452acad9af\nparent 51c1637c1ad7ea075369f1404242867a315514f3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783416789 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783416810 +0000\n\nfeat(geo): categorical region choropleth layer (GeoRegionLayer)\n\nAdds a per-tick categorical choropleth to <GeoMap>, additive to the density\nheat grid. Resolves the \"implement vs. offload to Folium/GeoParquet\" decision\nin favor of an in-SDK layer: the required view is per-tick (recolors as the\ntimeline range / playhead advances), which is the dynamic-replay job static\ntools can''t do and the SDK already does.\n\nThree new primitives, mostly on existing seams:\n- Point-in-polygon aggregation: dependency-free even-odd ray cast\n  (data/regions.ts, holes + MultiPolygon) over regions projected once;\n  GeoIndex.aggregateRegions reuses the quadtree candidate walk. Time-only, so a\n  pan re-renders and a range change re-aggregates.\n- Categorical encoding: Okabe-Ito colorblind-safe palette + stable category->\n  color map (render/categorical.ts), a separate axis from the severity ramp;\n  TimelineEvent gains optional `category`.\n- Filled polygons: GeoCanvasRenderer.#drawRegions fills by dominant category\n  (count-scaled alpha, even-odd holes) as a regionLayer in GeoRenderContext.\n\nWiring is additive and non-breaking: optional DataSource.queryRegions\n(in-memory + worker with its own epoch channel and generation-keyed LRU; region\ngeometry sent only when the reference changes), <GeoMap regions/categoryColors>,\ngenerateSyntheticData({categories}) + generateGridRegions() for demos/tests.\n\nBrowser QA found and fixed a $state-proxy postMessage clone bug (regions sent\nraw threw DataCloneError; now a plain deep copy), guarded by a mock-worker\nregression. 234 tests pass, check + package clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDCNvNjZjVZRej4qFUi9xm\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOugq/8F\njdt12012rjTeSO73KX6SeZnpQOA99j8yiXYoIMqMgTNfsIF8ll+VBtyKKgRKjH1hUnVYdPmkDB87\nWQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-07T09:33:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id