l":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/66737779adb3ac3cb7fbfc08af360e32996c42d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:45:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:45:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(release): CI/CD, publish guards, changelog, and Svelte Spatial rebrand\n\nClose out the mechanical publish-readiness items:\n\n- CI: .github/workflows/ci.yml runs test + check + package on PRs and pushes\n  to main across Node 18/20/22.\n- Release: .github/workflows/release.yml publishes with\n  `npm publish --provenance` on `v*` tags (uses the NPM_TOKEN secret and\n  OIDC id-token for provenance).\n- package.json: add `engines` (Node >=18) and a `prepublishOnly` guard so a\n  publish can''t ship failing tests or types.\n- Add CHANGELOG.md (Keep a Changelog format).\n- Rebrand the `svelteGraph` display name to \"Svelte Spatial\" in the prose of\n  ARCHITECTURE.md and SPATIAL_TEMPORAL_PLAN.md; fix stale subpath-import\n  examples to `@deepcivic/svelte-spatial/*`; document why the public `--sg-*`\n  CSS tokens were deliberately left unrenamed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019eNm7giNtMnwBqGSPwcP15","tree":{"sha":"4a6c936800b369a9cce9af955494e8050ac0ceeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/4a6c936800b369a9cce9af955494e8050ac0ceeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/66737779adb3ac3cb7fbfc08af360e32996c42d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a6c936800b369a9cce9af955494e8050ac0ceeb\nparent a17bc535dbcdfb65b4703828ce573d166f19bfa6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783395946 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783395946 +0000\n\nchore(release): CI/CD, publish guards, changelog, and Svelte Spatial rebrand\n\nClose out the mechanical publish-readiness items:\n\n- CI: .github/workflows/ci.yml runs test + check + package on PRs and pushes\n  to main across Node 18/20/22.\n- Release: .github/workflows/release.yml publishes with\n  `npm publish --provenance` on `v*` tags (uses the NPM_TOKEN secret and\n  OIDC id-token for provenance).\n- package.json: add `engines` (Node >=18) and a `prepublishOnly` guard so a\n  publish can''t ship failing tests or types.\n- Add CHANGELOG.md (Keep a Changelog format).\n- Rebrand the `svelteGraph` display name to \"Svelte Spatial\" in the prose of\n  ARCHITECTURE.md and SPATIAL_TEMPORAL_PLAN.md; fix stale subpath-import\n  examples to `@deepcivic/svelte-spatial/*`; document why the public `--sg-*`\n  CSS tokens were deliberately left unrenamed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019eNm7giNtMnwBqGSPwcP15\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBI2Hrpf\nvFZ7zyvQc/dfQZGeZ5NsCWGpz5Hzs35fmD4LNYOGHvltn5sHVHO2SvZT+MgqfRdiYwtFpeIK8D7v\npA8=\n-----END SSH