","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/2c551b235421621fec08bde9e39626390105f12c","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDJjNTUxYjIzNTQyMTYyMWZlYzA4YmRlOWUzOTYyNjM5MDEwNWYxMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/6a6619d737c6add5b550b3d4906091d19ec31dbe","sha":"6a6619d737c6add5b550b3d4906091d19ec31dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/6a6619d737c6add5b550b3d4906091d19ec31dbe"}],"sha":"2c551b235421621fec08bde9e39626390105f12c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/2c551b235421621fec08bde9e39626390105f12c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/6a6619d737c6add5b550b3d4906091d19ec31dbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:16:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:16:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(pkg): publish as @deepcivic/svelte-spatial, reframe README as geospatial\n\nClaim a publishable npm name — `sveltegraph` is taken by an unrelated\npackage — by scoping to `@deepcivic/svelte-spatial`, and add\n`publishConfig.access: public` so the first scoped publish doesn''t fail\nas private.\n\nReframe the README around geospatial graphs: lead with `<GeoMap>` and the\nlinked map + timeline (spatial brushing, shared selection), document\n`lon`/`lat` events, GeoJSON basemaps, bindable WGS84 bounds, and the\n`queryGeo`/`geoExtent` backend seam. Update all import specifiers and the\ntheme subpath to the scoped name; add install instructions. Keep the\npublic `--sg-*` theming tokens unchanged (independent of the package name).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H6LKf4VgG8KV9AN4VndyE8","tree":{"sha":"21c1735df657e2bf64497060cf6444d95dd093a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/21c1735df657e2bf64497060cf6444d95dd093a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/6a6619d737c6add5b550b3d4906091d19ec31dbe","verification":{"payload":"tree 21c1735df657e2bf64497060cf6444d95dd093a3\nparent f34b7acf31e8ede56a9614e71baec705c6e0119b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783376187 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783376187 +0000\n\nchore(pkg): publish as @deepcivic/svelte-spatial, reframe README as geospatial\n\nClaim a publishable npm name — `sveltegraph` is taken by an unrelated\npackage — by scoping to `@deepcivic/svelte-spatial`, and add\n`publishConfig.access: public` so the first scoped publish doesn''t fail\nas private.\n\nReframe the README around geospatial graphs: lead with `<GeoMap>` and the\nlinked map + timeline (spatial brushing, shared selection), document\n`lon`/`lat` events, GeoJSON basemaps, bindable WGS84 bounds, and the\n`queryGeo`/`geoExtent` backend seam. Update all import specifiers and the\ntheme subpath to the scoped name; add install instructions. Keep the\npublic `--sg-*` theming tokens unchanged (independent of the package name).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H6LKf4VgG8KV9AN4VndyE8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHKbH6Oc\nwy5bKfefhghYOOxEtJdpTtYS/mH6cSkKX0Qb4HvCFRqU4DCt5nQHSVJsaXvakMP9IEXRVyP05rGs\nyAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T22:16:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/6a6619d737c6add5b550b3d4906091d19ec31dbe","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDZhNjYxOWQ3MzdjNmFkZDViNTUwYjNkNDkwNjA5MWQxOWVjMzFkYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/john