ps://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/d0253c0b20d3993a87b54eba1afa315b61db46b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T23:33:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T23:33:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"qa(geo): M5 pass — regression coverage for cross-view annotate\n\nVerified in real Chromium at 10k geo events over WorkerDataSource: authoring on\neither view pins both (timeline-authored notes confirm the denormalized lon/lat\npath); the shared editor reopens pre-filled in edit mode from both the map pin\nand the timeline pin; edit/save updates both views; remove clears both; panning\nthe map slides the fixed-geography pin; Reveal dims and Ping pulses both\ncanvases. No bugs found — hardened the AnnotationLayer editor refactor with\nregression tests:\n\n- tests/AnnotationLayer.test.ts: the shared editor pre-fills its draft when\n  opened via editingAnnotationId, and again after cancel/re-open (guards the\n  effect-based draft seeding that replaced the synchronous openMarker).\n- tests/GeoAnnotationLayer.test.ts: the map pin layer removes a pin when its\n  annotation is deleted and repositions it when the viewport pans.\n\nnpm test (182) + npm run check green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WZcfDjet66tKRqoGfh3onx","tree":{"sha":"0fc31015b44759a808da8d81e1bf05aa99fc3651","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/0fc31015b44759a808da8d81e1bf05aa99fc3651"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/d0253c0b20d3993a87b54eba1afa315b61db46b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fc31015b44759a808da8d81e1bf05aa99fc3651\nparent 1c9591afb969dc2f09cfb7a621f9a3ac90c5f495\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783294422 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783294422 +0000\n\nqa(geo): M5 pass — regression coverage for cross-view annotate\n\nVerified in real Chromium at 10k geo events over WorkerDataSource: authoring on\neither view pins both (timeline-authored notes confirm the denormalized lon/lat\npath); the shared editor reopens pre-filled in edit mode from both the map pin\nand the timeline pin; edit/save updates both views; remove clears both; panning\nthe map slides the fixed-geography pin; Reveal dims and Ping pulses both\ncanvases. No bugs found — hardened the AnnotationLayer editor refactor with\nregression tests:\n\n- tests/AnnotationLayer.test.ts: the shared editor pre-fills its draft when\n  opened via editingAnnotationId, and again after cancel/re-open (guards the\n  effect-based draft seeding that replaced the synchronous openMarker).\n- tests/GeoAnnotationLayer.test.ts: the map pin layer removes a pin when its\n  annotation is deleted and repositions it when the viewport pans.\n\nnpm test (182) + npm run check green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WZcfDjet66tKRqoGfh3onx\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC5t0ZR9\nItiBVqsRaa+JOHpo0cCXMBF35VXIYalsy8Fq4qX7XlDXJItEw9FRgROScJ3G3c/gS2kSs8qNXL1D\nPgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T23:33:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/d0253c0b20d3993a87b54eba1afa315b61db46b2","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKGQwMjUzYzBiMjBkMzk5M2E4N2I1NGViYTFhZmEzMTViNjFkYjQ2YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/1c9591afb969dc2f09cfb7a621f9a3ac90c5f495","sha":"1c9591afb969dc2f09cfb7a621f9a3ac90c5f495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/1c9591afb969dc2f09cfb7a621f9a3ac90c5f495"}],"sha":"d0253c0b20d3993a87b54eba1afa315b61db46b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/d0253c0b20d3993a87b54eba1afa315b61db46b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/1c9591afb969dc2f09cfb7a621f9a3ac90c5f495/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T23:10:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T23:10:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(geo): M5 — cross-view Reveal, Ping, and Annotate\n\nMake the three narrative interactions read on both the map and the timeline.\n\n- Reveal + Ping were already plumbed through the geo render context in\n  M3/M4 (GeoRenderContext focusedEntity/ping, GeoCanvasRenderer focusDim +\n  pulse); both flow from the shared TimelineContext so a track-label click or\n  Ping-anomalies lights up both canvases from one source of truth.\n- Annotate goes cross-view:\n  - Annotation gains denormalized lon/lat (copied from the event at creation)\n    so a pin can be placed even when the event is aggregated or filtered out of\n    the map''s current bounds ∧ range slice.\n  - Lift the editor target to TimelineContext.editingAnnotationId (+\n    editAnnotation) so a pin click on either view opens one shared popover — no\n    duplicate editor. A fresh event selection supersedes an open edit; the draft\n    is re-seeded only when the target changes, so typing is never clobbered.\n  - New <GeoAnnotationLayer>: a DOM overlay rendering a pin per geo-bearing\n    annotation at its projected position (recomputed on pan/zoom, culled to the\n    body), routing pin clicks through editAnnotation. Honors the canvas/DOM\n    boundary. Exported from index.\n\nTests: editAnnotation clears selection + sets the shared target; the store\ncarries lon/lat through; a mounted <GeoAnnotationLayer> pins only geo-bearing\nnotes, places them at the projected position, and opens the shared editor on\nclick. npm test (178) + npm run check green; verified in real Chromium\n(select-on-map -> note -> pins on both views; pin click reopens editor; Reveal\ndims both; Ping pulses both).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WZcfDjet66tKRqoGfh3onx","tree":{"sha":"e9b21591905af0bec96d869ccab94ed87e581476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/e9b21591905af0bec96d869ccab94ed87e581476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/1c9591afb969dc2f09cfb7a621f9a3ac90c5f495","verification":{"payload":"tree e9b21591905af0bec96d869ccab94ed87e581476\nparent 385e654402b50876fa2118b12290ea96b3d32bb1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783293019 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783293019 +0000\n\nfeat(geo): M5 — cross-view Reveal, Ping, and Annotate\n\nMake the three narrative interactions read on both the map and the timeline.\n\n- Reveal + Ping were already plumbed through the geo render context in\n  M3/M4 (GeoRenderContext focusedEntity/ping, GeoCanvasRenderer focusDim +\n  pulse); both flow from the shared TimelineContext so a track-label click or\n  Ping-anomalies lights up both canvases from one source of truth.\n- Annotate goes cross-view:\n  - Annotation gains denormalized lon/lat (copied from the event at creation)\n    so a pin can be placed even when the event is aggregated or filtered out of\n    the map''s current bounds ∧ range slice.\n  - Lift the editor target to TimelineContext.editingAnnotationId (+\n    editAnnotation) so a pin click on either view opens one shared popover — no\n    duplicate editor. A fresh event selection supersedes an open edit; the draft\n    is re-seeded only when the target changes, so typing is never clobbered.\n  - New <GeoAnnotationLayer>: a DOM overlay rendering a pin per geo-bearing\n    annotation at its projected position (recomputed on pan/zoom, culled to the\n    body), routing pin clicks through editAnnotation. Honors the canvas/DOM\n    boundary. Exported from index.\n\nTests: editAnnotation clears selection + sets the shared target; the store\ncarries lon/lat through; a mounted <GeoAnnotationLayer> pins only geo-bearing\nnotes, places them at the projected position, and opens the shared editor on\nclick. npm test (178) + npm run check green; verified in real Chromium\n(select-on-map -> note -> pins on both views; pin click reopens editor; Reveal\ndims both; Ping pulses both).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WZcfDjet66tKRqoGfh3onx\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHvz0mTc\nXQhBi4ADKZ9xaol4It5R3eIZsz5n4MOIKAMAKRQKfO1YIWv1KZnFR7E4rtLiugh0hPrGvB0AQo47\ngQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T23:10:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events"