_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/258f04053bbc65c58d4527ef6da7b9a14c46e60e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:52:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:52:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(geo): record M4 fresh-QA verification + DataTable a11y follow-up\n\nFresh QA pass over the M4 branch in Chromium confirmed both brush directions,\ncross-view selection (click a map point → ring in both views), Home reset,\ncombined pan+scrub stress, and DataTable virtualization — all green, no runtime\nerrors. No code changes needed. Tidy the known-smells list: the M4 bindable note\nis past-tense now, and add the virtualized-table''s windowed-DOM a11y tradeoff as\na documented follow-up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jme9ozzsKTyg9KRXcuEEzH","tree":{"sha":"a92cbd158e6219f2d88408506e8c46a50e2d2d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/a92cbd158e6219f2d88408506e8c46a50e2d2d9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/258f04053bbc65c58d4527ef6da7b9a14c46e60e","verification":{"payload":"tree a92cbd158e6219f2d88408506e8c46a50e2d2d9b\nparent cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783227125 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783227125 +0000\n\ndocs(geo): record M4 fresh-QA verification + DataTable a11y follow-up\n\nFresh QA pass over the M4 branch in Chromium confirmed both brush directions,\ncross-view selection (click a map point → ring in both views), Home reset,\ncombined pan+scrub stress, and DataTable virtualization — all green, no runtime\nerrors. No code changes needed. Tidy the known-smells list: the M4 bindable note\nis past-tense now, and add the virtualized-table''s windowed-DOM a11y tradeoff as\na documented follow-up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jme9ozzsKTyg9KRXcuEEzH\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGx8w+p6\n1em8SNiLdx9SuWM4kwMUZa5pyUQCFhorS4+RrgE1cRXjHoSFi2S4tCN1fs8Om4C3bR2H93xth/Rk\n4wI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T04:52:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/258f04053bbc65c58d4527ef6da7b9a14c46e60e","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDI1OGYwNDA1M2JiYzY1YzU4ZDQ1MjdlZjZkYTdiOWExNGM0NmU2MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3","sha":"cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3"}],"sha":"258f04053bbc65c58d4527ef6da7b9a14c46e60e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/258f04053bbc65c58d4527ef6da7b9a14c46e60e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:13:03Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T04:13:03Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"qa(geo): M4 pass — fix scale-invariant geo cache key, add zoom regression\n\nQA of the M4 branch in real Chromium (100k events, WorkerDataSource) surfaced a\nbug latent since M2: the worker''s quantized geo cache key was scale-invariant\nfor a centered zoom. It snapped west/south to a cell grid whose step\n(cw = span / targetCells) scales with the box, so a zoom about the center left\nthe origin index unchanged and every zoom level collided onto one entry — the\nmap served the first (full-world) aggregation restamped with new bounds. Result:\nzooming the map never refined the heat grid, and the spatial brush never\nnarrowed the timeline''s count.\n\nFix: add a separate log-bucketed scale index (scaleIndex, base 1.05, below the\nsmallest interactive zoom step) to both geoCacheKey and queryCacheKey, so\ndistinct zoom levels get distinct keys while sub-cell pans (which don''t change\nthe cell size) still collide and hit the cache — preserving M2''s pan-hit intent.\n\n- workerCore.ts: scaleIndex helper; both keys now key on origin + scale.\n- Tests (+2): a key-level regression (three centered spans -> three keys) and a\n  behavioral one (a centered zoom recomputes, returning strictly fewer events,\n  not a stale cache echo). The old \"different zoom\" test only varied targetCells,\n  which is exactly why this slipped through.\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: M4 QA-pass note.\n\nVerified after the fix: map zoom filters the timeline (77240 -> 30879) and\ntimeline zoom filters the map (30879 -> 4908). npm test (173) + npm run check\ngreen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jme9ozzsKTyg9KRXcuEEzH","tree":{"sha":"0668a2e3badb2ac4675440de50f7a84b17aae772","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/0668a2e3badb2ac4675440de50f7a84b17aae772"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 0668a2e3badb2ac4675440de50f7a84b17aae772\nparent 1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783224783 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783224783 +0000\n\nqa(geo): M4 pass — fix scale-invariant geo cache key, add zoom regression\n\nQA of the M4 branch in real Chromium (100k events, WorkerDataSource) surfaced a\nbug latent since M2: the worker''s quantized geo cache key was scale-invariant\nfor a centered zoom. It snapped west/south to a cell grid whose step\n(cw = span / targetCells) scales with the box, so a zoom about the center left\nthe origin index unchanged and every zoom level collided onto one entry — the\nmap served the first (full-world) aggregation restamped with new bounds. Result:\nzooming the map never refined the heat grid, and the spatial brush never\nnarrowed the timeline''s count.\n\nFix: add a separate log-bucketed scale index (scaleIndex, base 1.05, below the\nsmallest interactive zoom step) to both geoCacheKey and queryCacheKey, so\ndistinct zoom levels get distinct keys while sub-cell pans (which don''t change\nthe cell size) still collide and hit the cache — preserving M2''s pan-hit intent.\n\n- workerCore.ts: scaleIndex helper; both keys now key on origin + scale.\n- Tests (+2): a key-level regression (three centered spans -> three keys) and a\n  behavioral one (a centered zoom recomputes, returning strictly fewer events,\n  not a stale cache echo). The old \"different zoom\" test only varied targetCells,\n  which is exactly why this slipped through.\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: M4 QA-pass note.\n\nVerified after the fix: map zoom filters the timeline (77240 -> 30879) and\ntimeline zoom filters the map (30879 -> 4908). npm test (173) + npm run check\ngreen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jme9ozzsKTyg9KRXcuEEzH\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKaInvX9\nJip47XkTDDmljO28NtynzV2ESozGa+AyfbmxRSZtd0zbH+RR5uCb+vkMe9G1fvIpDpKBGLx6Sxa1\nDwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T04:13:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKGNmZGU1YmZjMzNkMWNhYzdjOTAwZGM2ODM0YThmYmU5YmRhMTgxYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84","sha":"1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84"}],"sha":"cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/cfde5bfc33d1cac7c900dc6834a8fbe9bda181c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T23:58:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T23:58:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(geo): M4 — shared context, bi-directional brushing, virtualized DataTable\n\nLink <GeoMap> and <Timeline> into one instrument that brushes on orthogonal\naxes: the map filters the timeline in space, the timeline filters the map in\ntime — no feedback loop.\n\n- TimelineContext gains geoViewport, geoSlice ($state.raw), and the spatial\n  brush boundsFilter (the temporal brush is the existing viewport.range).\n  Export DataProvider (component) and DataContext (class) as forward-looking\n  aliases; TimelineProvider/TimelineContext retained unchanged.\n- <GeoMap> publishes vp.bounds -> context.boundsFilter (equality-guarded,\n  untracked) and queries queryGeo over context.viewport.range; <Timeline>\n  passes context.boundsFilter as its query() bounds filter. Both ride the\n  existing 60ms debounce. Orthogonal axes + equality guard => no ping-pong.\n- Virtualize <DataTable>: fixed-height windowed rows + spacer <tr>s, sticky\n  header, no dependency; active={false} skip preserved. Demo table no longer\n  double-scrolls.\n- Tests: context brush-state defaults + axis orthogonality; mounted\n  map+timeline harness asserting brush query counts (pan filters timeline,\n  zoom filters map, counts settle when idle); bind:bounds control path;\n  DataTable windowing. npm test (171) and npm run check green; verified in\n  Chromium at 100k events.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jme9ozzsKTyg9KRXcuEEzH","tree":{"sha":"8aa7885f6559fc1222993acf6e8b5540f66d9aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/8aa7885f6559fc1222993acf6e8b5540f66d9aba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84","verification":{"payload":"tree 8aa7885f6559fc1222993acf6e8b5540f66d9aba\nparent cd4499c0a893c2be042b2c1f1151ddea47dfa5a0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783209518 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783209518 +0000\n\nfeat(geo): M4 — shared context, bi-directional brushing, virtualized DataTable\n\nLink <GeoMap> and <Timeline> into one instrument that brushes on orthogonal\naxes: the map filters the timeline in space, the timeline filters the map in\ntime — no feedback loop.\n\n- TimelineContext gains geoViewport, geoSlice ($state.raw), and the spatial\n  brush boundsFilter (the temporal brush is the existing viewport.range).\n  Export DataProvider (component) and DataContext (class) as forward-looking\n  aliases; TimelineProvider/TimelineContext retained unchanged.\n- <GeoMap> publishes vp.bounds -> context.boundsFilter (equality-guarded,\n  untracked) and queries queryGeo over context.viewport.range; <Timeline>\n  passes context.boundsFilter as its query() bounds filter. Both ride the\n  existing 60ms debounce. Orthogonal axes + equality guard => no ping-pong.\n- Virtualize <DataTable>: fixed-height windowed rows + spacer <tr>s, sticky\n  header, no dependency; active={false} skip preserved. Demo table no longer\n  double-scrolls.\n- Tests: context brush-state defaults + axis orthogonality; mounted\n  map+timeline harness asserting brush query counts (pan filters timeline,\n  zoom filters map, counts settle when idle); bind:bounds control path;\n  DataTable windowing. npm test (171) and npm run check green; verified in\n  Chromium at 100k events.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Jme9ozzsKTyg9KRXcuEEzH\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFGYEdcM\nvoWZqJRAXe+LeLE4VMEG9AsnsFmOaC4wXZXNXyIJDjpfWP6xSPDpuB/EEcD5PmvYPxuVJTKE1sUt\n+A8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T23:58:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/1474a7252635aa90f2286629a93ffad9987bda84","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDE0NzRhNzI1MjYzNWFhOTBmMjI4NjYyOWE5M2ZmYWQ5OTg3YmRhODQ