ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/9f51ba9f037f2bbc33bab30f813d2177d5b7da5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T23:38:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T23:38:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"qa(geo): M3 pass — fix stale aria-live summary, add basemap tests\n\nQA of the M3 branch in real Chromium (100k events): map sustains ~60fps under\nsimultaneous wheel-zoom + drag-pan, cross-view point selection works (DOM ring +\nshared context.selected), Home resets to an identical framing, no runtime errors.\n\nBug found and fixed: <GeoMap>''s aria-live summary effect read the render loop''s\nplain (non-reactive) `slice`, so it only re-ran when the `hasData` flag toggled —\nthe announced count went stale across pans that kept the map populated. Mirror\nthe drawn slice into a reactive `$state.raw` (the same a11y seam <Timeline> uses\nvia context.slice) and derive the summary from it.\n\n- Add a GeoMap mount test asserting the resolved slice''s real count (not the\n  initial empty slice) reaches the live region — a regression guard.\n- Add projectBasemap unit tests (LineString/Polygon/MultiPolygon/FeatureCollection,\n  point-skipping, degenerate-ring dropping, null input).\n- Record the QA pass in ARCHITECTURE.md.\n\n164 tests pass; npm run check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012yK7Lh57BJzhFBMHm9S9WL","tree":{"sha":"2b0f77702f68748b6538a156b05469bae8c9e40f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/2b0f77702f68748b6538a156b05469bae8c9e40f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/9f51ba9f037f2bbc33bab30f813d2177d5b7da5a","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b0f77702f68748b6538a156b05469bae8c9e40f\nparent f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783208298 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783208298 +0000\n\nqa(geo): M3 pass — fix stale aria-live summary, add basemap tests\n\nQA of the M3 branch in real Chromium (100k events): map sustains ~60fps under\nsimultaneous wheel-zoom + drag-pan, cross-view point selection works (DOM ring +\nshared context.selected), Home resets to an identical framing, no runtime errors.\n\nBug found and fixed: <GeoMap>''s aria-live summary effect read the render loop''s\nplain (non-reactive) `slice`, so it only re-ran when the `hasData` flag toggled —\nthe announced count went stale across pans that kept the map populated. Mirror\nthe drawn slice into a reactive `$state.raw` (the same a11y seam <Timeline> uses\nvia context.slice) and derive the summary from it.\n\n- Add a GeoMap mount test asserting the resolved slice''s real count (not the\n  initial empty slice) reaches the live region — a regression guard.\n- Add projectBasemap unit tests (LineString/Polygon/MultiPolygon/FeatureCollection,\n  point-skipping, degenerate-ring dropping, null input).\n- Record the QA pass in ARCHITECTURE.md.\n\n164 tests pass; npm run check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012yK7Lh57BJzhFBMHm9S9WL\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOgPlU+b\n3c1X6PzFkKvwh7ro/cMkNroc/JFK3NVNF5z0zo9rclc8hQCYjqBpsFCADL5yTwZwmgBCCWHsJeOC\n7wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T23:38:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/9f51ba9f037f2bbc33bab30f813d2177d5b7da5a","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDlmNTFiYTlmMDM3ZjJiYmMzM2JhYjMwZjgxM2QyMTc3ZDViN2RhNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f","sha":"f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f"}],"sha":"9f51ba9f037f2bbc33bab30f813d2177d5b7da5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/9f51ba9f037f2bbc33bab30f813d2177d5b7da5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T16:05:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T16:05:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(geo): M3 — <GeoMap> component, GeoViewport, and pluggable geo renderer\n\nAdd the spatial half''s first UI surface as a structural mirror of <Timeline>:\n\n- GeoViewport (state/geoViewport.svelte.ts): focal-point zoom, pan, world\n  clamping, min-span, and aspect-matching, all in normalized projected space so\n  the render loop stays trig-free; WGS84 bounds getter for queryGeo/bind:bounds.\n- GeoMap.svelte: single rAF loop + needsDraw, debounced queryGeo off bounds\n  changes with a stale-response guard, wheel/drag/keyboard interactions, tooltip\n  and selection-ring DOM overlays, aria-live geo summary, and loading/empty/\n  unsupported states. Reuses the ancestor TimelineContext when present so\n  selection/ping/reveal mirror the timeline; queries the full temporal extent\n  (time-range brushing is M4).\n- Pluggable GeoRenderer seam with a GeoCanvasRenderer default (reuses\n  severityColor/severityRGB and the ping pulse); optional GeoJSON basemap\n  projected once to render-space outlines (no tiles, no fetching).\n- Pure interaction modules geoKeys.ts + geoHitTest.ts, unit-tested without a DOM.\n- Demo route shows the map beside the timeline over one WorkerDataSource (geo\n  synthetic data).\n\nTests: GeoViewport, geoKeys, geoHitTest units + a jsdom GeoMap mount test\n(159 passing); npm run check clean. Verified in real Chromium: the map draws,\nreacts to zoom/pan, and Home resets to an identical framing with no JS errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012yK7Lh57BJzhFBMHm9S9WL","tree":{"sha":"2cee2189259488f7f43a92682452361414c31c2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/2cee2189259488f7f43a92682452361414c31c2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2cee2189259488f7f43a92682452361414c31c2e\nparent 14ee3b231838e9c176c3963aef3520b12b56c602\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783181102 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783181102 +0000\n\nfeat(geo): M3 — <GeoMap> component, GeoViewport, and pluggable geo renderer\n\nAdd the spatial half''s first UI surface as a structural mirror of <Timeline>:\n\n- GeoViewport (state/geoViewport.svelte.ts): focal-point zoom, pan, world\n  clamping, min-span, and aspect-matching, all in normalized projected space so\n  the render loop stays trig-free; WGS84 bounds getter for queryGeo/bind:bounds.\n- GeoMap.svelte: single rAF loop + needsDraw, debounced queryGeo off bounds\n  changes with a stale-response guard, wheel/drag/keyboard interactions, tooltip\n  and selection-ring DOM overlays, aria-live geo summary, and loading/empty/\n  unsupported states. Reuses the ancestor TimelineContext when present so\n  selection/ping/reveal mirror the timeline; queries the full temporal extent\n  (time-range brushing is M4).\n- Pluggable GeoRenderer seam with a GeoCanvasRenderer default (reuses\n  severityColor/severityRGB and the ping pulse); optional GeoJSON basemap\n  projected once to render-space outlines (no tiles, no fetching).\n- Pure interaction modules geoKeys.ts + geoHitTest.ts, unit-tested without a DOM.\n- Demo route shows the map beside the timeline over one WorkerDataSource (geo\n  synthetic data).\n\nTests: GeoViewport, geoKeys, geoHitTest units + a jsdom GeoMap mount test\n(159 passing); npm run check clean. Verified in real Chromium: the map draws,\nreacts to zoom/pan, and Home resets to an identical framing with no JS errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012yK7Lh57BJzhFBMHm9S9WL\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOciDDXA\nA+sLviPOykpbh6D6/mZ2B/zK3fIFQNtvS8c8lXoKvRBeV0pCr8MD+Zin2GiS00l126flxyOufgbS\newQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T16:05:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/f86612d3a175ff63360de94c78751df1f28edb4f","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKGY4NjYxMmQzYTE3NWZmNjMzNjBkZTk0Yzc4NzUxZGYxZjI4ZWRiNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/14ee3b231838e9c176c3963aef3520b12b56c602","sha":"14ee3b231838e9c176c3963aef3520b12b56c602","url":"https:/