d records that user-facing geo README docs are intentionally deferred to\nM7. No code or behavior change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019M75wqrArGYpau9R8jWSeq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKbKFJjT\ndTNLN0w2dP2lZHz2CY7AR5alY3S20bZUAud1hMVC4qyUeYlCnINVBQL3LQYt/E39/3KbL+EvKl1m\n3gs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T15:15:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/14b107bea4c345e1299657a8237704d7e4a8d191","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKDE0YjEwN2JlYTRjMzQ1ZTEyOTk2NTdhODIzNzcwNGQ3ZTRhOGQxOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f","sha":"e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f"}],"sha":"14b107bea4c345e1299657a8237704d7e4a8d191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/14b107bea4c345e1299657a8237704d7e4a8d191"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:09:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:09:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(geo): M1 — geo schema, spatial quadtree, and spatio-temporal queries\n\nAdds the spatial half of the data layer without touching the timeline API.\n\nSchema (additive):\n- TimelineEvent gains optional lon/lat (WGS84); events without coords are\n  unchanged on the timeline and simply absent from the map.\n- New GeoBounds, GeoCell, GeoSlice types mirroring TimeRange/Bucket/\n  ViewportSlice.\n\nProjection + index:\n- projection.ts: Web Mercator normalized to the [0,1] unit square, projected\n  once at build time so queries/frames work in flat x/y (lat clamped to ±85°).\n- geoIndex.ts: dependency-free static region quadtree over projected positions.\n  Leaves store event indices sorted by time (binary-searched time sub-slice per\n  leaf); internal nodes carry count/maxSeverity for O(nodes) spatial counts.\n  queryGeo walks bbox candidates, time-filters, and returns points or bins\n  directly into a heat grid in a single O(candidates) pass.\n\nWiring:\n- DataSource: optional geoExtent()/queryGeo(); query() gains an optional bounds\n  filter (the spatial brush) that aggregates only the bbox-matching candidates.\n- Worker protocol + aggregator.worker + WorkerDataSource carry the new methods;\n  bounds/range are sent as plain copies so postMessage can clone them.\n- generateSyntheticData gains an opt-in `geo` mode (Gaussian hotspots); default\n  output and its RNG stream are byte-for-byte unchanged.\n\nTests: projection round-trip/clamp; quadtree build/query correctness vs a\nbrute-force filter (points + cells + countInBounds); synthetic geo clustering;\nInMemory + Worker geo delegation; a benchmark — a typical viewport query over\n100k events runs ~0.5ms (full-extent worst case ~10ms, cached in M2).\n\nnpm test (111 passing) and npm run check both green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019M75wqrArGYpau9R8jWSeq","tree":{"sha":"66237d6aa26538b48d8777fbcb01c9207842490c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/66237d6aa26538b48d8777fbcb01c9207842490c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f","verification":{"payload":"tree 66237d6aa26538b48d8777fbcb01c9207842490c\nparent 7351f6e66c5fd827c75376fa9f17858d461faa7a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783177798 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783177798 +0000\n\nfeat(geo): M1 — geo schema, spatial quadtree, and spatio-temporal queries\n\nAdds the spatial half of the data layer without touching the timeline API.\n\nSchema (additive):\n- TimelineEvent gains optional lon/lat (WGS84); events without coords are\n  unchanged on the timeline and simply absent from the map.\n- New GeoBounds, GeoCell, GeoSlice types mirroring TimeRange/Bucket/\n  ViewportSlice.\n\nProjection + index:\n- projection.ts: Web Mercator normalized to the [0,1] unit square, projected\n  once at build time so queries/frames work in flat x/y (lat clamped to ±85°).\n- geoIndex.ts: dependency-free static region quadtree over projected positions.\n  Leaves store event indices sorted by time (binary-searched time sub-slice per\n  leaf); internal nodes carry count/maxSeverity for O(nodes) spatial counts.\n  queryGeo walks bbox candidates, time-filters, and returns points or bins\n  directly into a heat grid in a single O(candidates) pass.\n\nWiring:\n- DataSource: optional geoExtent()/queryGeo(); query() gains an optional bounds\n  filter (the spatial brush) that aggregates only the bbox-matching candidates.\n- Worker protocol + aggregator.worker + WorkerDataSource carry the new methods;\n  bounds/range are sent as plain copies so postMessage can clone them.\n- generateSyntheticData gains an opt-in `geo` mode (Gaussian hotspots); default\n  output and its RNG stream are byte-for-byte unchanged.\n\nTests: projection round-trip/clamp; quadtree build/query correctness vs a\nbrute-force filter (points + cells + countInBounds); synthetic geo clustering;\nInMemory + Worker geo delegation; a benchmark — a typical viewport query over\n100k events runs ~0.5ms (full-extent worst case ~10ms, cached in M2).\n\nnpm test (111 passing) and npm run check both green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019M75wqrArGYpau9R8jWSeq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGpy9OSS\negftJfbI+5773bOEsMRPkbaXAUY29aDUAOYAGZzyZ6Xh4P5o2uVTXWPvCKIsn4TZcDDLA2I5+oLg\nHAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T15:10:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f","node_id":"C_kwDOTHLAetoAKGU0ZjY3ZWUxODdmMjAwMzIzOTI1YjExNWFjNmE2OWRiOTM3OTk2NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commit/7351f6e66c5fd827c75376fa9f17858d461faa7a","sha":"7351f6e66c5fd827c75376fa9f17858d461faa7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/7351f6e66c5fd827c75376fa9f17858d461faa7a"}],"sha":"e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/e4f67ee187f200323925b115ac6a69db9379964f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/7351f6e66c5fd827c75376fa9f17858d461faa7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T14:43:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T14:43:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: M0 hygiene — fix Full-kit imports, add data-source guidance\n\n- Full-kit README snippet used <RangeSelector /> and <DataTable /> without\n  importing them; add both (plus WorkerDataSource) to the import so the\n  snippet compiles as pasted.\n- Add a \"Choosing a data source\" note: InMemoryDataSource for <10k events or\n  SSR-only use, WorkerDataSource above that (falls back in-thread where Worker\n  is unavailable).\n\nCasing was already consistent (svelteGraph in prose, sveltegraph for the\npackage); no KML/spatial-clustering promises exist in the shipping docs, so\nno roadmap markers were needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019M75wqrArGYpau9R8jWSeq","tree":{"sha":"771dec8672858841e04c3d5c2b1730a6c4c8dc76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/771dec8672858841e04c3d5c2b1730a6c4c8dc76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/7351f6e66c5fd827c75376fa9f17858d461faa7a