de/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/commits/9ea5a82b628c06a3746bd1067d3951dfba571593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:07:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:07:49Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Plan: add SimulationAdapter seam for moving agents (adapter, not engine)\n\nExtends the spatio-temporal plan with a pluggable agent layer: a\nSimulationAdapter interface alongside DataSource whose getPositionsAt\nmust be a pure function of time (scrub-anywhere, nothing to rewind); a\nPlayhead runes class filling the currently missing current-time concept,\nadvanced by the existing rAF loop; and dual render paths — canvas bulk\nmarkers for scale, Svelte snippets for rich low-count visuals — to\npreserve consumer optionality. Pathfinding/routing/agent logic stay\nconsumer-side; the reference waypoint adapter ships as demo code only.\nAdds milestone M6 and renumbers release prep to M7.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FARmbxPdawQQJJuzYALqum","tree":{"sha":"90a1e6c40dd6d24f6cc86b0e70a3465d294df8b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/trees/90a1e6c40dd6d24f6cc86b0e70a3465d294df8b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/johntooth/svelte-spatial/git/commits/9ea5a82b628c06a3746bd1067d3951dfba571593","verification":{"payload":"tree 90a1e6c40dd6d24f6cc86b0e70a3465d294df8b5\nparent b7ed8a96806f0f8a2810483ed32d4f9f9188803d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783166869 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783166869 +0000\n\nPlan: add SimulationAdapter seam for moving agents (adapter, not engine)\n\nExtends the spatio-temporal plan with a pluggable agent layer: a\nSimulationAdapter interface alongside DataSource whose getPositionsAt\nmust be a pure function of time (scrub-anywhere, nothing to rewind); a\nPlayhead runes class filling the currently missing current-time concept,\nadvanced by the existing rAF loop; and dual render paths — canvas bulk\nmarkers for scale, Svelte snippets for rich low-count visuals — to\npreserve consumer optionality. Pathfinding/routing/agent logic stay\nconsumer-side; the reference waypoint adapter ships as demo code only.\nAdds milestone M6 and renumbers release prep to M7.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FARmbxPdawQQJJuzYALqum\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMbdzrgt\njiNtl5VHpZVo1oMi0fUJZJ2QtuYxhGn1PpHD6VO9BVnHFJxpLEzcRklMHQUb0dZxeGcRsgMl3ozO\nBAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T12:07:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt