users/bhaskarmca83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhaskarmca83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhaskarmca83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhaskarmca83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhaskarmca83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhaskarmca83/aisdlc-infra/commits/7916620ede5e483dd50a0c128507580acad1d86e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T16:02:17Z","email":"bhaskarmca83@gmail.com","name":"Bhaskar Boddireddy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T16:02:17Z","email":"bhaskarmca83@gmail.com","name":"Bhaskar Boddireddy"},"message":"feat: implement Terraform modules and Helm charts\n\nTerraform:\n- Root main.tf: VPC + EKS + Aurora PostgreSQL Serverless v2 + ElastiCache Serverless + S3/CloudFront\n- variables.tf, outputs.tf, backend.hcl (S3 state)\n- modules/eks: EKS cluster + managed node group\n- modules/rds: Aurora PostgreSQL Serverless v2 with managed master password\n- modules/redis: ElastiCache Serverless with security group\n- modules/frontend: S3 + CloudFront OAC distribution with SPA routing\n\nHelm:\n- templates: deployment, service, ingress, configmap, hpa, _helpers.tpl\n- values-dev.yaml: 1 replica, no HPA\n- values-staging.yaml: 2 replicas, HPA 2-4\n- values-prod.yaml: 3 replicas, HPA 3-10, HA settings\n\nGitHub Actions:\n- terraform-apply-dev.yml: auto-apply on main branch push\n- terraform-apply-staging.yml: auto-apply on release/* branches\n- terraform-apply-prod.yml: plan+apply with 2-reviewer gate (production env)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63a8599be31d95afd7581c6cfd7cb88f33d4fdfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhaskarmca83/aisdlc-infra/git/trees/63a8599be31d95afd7581c6cfd7cb88f33d4fdfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhaskarmca83/aisdlc-infra/git/commits/7916620ede5e483dd50a0c128507580ac