ontent. Make it `lg:sticky top-0` with its own\nviewport height (`lg:h-dvh lg:self-start`) so the nav rail stays put while\nthe main column scrolls; add `lg:overflow-y-auto` so a tall nav scrolls\ninternally. Mobile off-canvas behaviour is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e5fa84858710c5247163c8898a5154816ccbf39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/trees/3e5fa84858710c5247163c8898a5154816ccbf39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/commits/1f92f1d1334c913065f017a49876aa358ece5a4f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e5fa84858710c5247163c8898a5154816ccbf39\nparent 3b65d3b4428a23bc2911feb9e21183770ba25914\nauthor ramadhinzaid <ramadhinzaid@gmail.com> 1782967705 +0700\ncommitter ramadhinzaid <ramadhinzaid@gmail.com> 1782967705 +0700\n\nfix(layout): keep the sidebar pinned while the page scrolls\n\nOn lg+ the sidebar was `lg:static`, so it sat in normal flow and scrolled\naway with the page on long content. Make it `lg:sticky top-0` with its own\nviewport height (`lg:h-dvh lg:self-start`) so the nav rail stays put while\nthe main column scrolls; add `lg:overflow-y-auto` so a tall nav scrolls\ninternally. Mobile off-canvas behaviour is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgVqf2JuTiwdGd3AkwNUjUuLI2Jn\nKdey+NXdt0TZZooNwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMldKIsxt4utFTy1BI0DxTHHIbbYP7SoUpdDtzyYNRbux658V//GwsRhwZ4lmbXZ36\nHa9PCuhGjf/AuCsVyB5g4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61625805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/following{