":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61625805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramadhinzaid","id":61625805,"login":"ramadhinzaid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjI1ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/commits/4e06ddb6c688467854f06ba0575e08d882b9c006/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T04:28:24Z","email":"ramadhinzaid@gmail.com","name":"ramadhinzaid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T04:28:24Z","email":"ramadhinzaid@gmail.com","name":"ramadhinzaid"},"message":"fix(customers): read JWT from the correct localStorage key\n\nThe Customers module read the access token from `mini-erp.token`, but the\nauth module persists it under `mini-erp.accessToken` (matching the Invoices\nmodule). `getStoredToken()` therefore returned undefined, requests went out\nwithout an Authorization header, and the API answered 401 Unauthorized on\nthe Customers page.\n\nAlign the key with `auth.service.ts`/invoices so the Bearer token is sent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"603475e7295ba50d4746dc23069fa9e493b0580b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/trees/603475e7295ba50d4746dc23069fa9e493b0580b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/commits/4e06ddb6c688467854f06ba0575e08d882b9c006","verification":{"payload":"tree 603475e7295ba50d4746dc23069fa9e493b0580b\nparent 633ac77eba6509f7d802ac3bf6ce41e3dc292f08\nauthor ramadhinzaid <ramadhinzaid@gmail.com> 1782966504 +0700\ncommitter ramadhinzaid <ramadhinzaid@gmail.com> 1782966504 +0700\n\nfix(customers): read JWT from the correct localStorage key\n\nThe Customers module read the access token from `mini-erp.token`, but the\nauth module persists it under `mini-erp.accessToken` (matching the Invoices\nmodule). `getStoredToken()` therefore returned undefined, requests went out\nwithout an Authorization header, and the API answered 401 Unauthorized on\nthe Customers page.\n\nAlign the key with `auth.service.ts`/invoices so the Bearer token is sent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgVqf2JuTiwdGd3AkwNUjUuLI2Jn\nKdey+NXdt0TZZooNwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNpDZUB5S5s/CRRZ3SAXDVsCmIrtlEGlSeYBREwOKhz+G42q6yXjC1Cu6+H/SrsCdo\n5axbmS0uTVhBB1CS5erAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61625805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramadhinzaid","id":61625805,"login":"ramadhinzaid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjI1ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u