"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T19:12:53Z","email":"ramadhinzaid@gmail.com","name":"Ramadhin Zaid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T19:12:53Z","email":"ramadhinzaid@gmail.com","name":"Ramadhin Zaid"},"message":"Web — Update Invoice Status: add InvoiceStatusControl on invoice detail\n\nWire the reserved updateStatus service into the InvoiceDetail Status section\nvia a new InvoiceStatusControl component:\n\n- Shows the current status via InvoiceStatusBadge (including derived OVERDUE).\n- Offers only the valid next actions per status (DRAFT→Mark as sent/Void,\n  SENT & derived OVERDUE→Mark as paid/Void); terminal PAID/VOID expose none and\n  the UI never sends OVERDUE.\n- Gates the Void action on the ADMIN role from useAuth() and confirms it before\n  sending; Spinner while pending; updates badge/invoice on success; surfaces\n  409/403 as a friendly text-error message.\n- Exported through the module index.ts; ErgoSoft semantic tokens only.\n\nUnit tests: InvoiceStatusControl (Vitest + RTL, mocking @/lib/api and useAuth)\ncovering valid actions per status, derived OVERDUE, terminal states, Void\nrole-gating + confirmation, badge update on success, and 409/403 errors; plus\nan updateStatus service test asserting PATCH /invoices/:id/status and unwrap.\nREADME documents the status control and the transitions the UI exposes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31d050dd9722a2b7c6dc5f34619a93aaa08bec07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/trees/31d050dd9722a2b7c6dc5f34619a93aaa08bec07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/commits/936c7073cf59abbb20ed0a90ec6117026a85a90f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61625805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c