Add Invoice Items)\n\nAdd an InvoiceItemsEditor mounted in the InvoiceDetail items section: it lists\nexisting line items with inline Edit/Remove controls plus an Add item form, and\nfeeds each mutation''s returned invoice back up so header/footer totals update\nlive. Editing is gated to DRAFT/SENT statuses (read-only otherwise) and a backend\n409 surfaces as a friendly text-error message; Spinner on pending actions and\nconfirm-on-remove. Wires the reserved addItem/updateItem/removeItem service fns\nthrough the module barrel and documents the capability in the README.\n\nUnit tests: new InvoiceItemsEditor.test.tsx (render, add with live totals,\nvalidation, edit, confirm-remove + dismissed, non-editable statuses, 409/ApiError\nmessages) and new addItem/updateItem/removeItem cases in invoices.service.test.ts\nasserting path/method and { success, data } unwrapping. Full suite green (73).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d5b75eb82a5aa3c5c45f932f091a5e512bf992d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/trees/6d5b75eb82a5aa3c5c45f932f091a5e512bf992d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/commits/70c6dc7f26ea6f46e89732e120e9ccaeb1dc3a59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61625805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramadhinzaid","id":61625805,"login":"ramadhinzaid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjI1ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/