d@gmail.com","name":"ramadhinzaid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T07:09:12Z","email":"ramadhinzaid@gmail.com","name":"ramadhinzaid"},"message":"feat(invoices): invoice domain foundation — create flow + detail shell\n\nScaffold the invoices module (types, service, components, tests, index)\nfollowing the customers pattern:\n\n- types: Invoice, InvoiceItem, InvoiceStatus, InvoiceEvent, InvoiceInput,\n  InvoiceItemInput (money as string|number Decimal)\n- service: createInvoice/getInvoice (real, unwrap {success,data}) plus the\n  reserved sibling surface (list/addItem/updateItem/removeItem/updateStatus/\n  getInvoiceEvents) and formatMoney/computeTotals helpers\n- InvoiceForm: customer picker (via customers module), issue/due dates, tax,\n  notes, inline line-item editor with live subtotal/tax/total, redirect to\n  /invoices/[id] on success\n- InvoiceDetail: detail shell (header + status badge + total + read-only items,\n  slots for status controls & activity timeline)\n- InvoiceStatusBadge, InvoicesSkeleton (semantic ErgoSoft tokens only)\n- routes: /invoices/new, /invoices/[id] (+ loading), inside authenticated shell\n- tests: InvoiceForm + invoices.service (Vitest + RTL)\n- README: document the invoices module and that sibling plans extend it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"341d6048b3768b6ea28e1ecfdfa4ce8a1e9ae600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/trees/341d6048b3768b6ea28e1ecfdfa4ce8a1e9ae600"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ramadhinzaid/mini-erp-web/git/commits/8ad81b0af8ed094cd6cea129317c75efc02bd0d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 341d6048b3768b6ea28e1ecfdfa4ce8a1e9ae600\nparent f8283e95587225675c4e787a53ad75a97fdf8e86\nauthor ramadhinzaid <ramadhinzaid@gmail.com> 1782889752 +0700\ncommitter ramadhinzaid <ramadhinzaid@gmail.com> 1782889752 +0700\n\nfeat(invoices): invoice domain foundation — create flow + detail shell\n\nScaffold the invoices module (types, service, components, tests, index)\nfollowing the customers pattern:\n\n- types: Invoice, InvoiceItem, InvoiceStatus, InvoiceEvent, InvoiceInput,\n  InvoiceItemInput (money as string|number Decimal)\n- service: createInvoice/getInvoice (real, unwrap {success,data}) plus the\n  reserved sibling surface (list/addItem/updateItem/removeItem/updateStatus/\n  getInvoiceEvents) and formatMoney/computeTotals helpers\n- InvoiceForm: customer picker (via customers module), issue/due dates, tax,\n  notes, inline line-item editor with live subtotal/tax/total, redirect to\n  /invoices/[id] on success\n- InvoiceDetail: detail shell (header + status badge + total + read-only items,\n  slots for status controls & activity timeline)\n- InvoiceStatusBadge, InvoicesSkeleton (semantic ErgoSoft tokens only)\n- routes: /invoices/new, /invoices/[id] (+ loading), inside authenticated shell\n- tests: InvoiceForm + invoices.service (Vitest + RTL)\n- README: document the invoices module and that sibling plans extend it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgVqf2JuTiwdGd3AkwNUjUuLI2Jn\nKdey+NXdt0TZZooNwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMI2lg+3pSNYtooNAwYA61ZoD48ue83jaCvd+pyN+tdsgn+xVlSlP7tBz5hO5Dq5N7\nDKkaycHQOVFntHtBnj9wY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61625805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramadhinzaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ramadhinzaid","id":61625805,"login":"ramadhinzaid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjI1ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user