received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/commits/3c47da06eb42429984bacd0ea508abed52e437d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T02:28:44Z","email":"davidguilherme.david@gmail.com","name":"gdavidss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T02:28:44Z","email":"davidguilherme.david@gmail.com","name":"gdavidss"},"message":"feat: real card-fullscreen modal + MCP server for agents\n\nFullscreen now opens the card''s live Metabase question inside a genuine\nmodal (dark backdrop, centered panel, close button, Esc/click-out), not a\nfull-page view. The frontend proxy patches Metabase''s iframe self-check\n(window.self!==window.top -> false) so the full app boots framed; the\ninjected question-page script drops the page-modal hacks and only hides the\nSQL editor/sidebar and persists the chosen visualization per card.\n\nAdds an MCP server (ingestion/arandu/mcp_server.py, compose service ''mcp'' on\n:8808) exposing the same warehouse data behind the charts, read-only, over\nstreamable HTTP with four tools: list_series, search_series, get_series,\nget_series_sources. New navbar button (next to About) shows connect\ninstructions. Documented in README and metasystemic/agent-interface.md.","tree":{"sha":"87d38f16963d9019731572763fe5119335fdd866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/git/trees/87d38f16963d9019731572763fe5119335fdd866"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/git/commits/3c47da06eb42429984bacd0ea508abed52e437d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten