gdavidss"},"message":"feat: use Metabase''s native visualization editor in fullscreen, persisted in browser\n\nCard click opens the real Metabase question view (the native ''Visualização'' editor:\ntable, pie, bar, line, settings — anything), authenticated via a server-side proxy\nsession so there''s no login wall. The chosen visualization is serialized by Metabase\ninto the URL and persisted per-card in localStorage, restored on reopen. Removed the\nfrom-scratch ECharts viewer and the echarts dependency. About panel rewritten in the\nconstitution''s voice; subtitle ''Consulta Cívica''.","tree":{"sha":"9ae154a6b8cdda263d38a01f86eee911d3ffa8e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/git/trees/9ae154a6b8cdda263d38a01f86eee911d3ffa8e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/git/commits/8acb0c2212b40f763e627908b8752056feb0dcd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62527620?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss","id":62527620,"login":"gdavidss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTI3NjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss/arandu/commit/8acb0c2212b40f763e627908b8752056feb0dcd6","node_id":"C_kwDOTHS3fNoAKDhhY2IwYzIyMTJiNDBmNzYzZTYyNzkwOGI4NzUyMDU2ZmViMGRjZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss/arandu/commit/1eeb698fb5652a7c6e63974f5f95eb512cac0522","sha":"1eeb698fb5652a7c6e63974f5f95eb512cac0522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/commits/1eeb698fb5652a7c6e63974f5f95eb512cac0522"}],"sha":"8acb0c2212b40f763e627908b8752056feb0dcd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/commits/8acb0c2212b40f763e627908b8752056feb0dcd6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62527620?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss","id":62527620,"login":"gdavidss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTI3NjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/commits/1eeb698fb5652a7c6e63974f5f95eb512cac0522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T06:16:01Z","email":"davidguilherme.david@gmail.com","name":"gdavidss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T06:16:01Z","email":"davidguilherme.david@gmail.com","name":"gdavidss"},"message":"feat: client-side card viewer (ECharts) + info/about panel; subtitle ''Consulta Cívica''\n\n- Card click opens our own viewer that pulls the card''s PUBLIC data and renders it with\n  ECharts. Chart type, log axis, and zoom are editable and persisted per-card in the\n  browser (localStorage). No Metabase login, nothing written to the server.\n- Removed the ''Editar no Metabase'' link.\n- Added a top-right info button opening an About panel (what Arandu is, GitHub, constitution,\n  contributing, data standard).\n- Wordmark subtitle: Consulta Cívica. metabase_setup now emits display_by_name.","tree":{"sha":"68e95f76fd8da353bdeec3fd53134c04c4491663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/git/trees/68e95f76fd8da353bdeec3fd53134c04c4491663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gdavidss/arandu/git/commits/1eeb698fb5652a7c6e63974f5f95eb512cac0522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62527620?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss","id":62527620,"login":"gdavidss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTI3NjIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gdavidss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss/arandu/commit/1eeb698fb5652a7c6e63974f5f95eb512cac0522","node_id":"C_kwDOTHS3fNoAKDFlZWI2OThmYjU2NTJhN2M2ZTYzOTc0ZjVmOTVlYjUxMmNhYzA1MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gdavidss/arandu/commit/2a6331779f8a54ad0324f0a557