@expo/cli (expo -> @expo/cli\n-> expo-router) and gets hoisted to root node_modules by npm, so Metro''s\nSDK 56 compatibility check fires even though this app never depends on\nexpo-router directly. Set the documented escape hatch\n(EXPO_ROUTER_DISABLE_RN_NAVIGATION_CHECK=1) via a committed .env, and\nrename navigation files to match the structure documented in README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7db4d4e0cd90a772669546d3738039094e5f1192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paewerapat/react-native-product-favorites/git/trees/7db4d4e0cd90a772669546d3738039094e5f1192"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paewerapat/react-native-product-favorites/git/commits/91206095a9b608259856ff176b0d7d69239813d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215466111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/werapatp","id":215466111,"login":"werapatp","node_id":"U_kgDODNfAfw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/werapatp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paewerapat/react-native-product-favorites/commit/91206095a9b608259856ff176b0d7d69239813d3","node_id":"C_kwDOTHa2mtoAKDkxMjA2MDk1YTliNjA4MjU5ODU2ZmYxNzZiMGQ3ZDY5MjM5OD