phy\n\nSkills'' SkillsScene (python-core-cube hero + orbiting Django/DRF/\nPostgres/Redis nodes) now scales down together as one composition\n(1.3 -> 0.82, brightness settling) as the reader scrolls through a\n140vh driver, desktop only — same technique as About. Skill category\ncards get a whileInView stagger reveal.\n\nWired useScrollAdvance for Skills -> Projects: COMPLETED requires\nreaching the bottom of the page''s actual content (categories +\nTechStack below), not just the object settling early in the scroll.\nReduced-motion skips the scrub scene, same as About.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6330daf5ec52ee2773978352f67ccf23a9ead63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/e6330daf5ec52ee2773978352f67ccf23a9ead63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/009d630828e728b5b08465a5de88c4a7be1252ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/009d630828e728b5b08465a5de88c4a7be1252ea","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKDAwOWQ2MzA4MjhlNzI4YjViMDg0NjVhNWRlODhjNGE3YmUxMjUyZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b","sha":"bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b"}],"sha":"009d630828e728b5b08465a5de88c4a7be1252ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/009d630828e728b5b08465a5de88c4a7be1252ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T12:14:43Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T12:14:43Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"About -> Skills scroll navigation, with real object choreography\n\nAbout now has its own scroll-scrubbed scene: the fullstack-workstation\nobject starts large and dominant (scale 1.35, brighter) and settles to\nits resting scale (0.8) as the user scrolls through a 140vh driver,\ndesktop only (mobile keeps the simpler static background composition\nper the mobile-simplification guidance). Principle cards get a light\nwhileInView stagger reveal instead of appearing with no animation at\nall.\n\nWired useScrollAdvance for About -> Skills: COMPLETED here means\n\"reached the bottom of About''s content\" (principles + the existing\nExperienceSnapshot section below), not just the object settling —\notherwise the page would try to navigate away before the reader had\nseen the rest of it. Reduced-motion skips the scrub scene entirely\n(object animates once via a lower-key intro, no scroll-scrubbing).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be941ee3ce2da38816db7a247ab821810d8dced7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/be941ee3ce2da38816db7a247ab821810d8dced7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGJjMjgxOWJmZDUwZTYwZTFjYzBlOGRmYjAzMDVjNmUxYzMwZTIyNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3","sha":"a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3"}],"sha":"bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/bc2819bfd50e60e1cc0e8dfb0305c6e1c30e226b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T12:07:03Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T12:07:03Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Add scroll-driven navigation: Home -> About vertical slice\n\nCentral route-order config (lib/portfolio-routes.ts) replacing the\nORDER array duplicated in both PageNav.tsx and PageTransition.tsx.\n\nNew useScrollAdvance hook: once a page''s scene reports COMPLETED (via\na ref, not React state, to avoid re-rendering on every scroll tick),\none more deliberate wheel/touch gesture past an accumulated threshold\nnavigates to the next route — a single trackpad flick can''t fire twice,\nreversing direction resets the accumulator, and it''s fully disabled\nunder prefers-reduced-motion (buttons/links only, per the requirement\nthat reduced motion never auto-navigates from a gesture). Also backs\noff if a form field is focused or a dialog is open.\n\nWired into Home''s Hero: its existing scroll-crossfade ScrollTrigger now\nreports progress via onUpdate, and once that reaches ~0.98 (cards fully\nin, matching the crossfade''s own completed state) scrolling further\nnavigates to /about. Existing Previous/Next buttons, browser history,\nand direct route loads are all untouched — this only adds an\nadditional path to the same navigation, it doesn''t replace anything.\n\nThis is intentionally scoped to Home -> About only, per the explicit\ninstruction to prove the pattern on one transition before applying it\nelsewhere; About/Skills/Projects/Certificates/Contact do not yet have\nmatching scene-completion tracking wired to this hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbdfef46baf381ff5aaae9d15f9f62d46155f0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/dbdfef46baf381ff5aaae9d15f9f62d46155f0b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGEzMjQwMzNkNjI1MTlhNWNjNTI3OTEwMDdkZjU5ZjdhOTA3MzkwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2","sha":"8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2"}],"sha":"a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/a324033d62519a5cc52791007df59f7a907390a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:54:38Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:54:38Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Redesign Certificates page as a ring carousel with a featured card\n\nRebuilt around the reference design: a left sidebar (category filter +\nclickable certificate list, active one highlighted) and a right-side\n\"ring\" — nextjs-portal spinning slowly, devops-infinity faint behind\nit (opacity 15%) — with the selected certificate shown as a centered\nfeatured card (title, issuer, date, View Credential link). Adjacent\ncertificates peek from behind the ring as small preview tiles;\nprev/next arrow buttons cycle the featured certificate, wrapping\naround the filtered list. Selecting a category resets to the first\nmatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aebf2b520bddabb1b08952c58f77fbc9ac439519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/aebf2b520bddabb1b08952c58f77fbc9ac439519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKDhjMTFmM2ViZGJiYTViZjQ2NmZkNTUzNjQ1YjgyMTVhNWU4MDdhYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f","sha":"acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f"}],"sha":"8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/8c11f3ebdbba5bf466fd553645b8215a5e807aa2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:29:08Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:29:08Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Remove buggy Home particle layer; add small far-corner cycling floaters\n\nThe particles-kit background layer added last turn was rendering\nincorrectly (showing up near the bottom-left instead of its intended\nposition) — removed it entirely rather than trying to patch the\npositioning bug.\n\nReplaced with HomeFloaters: two small (14-20px scale) decorative icons\ntucked in the far corners of the hero, well outside the centered\ncontent column, well behind the portrait/headline/cards (low z-index,\nopacity ~25%). Each corner cycles through a small pool of icons\n(infra/security icons in one corner, python-core-cube/data-connector\nin the other) every 4.5-5.2s with a crossfade — only one icon per\ncorner visible at a time, not several floating objects at once.\n\nUsed the already-processed transparent versions of these assets\n(verified real alpha via sharp) rather than the raw chroma-green\nsource files, which aren''t meant for direct use per the asset pack''s\nown docs.\n\nThe main portrait — explicitly asked to keep, just \"too big\" — is\nnow modestly smaller (max-w-[15rem]/max-w-xs instead of max-w-xs/\nmax-w-sm, 36-42vh instead of 42-48vh on mobile/tablet) without\nremoving anything.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b006204f46780cbf60149197b5aec3daa512037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/4b006204f46780cbf60149197b5aec3daa512037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGFjZGFkZTUyNjQyZTZkYTYyMzQ0OGM0OGRkNjYzY2Y2NWJkYTdiOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321","sha":"d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321"}],"sha":"acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/acdade52642e6da623448c48dd663cf65bda7b9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:10:34Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:10:34Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Stagger 3D scene entrance: hero assembles first, satellites pop in after\n\nAll layers of a 3D scene were appearing simultaneously on page load.\nFloatingAsset now plays a one-time entrance animation on mount (fade +\nslide + scale, via framer-motion), split across two nested elements so\nit doesn''t fight the continuous CSS float/spin/pulse animation for\ntransform (both were targeting the same element before).\n\nSkillsScene assembles in sequence: connector and hero cube fade in\nfirst, then each satellite node (Django, DRF, PostgreSQL, Redis) pops\nin afterward, alternating left/right, staggered ~150ms apart. Other\npages'' single-object scenes get the same fade-in by default. Respects\nprefers-reduced-motion (skips the entrance transform entirely).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80e1ad4fd5415577c8b17fbcc849dd70abf0f129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/80e1ad4fd5415577c8b17fbcc849dd70abf0f129"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGQxYjQ1YjdhN2Q4OTk1Zjc3OGQ0NzNmM2NkYjIyYzJiNjhhNDUzMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded","sha":"77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded"}],"sha":"d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/d1b45b7a7d8995f778d473f3cdb22c2b68a45321"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:03:09Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:03:09Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Integrate ALS 3D asset pack: real per-page 3D scenes with independent motion\n\nReplaced the old single-flattened-image LayeredObject/object-manifest\nsystem with the new modular ALS 3D asset pack (verified genuine alpha\ntransparency via sharp before use, not just visual preview). Each\nobject is its own independently animated layer per the pack''s rule —\nnever flattened into one background image:\n\n- Home: added a subtle particles-kit background layer (desktop only,\n  low opacity, particle-drift motion) behind the existing scene,\n  without touching the portrait or GridScan.\n- About: fullstack-workstation hero with float motion.\n- Skills: new SkillsScene — python-core-cube as the centered hero,\n  Django/DRF/PostgreSQL/Redis as orbiting satellite nodes with\n  staggered float timing, data-connector pulsing behind them.\n- Projects: glass-card-placeholder as depth decoration.\n- Certificates: nextjs-portal with a slow continuous portal-spin.\n- Contact: devops-infinity hero.\n\nEvery scene keeps the established pattern: full inline version on\ndesktop, a low-opacity pointer-events-none copy behind content on\nmobile (not hidden entirely as before), and respects\nprefers-reduced-motion (animations disabled, composition stays).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47797b0011cee0a4a8dc7a03a357fde937992814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/47797b0011cee0a4a8dc7a03a357fde937992814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKDc3Yjg0MDVlYjExY2ZhMTRhZmViMTFhODg1ODUwMzU2YjExNDZkZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949","sha":"ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949"}],"sha":"77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/77b8405eb11cfa14afeb11a885850356b1146ded"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:52:10Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:52:10Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Show 3D layered objects as a background on mobile; add real 3D tilt\n\nEvery page''s decorative 3D object (backend/workstation/projects/devops/\ncertificate) was hidden entirely below the lg breakpoint (hidden\nlg:block), so mobile never saw them at all. Each page now also renders\na low-opacity, non-interactive copy behind its section content on\nmobile (absolute, pointer-events-none, lg:hidden so the desktop\ninline version takes back over) — matching \"show it in the background\non mobile\" rather than fighting the single-column layout for space.\n\nLayeredObject also gained the same cursor-driven 3D tilt technique as\nthe Home portrait (Tilt3D with globalTilt), on top of its existing\nfloat animation, so it reads as a real 3D object reacting to the\nviewport rather than a flat floating image. Respects reduced-motion.\n\nAlso added missing cursor-target to Certificates'' category filter\nbuttons and credential links.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25a4000667acfac07d55ede5458a7e2b1da78c9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/25a4000667acfac07d55ede5458a7e2b1da78c9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGNlYjkwMDE2NTAzYzM4OTRiMWY0NTRkNWViNzRjYWFlNzNiNGM5NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880","sha":"a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880"}],"sha":"ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/ceb90016503c3894b1f454d5eb74caae73b4c949"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:30:33Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:30:33Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Extend cursor-target to remaining glass-panel cards and Chip badges\n\nThe Projects page''s \"Production Stack\" tech chips and \"Production\npipeline\" step badges/cards/log lines had no .cursor-target, so\nTargetCursor never tracked them. Added it to Chip (used for every\ntech-stack/skill badge site-wide), Pipeline''s step badges/cards/log\nentries, MetricCard, and TerminalPanel — the remaining glass-panel\ncard components that didn''t already have it (CommandCard already did).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"144dfb509ee46fa96425c44562c9970b1127037b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/144dfb509ee46fa96425c44562c9970b1127037b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGExYjhkMzRhNzQwZWEzMTkzODE2Y2ExMjM3NTIzYmJiOTZlNzk4ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300","sha":"f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300"}],"sha":"a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/a1b8d34a740ea3193816ca1237523bbb96e79880"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:20:57Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:20:57Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Reset scroll on click (not on route-change effects); slow down Home auto-scroll\n\nThe scroll-reset kept failing because every previous attempt hooked\ninto some React/animation lifecycle moment (pathname change, exit\ncomplete) whose exact timing relative to the actual DOM swap wasn''t\nreliable. Now resetting scroll synchronously in a capture-phase click\nlistener on any internal link — the instant the user clicks, before\nReact re-renders, before Next.js starts the route change, before any\ntransition animation. This removes the timing race entirely rather\nthan trying to win it.\n\nHome''s idle auto-scroll used the browser''s native \"smooth\" scrollTo,\nwhose duration is short and outside our control — it blew through the\nwhole object-to-cards crossfade too fast to read. Replaced with a\nmanual requestAnimationFrame-driven scroll over a deliberate ~6.5s\n(eased), and pushed the idle-detection delay from 1.4s to 2.2s so the\nheadline is readable before it starts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc69183d754090103fc8a859a9ad8ce963e0bfb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/cc69183d754090103fc8a859a9ad8ce963e0bfb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGYwYzU5ODAzNTM0ZjQ3NjUwOGU5MjdlNTg3OTVmMmIwNjJhNjEzMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81","sha":"7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81"}],"sha":"f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/f0c59803534f476508e927e58795f2b062a61300"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:07:54Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:07:54Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Remove global scroll-behavior:smooth causing pages to open mid-scroll\n\nPatching individual scrollTo call sites to force behavior:\"instant\"\nwasn''t fully solving it — the global CSS scroll-behavior:smooth on\n<html> can still interact with scroll restoration and other implicit\nbrowser scrolls beyond what we control per-call. Removed it entirely;\nany spot that wants a smooth scroll (Home''s idle auto-scroll) already\nrequests it explicitly via the scrollTo options object, which doesn''t\ndepend on this CSS rule.\n\nAlso hardened PageTransition''s reset: set\nhistory.scrollRestoration = \"manual\" so the browser never tries to\nrestore a previous scroll offset on navigation, and re-apply the\ninstant top reset once more after a paint (rAF) in case async content\nshifts the scroll position in between.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28ed842eb739102e962d02d87997dcf4da995e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/28ed842eb739102e962d02d87997dcf4da995e43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKDdjN2I4ZTczMWI0MTdiMzI1MDY0YWEwMmE3ZmEzZTZjMWUwY2ZkODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977","sha":"74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977"}],"sha":"7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/7c7b8e731b417b325064aa02a7fa3e6c1e0cfd81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:49:21Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:49:21Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Fix About page opening at the bottom; extend cursor-target coverage\n\nRoot cause of \"About page opens from the end\": the site sets\nscroll-behavior: smooth globally, which applies to every scrollTo call\nregardless of signature. Our scroll-to-top reset on route change was\ntherefore animating smoothly from Home''s tall scroll position — still\nmid-scroll when the much shorter About page''s content swapped in, so\nthe browser clamped the in-flight position to the new (shorter)\npage''s max scroll, landing at the bottom. All scroll-reset calls now\nforce behavior: \"instant\".\n\nAlso:\n- Added .cursor-target to GlowButton (Home''s View Projects/Contact Me),\n  CaseStudyCard''s Architecture/Live Site/View Details/case-study-dialog\n  links, and Contact''s mailto/social links/ContactForm buttons — these\n  were missing the custom cursor tracking that the rest of the site has.\n- Home''s idle auto-scroll-through-crossfade now runs on all viewports,\n  not just mobile.\n- Home portrait now aligns left on mobile instead of centering, to\n  match the desktop layout and read less awkwardly next to the\n  overlaid text/cards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a91eca8a77ef8025b919cbb30148776aea4f3d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/a91eca8a77ef8025b919cbb30148776aea4f3d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKDc0YTY2YmU3YzkwY2FmZTRlNWYwODI5OTk5NmNhZWE0YWE2ZWY5Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80","sha":"c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80"}],"sha":"74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/74a66be7c90cafe4e5f08299996caea4aa6ef977"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:38:02Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:38:02Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Reset scroll to top on every route change; auto-play Home crossfade on mobile\n\nPages were opening at whatever scroll position the previous page left\nbehind instead of at the top. PageTransition now resets scroll the\ninstant the route changes (before the exit/enter animation even\nstarts), on top of the existing post-transition reset.\n\nSeeing Home''s full object-to-cards crossfade takes a lot of manual\nscrolling on a phone. If the user hasn''t scrolled, touched, or pressed\na key shortly after landing on Home (on viewports under the desktop\nbreakpoint), it now auto-scrolls smoothly through the crossfade once;\nany real input cancels it immediately and hands control back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9987f0b7769c19039500d10d60f6c150aa341e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/f9987f0b7769c19039500d10d60f6c150aa341e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80","node_id":"C_kwDOTH6j39oAKGM3NTNiZmJkMjgyOTQ5ZmViMmEzYWI1MTQwMWRiYWM3NmU3NDVkODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commit/2b4a0913277c597f3eaef89861b87022f299f1c6","sha":"2b4a0913277c597f3eaef89861b87022f299f1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/2b4a0913277c597f3eaef89861b87022f299f1c6"}],"sha":"c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/c753bfbd282949feb2a3ab51401dbac76e745d80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AisStartCoding","id":165084957,"login":"AisStartCoding","node_id":"U_kgDOCdb_HQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/commits/2b4a0913277c597f3eaef89861b87022f299f1c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T01:29:16Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T01:29:16Z","email":"165084957+AisStartCoding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"AisStartCoding"},"message":"Fix Home crossfade landing mid-state and frozen cursor highlight on nav\n\nHome''s Hero used window scroll position to compute its scrub-based\ncrossfade; navigating back to Home (via the navbar logo, PageNav, etc.)\nwhile scrolled partway down another page left that leftover scroll\nposition in place, so the crossfade rendered already half-transitioned\n(cards showing, headline gone) instead of its initial state. Hero now\nresets scroll to top and refreshes ScrollTrigger on mount.\n\nSeparately, TargetCursor''s hover highlight relies on the hovered\nelement firing \"mouseleave\" to clear itself — a route change can\nremove that element from the DOM without ever firing it, freezing the\ncorner brackets on a detached target. TargetCursor now force-clears its\nactive target whenever the route changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"952f2f2aa84437856eabe5ceabba57331d02f716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/trees/952f2f2aa84437856eabe5ceabba57331d02f716"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AisStartCoding/ABDULLAH_PROTFOLIO/git/commits/2b4a0913277c597f3eaef89861b87022f299f1c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165084957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AisStartCoding/f