://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FengYibin-TAL/best-practice-for-AI-front-end/commits/ac7493ecb188783e7211ad338066475ca008670b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T09:42:15Z","email":"fengyibin2@tal.com","name":"FengYibin-TAL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T09:42:15Z","email":"fengyibin2@tal.com","name":"FengYibin-TAL"},"message":"chore: close-out review fixes\n\nCritical:\n- README.md: replace placeholder with full project overview, structure, quick-start, report index\n- docs/experiment-reports/comparison-report.md: fix broken ../measurements/ image paths → measurements/\n\nModerate:\n- demo/README.md: fix stale ../docx/ → ../docs/, add ⑤ MF row, update directory listing\n- demo/spec/feature-spec.md: add deprecation notice (v2 impl diverged: removed analytics, added flip-match)\n- .gitignore: add generate-report.js/package.json/package-lock.json to prevent re-tracking\n- Remove root node_modules/, package.json, package-lock.json, generate-report.js from git (--cached)\n\nMinor:\n- demo/react-shadcn-mf/shell/vite.config.ts: comment hardcoded localhost URLs as local-preview-only\n- demo/react-shadcn-mf/start-preview.sh: document macOS-specific sed syntax + bug context\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c256350d4a4b2c0a778997b251c9713a7a1435fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FengYibin-TAL/best-practice-for-AI-front-end/git/trees/c256350d4a4b2c0a778997b251c9713a7a1435fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FengYibin-TAL/best-practice-for-AI-front-end/git/commits/ac7493ecb188783e7211ad338066475ca008670b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser