users/FengYibin-TAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FengYibin-TAL","id":235683423,"login":"FengYibin-TAL","node_id":"U_kgDODgw-Xw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FengYibin-TAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FengYibin-TAL/best-practice-for-AI-front-end/commits/3bd33ca04ac76ff9ceba7331dd0c6f0b649dcdb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T09:30:29Z","email":"fengyibin2@tal.com","name":"FengYibin-TAL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T09:30:29Z","email":"fengyibin2@tal.com","name":"FengYibin-TAL"},"message":"feat: add micro-frontend demo (⑤ react-shadcn-mf) + MF vs SPA comparison\n\n实现：\n- 按关卡拆分：shell(host) + level1/2/3(remotes)，Module Federation via @originjs/vite-plugin-federation\n- Shell 持有全局状态，通过 props 传入子应用，子应用纯渲染无状态\n- Tailwind CSS 由 Shell 统一生成（@source 扫描所有子应用 tsx）\n- Playwright 9/9 通过，0 console error\n\n测量结果（vs react-shadcn SPA）：\n- LOC: 662 → 920（+39%），主因类型重复 + 中间层文件\n- Bundle 首屏: 63KB → 129KB（preview 模式 React 未共享）\n- 理想生产部署首屏估算: ~20KB（react singleton 生效后）\n\n工程坑记录（见 measurements/method-mf/mf-single-shot.md）：\n- vite-plugin-federation 1.4.x CSS 注入 bug（forEach on string），需 sed patch\n- 跨 MF 边界 setState warning，用 requestAnimationFrame 延迟回调解决\n- vite preview SPA fallback 会覆盖 remoteEntry.js，需用 /assets/ 路径\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc3994f6c13e0be0fbb0b871e9e39369ec644ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FengYibin-TAL/best-practice-for-AI-front-end/git/trees/bc3994f6c13e0be0fbb0b871e9e39369ec644ec3"},"url":"https: