rs options active-first (matches .id, stable per page); button mode\n  stays fixed EN | ID so nothing jumps on click\n- onChange is now optional\n\nAll additive/backward-compatible. Verified in the gallery: button mode still renders\nEN | ID, 0 errors; link mode type-checked + in the dist.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"919c996e97fa80f22fdfb3a4c13a899e98f71341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/919c996e97fa80f22fdfb3a4c13a899e98f71341"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/7b839420cb7d79198d70f93342d5bb64e2b97ab2","verification":{"payload":"tree 919c996e97fa80f22fdfb3a4c13a899e98f71341\nparent 42eda3099237287f45c084fad9aa6423ec645a7b\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783240664 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783240664 +0700\n\nfeat(ds-toggle): LangToggle can render SEO links (hrefFor/renderLink/hreflang) (#24)\n\nSo .id can adopt LangToggle for its bilingual nav switcher (which must ship crawlable\nhreflang locale links, not buttons):\n- `hrefFor` renders each option as <a hreflang aria-current> to that locale''s URL\n- `renderLink` supplies a router <Link> for SPA nav (falls back to <a>)\n- link mode orders options active-first (matches .id, stable per page); button mode\n  stays fixed EN | ID so nothing jumps on click\n- onChange is now optional\n\nAll additive/backward-compatible. Verified in the gallery: button mode still renders\nEN | ID, 0 errors; link mode type-checked + in the dist.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqShfYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAw4EQAK+7EjoBQ+RVBZXSoWWta4IL\npDdg7VB9czCc5EmbA8r06IqamQljPyx0g80SDkAHatqG1OQNvFBXFzH/YyWGQO2p\na3I3+Zhl1eBaLBSN7kV7INXC8kNg61CB33In3j