mments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/4fef9a3761e55341031763b2991ab84ef02ce8a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T07:01:02Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T07:01:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ds-pagination): PaginationNav is plain-text, matching pangaea.id (not pills) (#22)\n\n.id''s /article pager is centred accent-ink text links (← Newer · Page X of Y · Older →),\nbut ds-pnav had styled it as bordered pill buttons with ‹ › arrows. Rewrite .rv-pnav/\n.rv-pnav-btn/.rv-pnav-status to .id''s plain-text look (no border/bg, underline on hover,\nmuted status) and switch the arrows to ← →. Keeps the 44px touch target; drops the\npress-scale (a text link shouldn''t shrink). Fidelity fix — .id wins per the parity rule.\n\nVerified in the gallery: \"← Newer\" link, 0px border, transparent bg, accent-ink, 44px.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79fff0e96d9cccc1d7986322c9276be53a690984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/79fff0e96d9cccc1d7986322c9276be53a690984"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/4fef9a3761e55341031763b2991ab84ef02ce8a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 79fff0e96d9cccc1d7986322c9276be53a690984\nparent 66bcc9abda2b3318d7408bb1a9ac0ae79831d842\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783234862 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783234862 +0700\n\nfix(ds-pagination): PaginationNav is plain-text, matching pangaea.id (not pills) (#22)\n\n.id''s /article pager is centred accent-ink text links (← Newer · Page X of Y · Older →),\nbut ds-pnav had styled it as bordered pill buttons with ‹ › arrows. Rewrite .rv-pnav/\n.rv-pnav-btn/.rv-pnav-status to .id''s plain-text look (no border/bg, underline on hov