users/labspangaea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/labspangaea","id":291584219,"login":"labspangaea","node_id":"U_kgDOEWE42w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/96a7df9f5492914268bac86934efd8dd6c77cfe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T06:47:56Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T06:47:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ds-pagination): PaginationNav gains status + renderLink (pangaea.id parity) (#20)\n\nSo .id can adopt PaginationNav for its localized, SPA-routed /article pager:\n- `status` prop overrides the hardcoded \"Page X of Y\" (i18n — .id needs \"Halaman X dari Y\")\n- `renderLink` lets consumers render the prev/next items with a router <Link> (SPA nav)\n  instead of the default full-reload <a href>\n- add aria-live=\"polite\" to the status span so page changes announce during client nav\n\nAll additive/backward-compatible. Verified in the gallery: PaginationNav renders, status\ncarries aria-live, 0 errors.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d35775ffe081986939cc549f367e5a3eb1e30fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/2d35775ffe081986939cc549f367e5a3eb1e30fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/96a7df9f5492914268bac86