,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/d12dc44bbf5da6e11b76534fd12d9a815c64f341"}],"sha":"4314e3d281cf1074cdfa464e4c389db2dee516dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/4314e3d281cf1074cdfa464e4c389db2dee516dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291584219?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/labspangaea","id":291584219,"login":"labspangaea","node_id":"U_kgDOEWE42w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/d12dc44bbf5da6e11b76534fd12d9a815c64f341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T06:12:15Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T06:12:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ds-toggle): ThemeToggle restores from localStorage + pure setState updater (#18)\n\npangaea.id-parity fixes so .id can adopt ds-toggle''s ThemeToggle:\n- mount effect reads localStorage(''pg_theme''), not just the pre-paint attribute, so\n  the theme restores in dev (Vite strips the inline pre-paint <script>) and after reload\n- move side effects (attribute/localStorage/onChange) out of the setState updater into\n  the handler — an updater must be pure; calling onChange there updated the parent\n  mid-render (\"Cannot update a component while rendering a different component\")\n- set data-rv-theme=\"light\" explicitly instead of removeAttribute, matching the effect\n\nVerified in the gallery: click flips + persists, reload restores dark, aria-pressed\ntracks state, 0 console errors (the setState-in-render warning is gone).\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9841cb1384ab5c32e814f6713abc194562359bb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/9841cb1384ab5c32e814f6713abc194562359bb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/d12dc44bbf5da6e11b76534fd12d9a815c64f341","verification":{"payload":"tree 9841cb1384ab5c32e814f6713abc194562359bb8\nparent d0b5defbcf89a5a6e5c0c51eb15922882f125779\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783231935 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783231935 +0700\n\nfix(ds-toggle): ThemeToggle restores from localStorage + pure setState updater (#18)\n\npangaea.id-parity fixes so .id can adopt ds-toggle''s ThemeToggle:\n- mount effect reads localStorage(''pg_theme''), not just the pre-paint attribute, so\n  the theme restores in dev (Vite strips the inline pre-paint <script>) and after reload\n- move side effects (attribute/localStorage/onChange) out of the setState updater into\n  the handler — an updater must be pure; calling onChange there updated the parent\n  mid-render (\"Cannot update a component while rendering a different component\")\n- set data-rv-theme=\"light\" explicitly instead of removeAttribute, matching the effect\n\nVerified in the gallery: click flips + persists, reload restores dark, aria-pressed\ntracks state, 0 console errors (the setState-in-render warning is gone).\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gm