otes parity) (#12)\n\nCloses the one remaining design divergence. ds-testimonial had only a rotating\ncarousel (.rv-tcar); pangaea.id also ships a static 2-col grid of bare quote\nblocks (.rv-quotes). Add TestimonialGrid reproducing it byte-identically: a\n1.05rem blockquote + a mono 0.78rem caption, no card surface, collapsing to one\ncolumn ≤640px. Reuses the Testimonial item shape. Gallery Testimonial story gets\na layout control (carousel | grid). Verified light + dark; build + tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6686580fe74ae72faba08994bfe7d935eab50241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/6686580fe74ae72faba08994bfe7d935eab50241"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/7ecca7059f608e6c26956bb068362acdb3970f96","verification":{"payload":"tree 6686580fe74ae72faba08994bfe7d935eab50241\nparent f58e1294f812bcefc396bf2d85b44c2b4df7ba62\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783179734 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783179734 +0700\n\nfeat(ds-testimonial): add TestimonialGrid — static grid variant (pangaea.id .rv-quotes parity) (#12)\n\nCloses the one remaining design divergence. ds-testimonial had only a rotating\ncarousel (.rv-tcar); pangaea.id also ships a static 2-col grid of bare quote\nblocks (.rv-quotes). Add TestimonialGrid reproducing it byte-identically: a\n1.05rem blockquote + a mono 0.78rem caption, no card surface, collapsing to one\ncolumn ≤640px. Reuses the Testimonial item shape. Gallery Testimonial story gets\na layout control (carousel | grid). Verified light + dark; build + tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSSnWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhzsQABNi5NUIo5UF7b7x21q4