a/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/35fd657ec7fa2a73578f84d7409b51b26374eff1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:23:43Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:23:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ds-navbar,ds-field,ds-toggle): close pangaea.id parity gaps (#10)\n\nComponent-by-component parity audit results (feature gaps + real bugs; the\ndeliberate WCAG improvements in .ui are kept, not reverted):\n\n- ds-navbar: ship .rv-nav-cta (gradient + pulsing-ring primary CTA, reduced-motion\n  aware) ported verbatim from pangaea.id — was missing (generic actions slot only).\n- ds-field: add the form-layout kit — Form (.rv-form), FieldRow (.rv-field-row, 2-up,\n  collapses ≤460px), FormNote (.rv-form-note), FormStatus (.rv-form-ok/.rv-form-err)\n  — so a consumer can reproduce pangaea.id''s AdoptForm; was single stacked Fields only.\n- ds-toggle: LangToggle active option = solid navy pill / white text (--rv-brand/#fff,\n  matches .rv-lang-opt.active) instead of a pale-blue chip; align option metrics\n  (0.72rem/0.04em/3px 9px); dynamic ThemeToggle aria-label.\n\nAlso audited & confirmed AT PARITY (no change): ds-hero, ds-pricing, ds-avatar,\nds-badge, ds-accordion, ds-stat, ds-table, ds-compare, ds-dodont. ds-testimonial is\na rotating carousel vs pangaea.id''s static grid — a design divergence, left as-is.\n\nVerified in the gallery light + dark; build:pkgs + gallery build + tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca314aa2d7fded9a551360660d4c1a58f8040a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/ca314aa2d7fded9a551360660d4c1a58f8040a5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/35fd657ec7fa2a73578f84d7409b51b26374eff1","verification":{"payload":"tree ca314aa2d7fded9a551360660d4c1a58f8040a5a\nparent 97f4ac3fb6f871614132f3eeeadd39c072061df6\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783178623 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783178623 +0700\n\nfix(ds-navbar,ds-field,ds-toggle): close pangaea.id parity gaps (#10)\n\nComponent-by-component parity audit results (feature gaps + real bugs; the\ndeliberate WCAG improvements in .ui are kept, not reverted):\n\n- ds-navbar: ship .rv-nav-cta (gradient + pulsing-ring primary CTA, reduced-motion\n  aware) ported verbatim from pangaea.id — was missing (generic actions slot only).\n- ds-field: add the form-layout kit — Form (.rv-form), FieldRow (.rv-field-row, 2-up,\n  collapses ≤460px), FormNote (.rv-form-note), FormStatus (.rv-form-ok/.rv-form-err)\n  — so a consumer can reproduce pangaea.id''s AdoptForm; was single stacked Fields only.\n- ds-toggle: LangToggle active option = solid navy pill / white text (--rv-brand/#fff,\n  matches .rv-lang-opt.active) instead of a pale-blue chip; align option metrics\n  (0.72rem/0.04em/3px 9px); dynamic ThemeToggle aria-label.\n\nAlso audited & confirmed AT PARITY (no change): ds-hero, ds-pricing, ds-avatar,\nds-badge, ds-accordion, ds-stat, ds-table, ds-compare, ds-dodont. ds-testimonial is\na rotating carousel vs pangaea.id''s static grid — a design divergence, left as-is.\n\nVerified in the gallery light + dark; build:pkgs + gallery build + tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSSV/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASyMQAG1iFjMwGKq82Cdan7UTmL+g\nWnTp5+Mkrb/oxHZfGtH0xCYWbpwsEDraOkk75yLXMx1E8bdzb9xiQVx4lWFwfFCp\ntXcBT46yIIsVMXaRszSImG4Y8Ye6VEgNkN1t0ivbV1dndmSsmreSOd/IpubuSL6p\nmvCsJ70FbC6WOBOhWIL4pTRBFSNi0iTfEeUwG0WRMxwZVTwloaFPOONa/