6edf4a7bfb324016875b76632c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:55:19Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:55:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ds-references,ds-section,ds-dodont): small pangaea.id-parity fixes (#8)\n\nPhase 0 — the remaining small pure fidelity fixes (no API changes):\n\n- ds-references: Cite joins ↗ with a non-breaking space (was a regular space)\n  so the arrow can''t wrap alone — matches pangaea.id.\n- ds-section: heroAccent() matches the word case-insensitively (was\n  case-sensitive indexOf) and wraps the title''s own substring so casing is\n  preserved — matches pangaea.id blocks.tsx.\n- ds-dodont: check/cross glyphs use pangaea.id''s exact journey.tsx geometry\n  (viewBox 24, paths M20 6 9 17l-5-5 / M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12).\n\nVerified in the gallery (do/dont glyphs render correctly, 0 console errors);\nbuild:pkgs + gallery build + tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26876316af5966c657a19068d8cd2c909111bda2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/26876316af5966c657a19068d8cd2c909111bda2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/48134dd08c97546edf4a7bfb324016875b76632c","verification":{"payload":"tree 26876316af5966c657a19068d8cd2c909111bda2\nparent 5016b96978f5f55fa26c6d2fc29c8132fc99de48\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783169719 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783169719 +0700\n\nfix(ds-references,ds-section,ds-dodont): small pangaea.id-parity fixes (#8)\n\nPhase 0 — the remaining small pure fidelity fixes (no API changes):\n\n- ds-references: Cite joins ↗ with a non-breaking space (was a regular space)\n  so the arrow can''t wrap alone — matches pangaea.id.\n- ds-section: heroAccent() matches the word case-insensitively (was\n  case-sensitive indexOf) and wraps the title''s own substring so casing is\n  preserved — matches pangaea.id blocks.tsx.\n- ds-dodont: check/cross glyphs use pangaea.id''s exact journey.tsx geometry\n  (viewBox 24, paths M20 6 9 17l-5-5 / M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12).\n\nVerified in the gallery (do/dont glyphs render correctly, 0 console errors);\nbuild:pkgs + gallery build + tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSQK3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhxYQAF8G8AictFUOqboa3vW4cYBz\nUVWHbrOC0yj0tB0c/15v5VukMjicuXAm60KxP8Xu70EZr1B8gTxnABmLftd4idsE\n+XDwWcMmb3zQbeHAWxIbtzDvOEEyD9W4FPUptupsFWQhSs7bFM8J/5rhXdgUUQea\ndmgtgqdsP9Tnc9m7y0lIsc6oHMklZ4rpcdRa1U34NVFB7X74SaGix3egJ4I2UJUz\nQhV/Z3N+KmTNKub4dFtWTGRiPvXKnRIvjEaBFLP5/P6Kdhj2lMZpoDUx736BixYA\n0Z3MdAFdZxWLlYGVHReXimdJ96tMjRqY9XlTbM3vXYrnB/LEo5cL+fZ+eRFpwV9J\nQXRAOlHy4NdCunB05MYYdcCtwkSXJ+NuNQnOUThrUW4ToatKQMwS3Rzt9cmhOLrl\nFgJan85NERTnJ0ITm+mepXIu4AQW67RrFNjsiN3AqBTJJWZ6SZSAUzfliIln5MhU\nHCH0xLdMxC8wcF/TPizQ7Dol4YW84xDfJ5qsOzwsNxif0Nq9fH25a+powlqIBOvd\nDC2d6fdhjuy/bLmvnluGCp/zS6YsE5dwNExxDxOP+MOB7dmoy6bVMSqeU42IkrBu\ncSYMD9GkhqRKwjDoIw4qA2nanF7OP22Va/yDWkzquMPrWjNAM/P+r5uIFLQC24zS\nKq5zWj8pQ2mb2EVZ42V2\n=p2tz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T12:55:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs",