pangaea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/labspangaea","id":291584219,"login":"labspangaea","node_id":"U_kgDOEWE42w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/8b9868a1036e22a943c51b92093bf734eef79457/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:45:04Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:45:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ds-quote,ds-pagination,ds-stepper): resolve .rv-* class collisions with pangaea.id (#6)\n\nPhase 0 (adoption analysis §3.9): three packages reused a .rv-* class name that\npangaea.id already uses for a DIFFERENT component, so co-loading revamp.css and\nthese styles.css during a phased migration would clash. Namespaced them:\n\n- ds-quote:      .rv-quote  → .rv-blockquote (+ .rv-quote--pull → .rv-blockquote--pull)\n- ds-pagination: .rv-pagination (numbered pager) → .rv-pagenums\n- ds-stepper:    .rv-step* family → .rv-stepper-* (item/node/check/label/desc/line/body)\n\nRendering unchanged (same rules, new names); no prop/markup changes. Each rename\ntarget verified absent in pangaea.id''s revamp.css. Validated in the gallery light\n+ dark: all three render identically, 0 old classes remain, 0 console errors;\nbuild:pkgs + gallery build + tsc all clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20ddfc46e10ed9ee525847cfdc82edb33235300a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/20ddfc46e10ed9ee525847cfdc82edb33235300a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/8b9868a1036e22a943c51b92093bf734eef79457","verification":{"payload":"tree 20ddfc46e10ed9ee525847cfdc82edb33235300a\nparent af87629fb05c555563ee4cbad11973b3b53271bc\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783169104 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783169104 +0700\n\nfix(ds-quote,ds-pagination,ds-stepper): resolve .rv-* class collisions with pangaea.id (#6)\n\nPhase 0 (adoption analysis §3.9): three packages reused a .rv-* class name that\npangaea.id already uses for a DIFFERENT component, so co-loading revamp.css and\nthese styles.css during a phased migration would clash. Namespaced them:\n\n- ds-quote:      .rv-quote  → .rv-blockquote (+ .rv-quote--pull → .rv-blockquote--pull)\n- ds-pagination: .rv-pagination (numbered pager) → .rv-pagenums\n- ds-stepper:    .rv-step* family → .rv-stepper-* (item/node/check/label/desc/line/body)\n\nRendering unchanged (same rules, new names); no prop/markup changes. Each rename\ntarget verified absent in pangaea.id''s revamp.css. Validated in the gallery light\n+ dark: all three render identically, 0 old classes remain, 0 console errors;\nbuild:pkgs + gallery build + tsc all clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSQBQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY0YQAEZlpWXcSWf32+KFxgKO5Lk1\nvxd6yHEd44ipDs1HDQjYP472Lo33bPAuAl8HvTxDnk9Zjfcn4rnLOqc+rl7tnCDf\n81f2aWbw0XByc38rSI0X3bX0VSUBKOP96kRe7iW3gqQ9byevUMb3lg4rXTZfGRKZ\n9uPc1poWjIKzdPrpZdT3/yKOaedjroV/xLPp9t14nh1SZO3Ok8+Pl3HhqwPFbJSN\nzoLcpQM6r