ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commit/af87629fb05c555563ee4cbad11973b3b53271bc","node_id":"C_kwDOTIue49oAKGFmODc2MjlmYjA1YzU1NTU2M2VlNGNiYWQxMTk3M2IzYjUzMjcxYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commit/760850cf219678ee19cedb84353b19715526b48d","sha":"760850cf219678ee19cedb84353b19715526b48d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/760850cf219678ee19cedb84353b19715526b48d"}],"sha":"af87629fb05c555563ee4cbad11973b3b53271bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/af87629fb05c555563ee4cbad11973b3b53271bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291584219?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/labspangaea","id":291584219,"login":"labspangaea","node_id":"U_kgDOEWE42w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/labspangaea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/commits/760850cf219678ee19cedb84353b19715526b48d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:26:00Z","email":"labspangaea@gmail.com","name":"Pangaea Digital Labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T12:26:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ds-callout): match pangaea.id (Phase 0 divergence fix) (#4)\n\nMake @labspangaea/ds-callout a faithful port of pangaea.id''s journey.tsx Callout,\nso the ~50 MDX bodies that call `<Callout type=…>` render identically:\n\n- render <aside> (was <div>)\n- add canonical `type` prop (matches pangaea.id + its MDX); keep `variant` as a\n  deprecated alias so existing callers don''t break\n- restore the .rv-callout-body wrapper so the title sits outside\n  .rv-callout-content (the shared `.rv-callout-content p` rule was restyling the\n  title to 0.98rem/muted instead of 0.95rem/status colour)\n- swap icons to pangaea.id''s set: stroke-width 1.8, note/warning circle r=9, the\n  pangaea.id tip path, and the thumbs-up `rule` glyph (was a list glyph)\n\nCSS unchanged (already token-identical to revamp.css, light + dark). Gallery\nstory control renamed variant→type. Verified in the gallery light + dark:\n<aside> + .rv-callout-body present, title at 0.95rem, thumbs-up rule icon,\n0 console errors; build:pkgs + gallery build + tsc all clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff2dbdd9bf86309d9a8d2c7e9a65d2588aa6b345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/ff2dbdd9bf86309d9a8d2c7e9a65d2588aa6b345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/760850cf219678ee19cedb84353b19715526b48d","verification":{"payload":"tree ff2dbdd9bf86309d9a8d2c7e9a65d2588aa6b345\nparent 04f2ac0c9f10a659b93d47a8419ce229801829a1\nauthor Pangaea Digital Labs <labspangaea@gmail.com> 1783167960 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783167960 +0700\n\nfix(ds-callout): match pangaea.id (Phase 0 divergence fix) (#4)\n\nMake @labspangaea/ds-callout a faithful port of pangaea.id''s journey.tsx Callout,\nso the ~50 MDX bodies that call `<Callout type=…>` render identically:\n\n- render <aside> (was <div>)\n- add canonical `type` prop (matches pangaea.id + its MDX); keep `variant` as a\n  deprecated alias so existing callers don''t break\n- restore the .rv-callout-body wrapper so the title sits outside\n  .rv-callout-content (the shared `.rv-callout-content p` rule was restyling the\n  title to 0.98rem/muted instead of 0.95rem/status colour)\n- swap icons to pangaea.id''s set: stroke-width 1.8, note/warning circle r=9, the\n  pangaea.id tip path, and the thumbs-up `rule` glyph (was a list glyph)\n\nCSS unchanged (already token-identical to revamp.css, light + dark). Gallery\nstory control renamed variant→type. Verified in the gallery light + dark:\n<aside> + .rv-callout-body present, title at 0.95rem, thumbs-up rule icon,\n0 console errors; build:pkgs + gallery build + tsc all clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Harry Osmar <harryosmarsitohang@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSPvYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPDsQAAgq1MA4pdzHJ+6Hc92N3yy3\nyLryRnILIshIle3SmfxzBWSMcUpOYs292nkj63wzqoQzh34jriPFYHVj1W/6OZCd\n1A5y5MpGafj5rWR/VoCghvXsjziPD9KRi0JXBrh2XSN1IEnbsXb7byxh7rgdiFec\n06oLY9mJhfXRUoFGp91/5pD909pTpwg/NSQTcukesyvPDz88+gyJR60Lhjtp7wW3\nU54dIEqfjhtDfImtXmS6gFWqbmqz6w9umgvH30b5pfoXlJfTWkiB3DxnEJXSMe+R\nn52qehaL6fkkM1lV9NeyicaI/VI9L5GrJB7C7bS2PcBIjDQieYbMbW0PQNiCEZFO\nVu89HlairsMkmAhIdpqGF+5e8yBCtlQY0s3jACSGmlBNRBlrqPWcDizJyLO0wBPJ\nmqTAOVhlPcgYvV7ZZMJCgQ7kd85IDdT6H99UwhNo8YMTk/vmfhnpcmgCy+hVlIOT\nJtyUyXRXYupl2FZ+jjUjaV1/eNO7gfOp7en+JBp8vlAMEb1GVYkf+i+tngnQphu8\nxYdtVByD/SGHilr7ba0Ldlxr634Tb0eYYhiGMfY8nKDCZYD87RiUMmZlPC4Fxl74\n8LAuIrhAzfkwDUvwArbLM7r2z0veUJzWSWikanNB3MTUUV3Q2m3+U9nmWoccMO1l\n4p6LJL85zPvX+PPKzhHS\n=dD7b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verifie