rryosmarsitohang@gmail.com","name":"Harry Osmar"},"message":"chore(registry): migrate npm scope @pangaea → @labspangaea for GitHub Packages\n\nGitHub Packages maps the npm scope to a GitHub account of the same name, and\n@pangaea is a foreign user — publishing 403''d (installation does not exist). Rename\nthe scope to @labspangaea (the repo owner) across all package names, internal deps,\ngallery imports, usage snippets, configs and docs. Add a ''repository'' field to every\npublished package (links it to labspangaea/pangaea.ui) and wire .npmrc\n(@labspangaea:registry=npm.pkg.github.com + NODE_AUTH_TOKEN auth). Regenerated the\nlockfile; build + tsc clean; npm publish --dry-run targets the right registry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9b056ab34cc903b8d4eb30710a3d88600fbc719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/f9b056ab34cc903b8d4eb30710a3d88600fbc719"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/f2f60bcf494ebcf8a54068de56d740e2c613f98e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6024289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harryosmar","id":6024289,"login":"harryosmar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjQyODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"