+ add CLAUDE.md, pangaea-ds skill, gallery screenshots\n\n- README: fix the pangaea.id link (→ www.pangaea.id), correct badge variants\n  (free/claude), update the stale Status section to the current a11y + motion posture,\n  and add light/dark gallery screenshots.\n- CLAUDE.md: the repo''s non-negotiables (zero-drift port, AA token discipline,\n  exhaustive JSON-array controls, the tsc --noEmit gate, motion conventions, push flow).\n- .claude/skills/pangaea-ds: a skill capturing this session''s methodology — add-a-component\n  without drift, gallery story authoring, the parallel-agent audit→polish→re-audit loop,\n  plus tokens/contrast and motion reference files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95b8551c24336068ea3b1524aa9f5e709307706a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/95b8551c24336068ea3b1524aa9f5e709307706a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/8d3bc9ae714f78f67bb1ae5ecb3121257879adc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6024289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harryosmar","id":6024289,"login":"harryosmar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjQyODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/su