osmarsitohang@gmail.com","name":"Harry Osmar"},"message":"feat: initial commit — Pangaea design system (@pangaea/ds-* + Astro gallery)\n\nThe rv-* two-hex blue-on-white system ported verbatim from pangaea.id, shipped as\nindependently versioned @pangaea/ds-* packages (tokens + 37 components) with a\nStorybook-style Astro gallery (3-pane explorer: menu / live canvas / exhaustive\ncontrols + copyable usage).\n\nDual-theme, WCAG AA verified, prefers-reduced-motion throughout. Changesets +\nGitHub Packages release pipeline (.github/workflows/release.yml). Federation-ready\npackage hygiene (peer-react, per-package CSS), federation itself deferred.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a244fc3a58e7c4b51078fd1fd4443cacbf456684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/trees/a244fc3a58e7c4b51078fd1fd4443cacbf456684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/labspangaea/pangaea.ui/git/commits/7ae6dc32051fbeec4e025085e81545eddd89f49d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6024289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harryosmar","id":6024289,"login":"harryosmar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjQyODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryosmar/subscriptions","type":"U