 The append-only audit ledger is deliberately untouched.\n\n- Monitoring: add every 2 days / 3 days / week / 2 weeks / month options to\n  the per-domain auto-monitor select, and a compact interval badge\n  (daily/weekly/monthly/Nd). Backend cap raised 168h -> 744h in the domain\n  patch schema and store clamp.\n\nBackend 561 tests + frontend 101 tests green (facade guard updated with\npruneJobs).","tree":{"sha":"8ef81022cb4303f83ea94c50fd42c0f087032759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/8ef81022cb4303f83ea94c50fd42c0f087032759"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/fd7349160795b0358e4cfa7c1927c9f8f935f1de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/fd7349160795b0358e4cfa7c1927c9f8f935f1de","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGZkNzM0OTE2MDc5NWIwMzU4ZTRjZmE3YzE5MjdjOWY4ZjkzNWYxZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42","sha":"6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42"}],"sha":"fd7349160795b0358e4cfa7c1927c9f8f935f1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/fd7349160795b0358e4cfa7c1927c9f8f935f1de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:42:44Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:42:44Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"fix: crt.name CT source, nuclei template bake, screenshot HMR context\n\nOperator-reported reliability fixes across recon and the UI.\n\n- Subdomain discovery: add crt.name as a third certificate-transparency\n  source (src/sources/crtname.ts). It runs in parallel with crt.sh +\n  certspotter in the discovery handler, and the OSINT handler now unions\n  all three instead of a crt.sh->certspotter fallback chain, so a flaky\n  crt.sh no longer loses the whole lookup. crt.name is the HTTP API behind\n  subfaster (plaintext host list); queried directly, no binary needed.\n\n- Nuclei: bake the templates into the backend image at build time\n  (nuclei -update-templates as the node user, build fails under ~1000).\n  Without this, the first scan tries to download ~14k templates from GitHub\n  at runtime, which is blocked on the Tailscale-only VPS, so every nuclei\n  job failed. Also surface nuclei''s stderr in the job error instead of a\n  bare \"Command failed: nuclei ...\", so a hard failure is diagnosable.\n\n- Screenshots page: move the app-state context into its own module\n  (frontend/src/app-context.ts) so editing state.tsx no longer mints a new\n  context identity under Vite Fast Refresh, which stranded the mounted\n  AppProvider and threw \"useApp must be used within AppProvider\".\n\nDocs: README subdomain sources, architecture sources list, production\nrunbook note on the baked nuclei templates.\n\nBackend 561 tests (cmd.exe) + frontend 101 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"aec50415137396955be3994f75d198a0862173e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/aec50415137396955be3994f75d198a0862173e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDY5NjhhZTcxYzQ1ODQ0MWUzNWZjMDJkMzViYmUyMDkzOTM3NjBkNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1","sha":"91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1"}],"sha":"6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6968ae71c458441e35fc02d35bbe209393760d42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T19:20:21Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T19:20:21Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"fix(ui): route persistence, domain contract, screenshots, log detail, mobile overflow\n\nBatch of operator-reported fixes:\n\n- Reload no longer jumps to Portfolio: sidebar nav went through setActive\n  only, so the URL stayed \"/\" and a refresh re-parsed home. It now routes\n  through navigate() (pushState), so the current page/engagement survives\n  reload and Back/Forward.\n- Domain edits (monitor interval, mode, scope, ...) no longer error: the\n  create/patch responses returned profile/owaspConfig/scopeConfig as raw\n  JSON text, tripping the frontend contract validator that expects objects.\n  Added serializeDomain() so every domain-returning route parses them,\n  matching GET /api/domains.\n- Screenshots (and PDF report export) work under Docker: headless Chromium\n  ran without --no-sandbox and failed as the dropped-privilege container\n  user. Added --no-sandbox/--disable-setuid-sandbox (target already vetted\n  and pinned via --host-resolver-rules).\n- Activity-log rows expand to a full detail panel: target, parameters,\n  timing (created/started/finished/duration), progress, outcome, and the\n  result or error payload, instead of a bare JSON blob.\n- Command Center no longer overflows horizontally on mobile: a truncate\n  title expanded the auto grid track; added min-w-0 to the grid columns.\n  Hardened the Next Actions target chip (min-w-0 + break-all) too.","tree":{"sha":"8af63aff766c8b6887dd843df0cba928d7dfbeac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/8af63aff766c8b6887dd843df0cba928d7dfbeac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDkxZDBmZTQzMWUwYmEzMjViYmIwMTJmZGY5M2MwMTQ5MmZmYTc3ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/7c2edb6cc21592fb1e170433944600475b12a57f","sha":"7c2edb6cc21592fb1e170433944600475b12a57f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7c2edb6cc21592fb1e170433944600475b12a57f"}],"sha":"91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/91d0fe431e0ba325bbb012fdf93c01492ffa77e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7c2edb6cc21592fb1e170433944600475b12a57f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:43:39Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:43:39Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"docs: document WAF fingerprint/evasion, scan import, SSE, dual-boundary contracts\n\nReflect this session''s shipped features across the tracked docs.\n\n- README: Subdomains \"Identify WAF\" brand id; Tools sqlmap WAF evasion +\n  auto-escalate; Findings scan import; nuclei/ffuf/dalfox WAF throttle in the\n  gated-scanning bullet; SSE live-refresh in the UX bullet and Architecture;\n  contracts now validated at both boundaries in the Quality bullet.\n- docs/architecture.md: wafw00f in the image; a \"Live updates\" section (event bus,\n  GET /api/events SSE, useAppEvent additive to polling).\n- docs/data-model.md: migrations through 0038; subdomains waf_brand/version/source\n  columns; the scan-import path + `imported` tag.\n- docs/production.md: @fastify/static scans the SPA dir at boot; wafw00f best-effort\n  with header fallback; GET /api/events streaming note; 0038 on upgrade.","tree":{"sha":"46eaa87ce98f0aad291c4891013c74e2302bae16","url":"https://ap