/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/15ceabf37254698a3abc90aabc57a596f44eb7bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:26:11Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:26:11Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"fix(ui): stop silent data-load failures showing a false-clean target\n\nA deep test surfaced that ~13 pages did `.catch(() => {})` / `.catch(() => set([]))`\non their PRIMARY data load. Because the transport resolves HTTP 4xx/5xx (only\nnetwork-level failures mark offline), a real server error rendered as an ordinary\nempty state — on a security tool that reads as a falsely-clean target (Data Leaks\n\"nothing leaked\", Intel clean triage, Ports \"no open ports\", Assets 0 hosts,\nMethodology 0% coverage, empty activity log, etc.).\n\nAdopt the app''s existing loadError idiom (set in the catch, cleared on the next\nsuccessful poll, rendered as a distinct \"Couldn''t load … — will retry\" before the\ngenuine empty state, gated on the data still being empty so a transient blip over\ngood data doesn''t flash): DataLeaks, Intel, Ports (exposure+nmap), Jobs, Assets,\nMethodology, Owasp (catalog+findings), Screenshots, Tools, Fuzzing, Scans, Origin.\n\nAlso:\n- Methodology manual done/skip/clear and Screenshots capture now toast.error on\n  failure instead of silently no-op''ing.\n- timeAgo guards a non-finite input (returns \"—\") so a bad timestamp can''t render\n  \"Invalid Date\".\n- aria-labels on placeholder-only filter/search inputs (Assets, Data Leaks, Audit,\n  Notes) so screen readers still name them once the placeholder disappears.","tree":{"sha":"d3363e32e4a0a1f91177fd4123901252bf282630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/d3363e32e4a0a1f91177fd4123901252bf282630"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/15ceabf37254698a3abc90aabc57a596f44eb7bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/15ceabf37254698a3abc90aabc57a596f44eb7bd","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDE1Y2VhYmYzNzI1NDY5OGEzYWJjOTBhYWJjNTdhNTk2ZjQ0ZWI3YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c","sha":"e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c"}],"sha":"15ceabf37254698a3abc90aabc57a596f44eb7bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/15ceabf37254698a3abc90aabc57a596f44eb7bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:25:54Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:25:54Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"perf: pause polling on hidden tab + throttle job-progress writes/events\n\nFound by a deep live test with real data. Two safe, high-value fixes:\n\n- usePoll (frontend/src/state.tsx): skip the fetch while document.hidden and do\n  a catch-up fetch on visibilitychange. Every one of the ~30 pollers otherwise\n  hammers the backend 24/7 for a minimized/backgrounded tab (several are always\n  on: Shell jobs 3.5s, JobNotifier, plus the mounted page).\n- setJobProgress (backend/src/jobs/queue.ts): throttle to ~1 write+SSE-emit per\n  second per job. A noisy scanner (nuclei/ffuf) streams many progress lines,\n  which since the SSE work amplified into unbounded SQLite writes + event frames;\n  progress is cosmetic so dropping intermediate lines is fine (terminal status\n  changes always write + emit). Bounded map, cleared if it ever grows large.","tree":{"sha":"4294e4088501a58bc5a3049484756d0cb92226e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/4294e4088501a58bc5a3049484756d0cb92226e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGU0NTA1ZTg3NmNhM2U5MjM3MjliNGRhZTM4Y2EwYjIyMGMwNTBlNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c","sha":"0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c"}],"sha":"e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e4505e876ca3e923729b4dae38ca0b220c050e6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:03:07Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:03:07Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"fix: two single-origin production bugs found by live testing\n\nBooting the compiled single-origin stack and driving it in a browser surfaced\ntwo bugs that unit tests missed because they only exercise /api with hand-built\npayloads.\n\n1. authGuard blocked the SPA. Default-deny 401''d every non-allowlisted route,\n   including GET / and /assets/* — so in production (where the backend serves the\n   built SPA) the login page itself never loaded. Fix: let non-/api GETs through\n   (the bundle and client routes are public by nature; every data route stays\n   under /api and guarded). Dev hid this because Vite serves the SPA separately.\n\n2. The response-contract hook 500''d every registered endpoint. It validated the\n   payload at preSerialization, where Drizzle rows still hold Date objects, against\n   schemas that (correctly) describe the serialized wire form as z.string() —\n   \"Expected string, received date\" on /api/jobs, /api/findings, etc. Fix: JSON\n   round-trip the payload to its wire form before validating, so dates become the\n   ISO strings the client actually receives.\n\n- guard.test.ts: SPA-shell pass-through + still-guarded API/non-GET.\n- contracts.test.ts: a Date-bearing payload now validates (the regression).","tree":{"sha":"fe76d34e38fad1543422836df6cbb0f1971562d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/fe76d34e38fad1543422836df6cbb0f1971562d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDBjNTY3NTVkMWViMTg1MmE1NjkwNGRkNDk3YzdjNzJmZjJlMzQ1N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/b8df7907a0901cb09090d889a2b894fa286cca29","sha":"b8df7907a0901cb09090d889a2b894fa286cca29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/b8df7907a0901cb09090d889a2b894fa286cca29"}],"sha":"0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/0c56755d1eb1852a56904dd497c7c72ff2e3457c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/b8df7907a0901cb09090d889a2b894fa286cca29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:38:46Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:38:46Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(events): SSE change-signal stream to refresh the UI live (poll stays)\n\nPages poll every few seconds and re-download whole collections. This adds a\nsingle Server-Sent-Events stream that pushes coarse \"something changed\" signals\nso the UI refreshes immediately — layered ON TOP of the existing polling, never\nreplacing it, so a dropped stream degrades to the poll rather than to stale data.\n\n- events/bus.ts: a tiny in-process pub/sub. emitJobs/emitFindings/emitRuns;\n  emitting is fire-and-forget and isolates a throwing subscriber.\n- routes/events.ts: GET /api/events SSE endpoint (session-guarded like all /api),\n  heartbeat, cleanup on close, reply.hijack() for the raw socket. Payload is only\n  { kind, domainId? } — never the changed data.\n- queue.ts: emit ''jobs'' on every job transition (enqueue/claim/finish/cancel/\n  fail/progress). store.ts: emit ''findings'' on addFinding.\n- frontend lib/events.ts: one shared EventSource + a useAppEvent(kind, cb) hook,\n  coalescing bursts (300ms) and reconnecting on transient drop; a no-op when\n  EventSource is unavailable. Wired into Jobs (live queue) and Findings.\n- Bus unit tests. Runs/other pollers can adopt the same hook incrementally.","tree":{"sha":"25e4da51bf1984fd237bf4281c38cafec913f4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/25e4da51bf1984fd237bf4281c38cafec913f4e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/b8df7907a0901cb09090d889a2b894fa286cca29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"