3,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/5171d8a8c57a203d5f52aa264dd175bcc54c55bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:24:16Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:24:16Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(import): import recon output — host lists, httpx JSONL, URL lists\n\nExtends the scan importer beyond findings so recon done outside the dashboard\nloads into the domain''s estate, not just its findings.\n\n- import.ts: new recon formats. parseHostList (plain host-per-line from\n  subfinder/assetfinder, or JSONL with host/url/input from httpx/subfinder -oJ;\n  strips scheme/port/path, validates hostnames) and parseUrlList (plain URLs\n  from gau/waymore/katana, or JSONL url field; http(s) only). importScanData\n  dispatches recon formats to diffAndStore (subdomains) / recordCorpusUrls (URL\n  corpus), scoped to the domain — out-of-scope hosts/URLs are dropped, not stored.\n- routes/import.ts: accept subdomains/httpx/urls formats.\n- frontend: Findings import gains a format picker (Auto by extension, or explicit\n  Nuclei/Nmap/Findings/Hosts/httpx/URLs); the file input drives the chosen format.\n- Tests for the two recon parsers.","tree":{"sha":"be956e212dbca99201205e7c4d518d400bcb65c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/be956e212dbca99201205e7c4d518d400bcb65c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/5171d8a8c57a203d5f52aa264dd175bcc54c55bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/5171d8a8c57a203d5f52aa264dd175bcc54c55bc","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDUxNzFkOGE4YzU3YTIwM2Q1ZjUyYWEyNjRkZDE3NWJjYzU0YzU1YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e","sha":"e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e"}],"sha":"5171d8a8c57a203d5f52aa264dd175bcc54c55bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/5171d8a8c57a203d5f52aa264dd175bcc54c55bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:13:49Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:13:49Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(sqlmap): auto-escalate the tamper chain when a WAF still blocks\n\nThe first evasion run uses a light, vendor-specific tamper chain. If it finds\nnothing AND the run was being blocked behind a known WAF, retry ONCE with a\nheavier chain at higher depth instead of giving up — most of the \"sqlmap finds\nnothing behind a WAF\" cases.\n\n- binTools.ts: runSqlmap now returns { finding, blocked }. sqlmapLooksBlocked()\n  is a pure heuristic — an explicit WAF/IPS notice, or >=3 requests refused with\n  403/406/429 (a single stray 4xx is not enough).\n- sqlmapTamper.ts: escalatedTamper()/HEAVY_TAMPER — the heavier superset chain\n  used for the retry.\n- toolScan.ts: when the first evade run is empty + WAF-detected + blocked, retry\n  once with the heavy chain at level/risk 3; the finding notes it was found only\n  after escalation. Bounded to one extra run (still under the job cap).\n- Tests for the block heuristic, the escalation chain, and the new return shape.","tree":{"sha":"ecfa54b9fbaef9f7032782285c130349cdae39c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/ecfa54b9fbaef9f7032782285c130349cdae39c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGUyYjQ5MzZkZWYxMTg4NDFmNTQyNzkzZDcyODEyMzhjMWU0NDAzMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a","sha":"d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a"}],"sha":"e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e2b4936def118841f542793d7281238c1e44030e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:02:55Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:02:55Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(scans): throttle nuclei/ffuf/dalfox against WAF-fronted hosts\n\nsqlmap already evades a WAF via tamper; the other loud tools slip a WAF mainly\nby not tripping its rate-based rules. When a host is already known to be\nWAF-fronted (the stored subdomains.waf / wafBrand — no extra probing), lower the\nrequest rate/add jitter so the scan isn''t blanket-403''d.\n\n- sources/wafThrottle.ts: throttleForBrand() maps a stored WAF brand to a per-\n  tool throttle (rate limit, ffuf delay/jitter, dalfox workers+delay). Aggressive\n  engines (Cloudflare/Akamai/Imperva) get the heaviest; lighter CDNs moderate; an\n  unknown-but-present WAF a light default; no WAF -> null (full speed).\n- subdomains/store.ts getHostWaf(): the stored brand/slug for a host, no re-probe.\n- nuclei: -rl <rate>; ffuf: -p <delay-range>; dalfox: --worker/--delay (new\n  DalfoxOpts, threaded from toolScan). cf_clearance handling is unchanged.\n- Tests for the throttle map and getHostWaf.","tree":{"sha":"ced4f118bc6757df34d59a9cd226d4949c8b4b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/ced4f118bc6757df34d59a9cd226d4949c8b4b69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGQzY2I0ODBjNDEzMDdlYWZiYzUzYzUxNDI2NTQzZGJiZDJmNGQ4M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d28e06729286ca933fb17cdfc1cbc0f08df3bfeb","sha":"d28e06729286ca933fb17cdfc1cbc0f08df3bfeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d28e06729286ca933fb17cdfc1cbc0f08df3bfeb"}],"sha":"d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d3cb480c41307eafbc53c51426543dbbd2f4d83a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d28e06729286ca933fb17cdfc1cbc0f08df3bfeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:56:25Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:56:25Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(findings): import external scan output (Nuclei/Nmap/findings JSON)\n\nThe dashboard could export but not import, making it a data silo. This adds a\nscan importer so results from CLI runs done outside the app land in a domain''s\nfindings, deduped and scored like native scans.\n\n- findings/import.ts: pure parsers for Nuclei JSONL, Nmap XML (fast-xml-parser)\n  and a generic findings JSON bundle (bare array or { findings: [...] } — the\n  app''s own export shape). Each maps to the SAME finding data shape the native\n  scanner writes, so imports dedup via findingKey and render/score identically.\n  Items are capped (5000), tagged `imported`, and carry `imported: true`.\n  importScanData() parses then persists via addScoredFinding.\n- routes/import.ts: POST /api/domains/:id/import { format, content }. Passive\n  ingest of operator-held data (not an active scan) — domain must exist; audited.\n- frontend: api.importScan + an \"Import scan\" button on the Findings page that\n  infers the format from the file extension (.xml→nmap, .jsonl→nuclei, else\n  findings JSON), reads the file and reports parsed/imported/skipped.\n- Tests for all three parsers; api.facade surface updated.","tree":{"sha":"b94f3ea70031fe6675468401966eca6edc30b93d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/b94f3ea70031fe6675468401966eca6edc30b93d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/d28e06729286ca933fb17cdfc1cbc0f08df3bfeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com