method surface\n\napi.facade.test.ts asserts Object.keys(api) equals a frozen list; the new\napi.wafScan method (WAF fingerprint) has to be listed there. Fixes the CI\nfailure on 7e71d68.","tree":{"sha":"d363daa5d34b1031249e24d4b4e564b9d6ffd5b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/d363daa5d34b1031249e24d4b4e564b9d6ffd5b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/c56537f79c0e060ec3cfbe42bb14eb68d11121ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/c56537f79c0e060ec3cfbe42bb14eb68d11121ee","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGM1NjUzN2Y3OWMwZTA2MGVjM2NmYmU0MmJiMTRlYjY4ZDExMTIxZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07","sha":"7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07"}],"sha":"c56537f79c0e060ec3cfbe42bb14eb68d11121ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/c56537f79c0e060ec3cfbe42bb14eb68d11121ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:20:50Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:20:50Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(subdomains): persist and surface the WAF brand/version per host\n\nThe rich WAF identification only existed transiently in the sqlmap flow. This\nadds a dedicated WAF fingerprint scan that stores the brand/version on each\nsubdomain and shows it in the Subdomains view, so the operator can see what is\nin front of every host, not just when running sqlmap.\n\n- migration 0038: subdomains.waf_brand / waf_version / waf_source (the passive\n  `waf` slug column stays; the richer fields are filled only by a fingerprint\n  run). subdomains/store.ts updateWaf() writes them and backfills the slug.\n- jobs/handlers/wafFingerprint.ts: a new ''waf_fingerprint'' job (loud — wafw00f\n  actively probes) that identifies one host or the live estate (bounded to 20\n  hosts, 4 at a time), SSRF-guarded per host, tolerant of per-host failures.\n- routes/recon.ts POST /domains/:id/waf-scan: assertScanAllowed-gated + audited,\n  optional single target or whole estate.\n- frontend: an \"Identify WAF\" button on the Subdomains toolbar (confirm prompt on\n  passive domains) and the brand/version rendered in the WAF badge + detail row.\n- transport schemas (backend contract + frontend) gain the optional waf fields.\n- Tests for updateWaf; the subdomains fixture carries the new columns.","tree":{"sha":"845fbc2dd58621fd0a45ba6bb7839d271fa41b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/845fbc2dd58621fd0a45ba6bb7839d271fa41b45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDdlNzFkNjg5MTc3ZTNmMmJkNTg4NmVhMTE3M2Q1NGRjNTdjYjZkMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/0473129776ed69f87b75605ce5ad17c84593fcf0","sha":"0473129776ed69f87b75605ce5ad17c84593fcf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/0473129776ed69f87b75605ce5ad17c84593fcf0"}],"sha":"7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7e71d689177e3f2bd5886ea1173d54dc57cb6d07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/0473129776ed69f87b75605ce5ad17c84593fcf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:01:08Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:01:08Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(tools): WAF-aware sqlmap evasion with wafw00f brand identification\n\nA plain sqlmap run against a WAF-fronted target finds nothing: cf_clearance\ngets past the JS challenge, but the WAF''s signature engine still blocks the\nSQLi payload. This adds an opt-in evasion path that identifies the WAF and lets\nsqlmap slip its signatures with stock tamper scripts — no custom SQLi code.\n\n- sources/wafFingerprint.ts: identify the WAF via wafw00f (150+ signatures),\n  falling back to the header-based detectWaf when the binary is absent. Reports\n  brand + manufacturer; version is best-effort from the Server header and stays\n  null for the common versionless SaaS WAFs (Cloudflare/Akamai/Imperva/AWS/\n  Fastly). SSRF-guarded like the other target-facing runners.\n- sources/sqlmapTamper.ts: map a detected brand to a stock sqlmap --tamper chain\n  and a suggested delay (heavier chains for Imperva, throttling for rate-based\n  cloud WAFs), with a generic fallback for an unknown vendor.\n- binTools.ts runSqlmap: optional evasion opts (--tamper, --skip-waf,\n  --delay/--threads, level/risk). With no opts the invocation is unchanged.\n- jobs/handlers/toolScan.ts: on evade, fingerprint the target, auto-pick the\n  tamper chain, raise depth to 2/2, and preserve the identified WAF on the\n  finding so the operator can see the brand/version, not just the log line.\n- routes/toolScan.ts: validated evade/tamper/delay body params + audit detail.\n- Dockerfile: install wafw00f (best-effort; a failed install just leaves the\n  header fallback in place).\n- frontend: an \"Evade WAF\" toggle on the sqlmap card (default on) + the evade\n  flag on api.runTool.\n- Tests for the tamper map and the wafw00f output parser.","tree":{"sha":"8dbbe7bb5c9d62843a11eb7b937652805d79e2b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/8dbbe7bb5c9d62843a11eb7b937652805d79e2b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/0473129776ed69f87b75605ce5ad17c84593fcf0","verification"