iaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/e53348f0b3c904b9f94a9540c3f6c7c541a49756/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:29:43Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:29:43Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"fix(a11y-test): stop an unmapped api call crashing a swept render\n\nThe Replay sweep renders MatchReplacePanel, which loads api.matchReplaceRules on\nmount; the mock did not map it, so `r.rules` was undefined and the panel''s\n`rules.filter(...)` threw once the async setState landed inside the render''s act\nwindow - a timing-dependent failure that passed locally but failed in CI.\n\nMaps matchReplaceRules explicitly and gives the api mock a safe-empty default\n(every property reads as an empty array) so any other unmapped mount-time load a\ndefault-rendered panel makes cannot crash the sweep regardless of promise timing.\nFull frontend suite deterministic (101 tests); lint clean.","tree":{"sha":"9c78b601f5efc3c368ba45ba0dc44d199c8c8bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/9c78b601f5efc3c368ba45ba0dc44d199c8c8bad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/e53348f0b3c904b9f94a9540c3f6c7c541a49756","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"ve