/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/671615676507c421005264d9d86abfe91799deeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:17:02Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:17:02Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(a11y): complete the page axe sweep across the rich workspaces\n\nFinal batch of per-page accessibility sweeps: Home, Findings, Domains, Intel,\nReplay, API Surface, Assets, Reports, Methodology, Next actions, Command center,\nSubdomains, Traffic, Canvas, Assessment runs and Assessment profiles. Every\nworkspace page is now under the sweep (34 pages). The api mock gains the\nhome/overview/correlate/chains/next-actions/methodology/runs/snapshots/\nidentities/assets/captures/drawings fixtures these pages load, and Excalidraw is\nstubbed so the Canvas shell renders without a real canvas engine.\n\nThe sweep flagged unnamed form controls on the HTTP-lab surfaces: the Repeater\nmethod/identity selects and header/body textareas, every Intruder/Authz/\nmatch-replace/payload-library select, and the API-discovery host select (which\nhad only a title). Each now carries an aria-label. Full suite green (99 tests);\nlint and typecheck clean.","tree":{"sha":"fc6607ba9afec353ce42a274d2a04af4e765497b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/fc6607ba9afec353ce42a274d2a04af4e765497b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/671615676507c421005264d9d86abfe91799deeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u