.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4f1a4292dfc2c6eba97d23361a02175e97888b90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:27:56Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:27:56Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(a11y): per-page axe sweeps and accessible filter selects\n\nAdds a reusable page-render axe harness and a first batch of per-page\naccessibility sweeps, which is the remaining audit a11y track.\n\n- frontend/src/test/renderPage.tsx: renders a workspace page the way the Shell\n  does (app-state/toast/confirm providers, inside a <main> landmark so axe''s\n  region rule reflects the real app, not the isolation) plus an\n  expectNoAxeViolations helper (color-contrast off, as jsdom has no layout).\n- frontend/src/pages/pages.a11y.test.tsx: sweeps Whois, Check Host, Audit,\n  Activity log and Notes against axe with the api module mocked to empty-but-valid\n  shapes. Extend the returns map + an it() block to bring another page under it.\n\nThe sweep caught five filter/scope <select> controls with no accessible name\n(select-name, WCAG 4.1.2) across Audit, Jobs and Notes; each now has a\ndescriptive aria-label. Frontend lint clean; 19 files / 70 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"0d97c56f310a6165274adbee29164e737870ef4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/0d97c56f310a6165274adbee29164e737870ef4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/4f1a4292dfc2c6eba97d23361a02175e97888b90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"htt