d}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/65e837982c3b6b12fd7f32d02a042dd77677fd18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:33:52Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:33:52Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(api): response contracts for intel, tools, replay-sitemap and readiness\n\nThird increment of the runtime-validated API contracts. Adds zod schemas +\nboundary validation (types inferred as the single source of truth) for the next\nbatch of read endpoints.\n\n- schemas.ts: WhoisResult, CheckHostResult (+ping/tcp), AttackPath,\n  SignatureCluster, NextAction, ChainSuggestion, SitemapEndpoint/Host, and the\n  full MetaStatus readiness object. The check-host `dns` union is deliberately\n  NOT .passthrough() so the UI''s `''error'' in dns` narrowing still works (a\n  catchall index signature would defeat it).\n- tools.ts: whois + check-host validated.\n- intel.ts: correlate, next-actions (get + patch) and chains validated.\n- system.ts: /meta/status readiness validated.\n- replay.ts: sitemap validated.\n\nScope note: the deep assessment-run graph (run -> steps -> jobs), the\nmethodology coverage graph, and replay history/identity/intruder are the last\nhand-typed reads left; they''re large nested shapes best done as their own pass.\nBackend-side shared-schema validation still needs a shared package/monorepo.\n\nTests: contracts.test.ts covers intel/checkhost/sitemap/meta incl. a bad enum;\napi.facade.test.ts stub widened now that correlate validates. Frontend 60 tests\npass, typecheck + build clean.","tree":{"sha":"df730bfd9a3b2b58d0554654314102629e3cb97e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/df730bfd9a3b2b58d0554654314102629e3cb97e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/65e837982c3b6b12fd7f32d02a042dd77677fd18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/65e837982c3b6b12fd7f32d02a042dd77677fd18","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDY1ZTgzNzk4MmMzYjZiMTJmZDdmMzJkMDJhMDQyZGQ3NzY3N2ZkMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a","sha":"8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a"}],"sha":"65e837982c3b6b12fd7f32d02a042dd77677fd18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/65e837982c3b6b12fd7f32d02a042dd77677fd18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:17:51Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T21:17:51Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(api): extend response contracts to domains, home, captures and audit\n\nSecond increment of the runtime-validated API contracts. Adds zod schemas +\nboundary validation for the next batch of core read objects, all inferred as the\nsingle source of truth and re-exported from their existing clients so imports are\nunchanged.\n\n- schemas.ts: Capture (+page/summary), Domain (+ profile/owaspConfig/scopeConfig,\n  DomainMode), DomainOverview, AuditEntry (+page/summary), and the Home overview\n  response (overview + topFindings + recentChanges). All .passthrough().\n- captures.ts: captures page + summary validated.\n- domains.ts: domains list, overview, and the create/setMode/update mutation\n  responses validated.\n- content.ts: audit page + summary validated.\n- home.ts: the /home overview response validated (TodayData left for later - its\n  payloads are freeform).\n\nTests: contracts.test.ts covers capture/domain/overview/audit incl. a bad enum;\napi.facade.test.ts + api.test.ts stubs updated to the real response shapes now\nthat these endpoints validate. Frontend 59 tests pass, typecheck + build clean.\n\nRemaining for a later pass: intel, replay reads, tools, scans, system, and the\nshared backend-side schema (which needs a shared package / monorepo to avoid\nduplicating the definitions).","tree":{"sha":"e96b9186b1ff6e6983c6b25d59d6c0b29d6b26c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/e96b9186b1ff6e6983c6b25d59d6c0b29d6b26c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDhmNGUyYTljZGQwZjVhYTJlNDc1MWQwYTY5M2UxYjVkNDJlZThiM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f","sha":"6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f"}],"sha":"8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8f4e2a9cdd0f5aa2e4751d0a693e1b5d42ee8b3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:52:57Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:52:57Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(api): runtime-validated response contracts at the transport boundary\n\nAudit priority #2, first increment. The frontend request wrapper used to cast\nres.json() straight to the requested type, so a backend shape change compiled\nfine and only broke at runtime (or rendered undefined silently). Now core\nresponses are validated with zod at the boundary and their TypeScript types are\ninferred from those schemas (single source of truth).\n\n- api/schemas.ts: zod schemas for the core objects - Job, Finding, Subdomain -\n  plus their page/summary wrappers, each .passthrough() so a backend that ADDS a\n  field still validates; only a missing or wrong-typed known field fails. Types\n  are exported via z.infer and re-exported from the existing api clients, so all\n  import sites are unchanged.\n- api/http.ts: request()/get/post/patch/put/del take an optional schema; when\n  present the body is validated and the inferred type flows out, else it stays a\n  plain cast - so migration is incremental and un-migrated calls are untouched.\n  New ContractError extends ApiError, so page-level error handling surfaces a\n  contract mismatch like any other failed request instead of showing undefined.\n- Migrated the high-traffic reads: findings list + summary, subdomains page +\n  summary, jobs list/get/cancel.\n\nScope note: the remaining objects (domains, intel, replay, captures, audit,\ntools) and backend-side response schemas are follow-ups; the opt-in schema\nparam makes that a drop-in per endpoint.\n\nTests: api/contracts.test.ts (valid passes, extra field tolerated, missing/\nwrong-typed field throws, nested page shapes); api.test.ts findings mock updated\nto include nextCursor. Frontend 58 tests pass, typecheck + build clean.","tree":{"sha":"a39b42257b571755b03c68d277d4804d6908c914","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/a39b42257b571755b03c68d277d4804d6908c914"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDY1MDg5MjBjNDc5NDdkOGQ3YTA5YTVkM2ZjMDg4ZTcwNjdkNzA2MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313","sha":"95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313"}],"sha":"6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6508920c47947d8d7a09a5d3fc088e7067d7061f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:11:09Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:11:09Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(scans): finish Cloudflare bypass across HTTP tools and Replay\n\nCompletes the Cloudflare-clearance coverage so every request path handles a\nchallenged host, not just the subdomain probe and the main scanners.\n\ncfClearance.ts: add clearanceHeadersIfChallenged() (gated header map for the\nin-process guardedFetch routines) and getClearanceIfChallenged().\n\nbinTools.ts: the HTTP-based tool routines now ride a solved clearance when the\nhost is challenged -\n- wp-enum, 403-bypass and the HTTP-method audit thread cf_clearance + browser UA\n  into every guardedFetch (empty -> undefined so unchallenged calls are byte-for-\n  byte as before).\n- 403-bypass merges the clearance under each bypass attempt''s own headers.\nDatastore probes are left alone (they target :9200/:5984 etc, not behind CF).\n\nReplay:\n- send.ts: after a send, if the response is a Cloudflare challenge and the\n  operator didn''t already supply cf_clearance, solve once and replay with the\n  cookie + UA merged in; flag it with cloudflareSolved on the response.\n- intruder.ts: pre-warm the clearance ONCE and bake it into the template, so\n  every payload attempt carries it in a single request instead of each one\n  hitting the 403 and re-solving.\n- frontend: surface a \"Cloudflare solved\" badge in the Repeater.\n\nTests: binTools + intruder stub cfClearance so the pre-warm stays offline;\nexisting behaviour unchanged (509 backend tests pass).","tree":{"sha":"5e1390d4fa939002e90996bca82ecb0afc904b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/5e1390d4fa939002e90996bca82ecb0afc904b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDk1Mzg4ZDQwYzY1NTYxN2ZjODU1Y2QwNDAzZGIyMTNjMjlhZjYzMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d","sha":"45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d"}],"sha":"95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/95388d40c655617fc855cd0403db213c29af6313"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:49:59Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:49:59Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(scans): carry Cloudflare clearance into active scans\n\nExtends the subdomain-probe Cloudflare bypass to the active scanners, which\nwere all getting the \"Just a moment...\" 403 on every request against a\nCF-fronted host. New sources/cfClearance.ts solves the challenge once in the\nheadless Chromium already in the image (persistent --user-data-dir), then reads\ncf_clearance + __cf_bm from the profile''s Cookies SQLite and decrypts them with\nthe deterministic Linux-headless key (v10, 32-byte domain-hash prefix stripped\nfor Chrome M124+). Cached per host for 20 min; every failure returns nothing so\nthe scan proceeds unauthenticated.\n\nWired in, each gated on a cheap challenge check so Chromium only launches for a\nhost that is actually blocked:\n- OWASP engine: a challenged landing request triggers a solve; the cf_clearance\n  cookie + browser UA merge into ctx.headers for every subsequent check.\n- nuclei + ffuf: clearanceCliArgs() adds repeatable -H Cookie/User-Agent. ffuf\n  skips it in vhost mode.\n- katana + dalfox (-H) and sqlmap (--cookie/--user-agent) in binTools.ts.\n\nSSRF: solver resolves, vets and pins Chromium to the target address, identical\nto the screenshot path. Clears JS challenges, not an interactive CAPTCHA.\n\nTests: decryptCookieValue round-trip incl. domain-hash prefix + v11 rejection,\nand readClearanceCookies over a built Cookies DB.","tree":{"sha":"551fb425c4f213c6030f799f144cb1f8e2fdba6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/551fb425c4f213c6030f799f144cb1f8e2fdba6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDQ1YzI4YjI1ZWVjMmE0MDQ2ZmFkOWQwMWU2OGNmMDkwYWIwNjUzN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6","sha":"50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6"}],"sha":"45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/45c28b25eec2a4046fad9d01e68cf090ab06537d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:19:57Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:19:57Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(subdomains): bypass Cloudflare challenges with a headless-browser probe\n\nA plain fetch only ever sees Cloudflare''s ''Just a moment...'' JS interstitial\n(403/503), so a host that loads fine in a real browser showed as a dead 403 in\nthe dashboard. Two changes:\n\n- WAF/CDN classification. detectWaf() fingerprints Cloudflare/Akamai/Sucuri/\n  Imperva/Fastly from response headers + the challenge body; httpx reads -cdn/\n  tech. Stored on a new subdomains.waf column (migration 0037) and surfaced as a\n  badge - a 403/503/429 behind a WAF now reads ''protected'', not dead. The\n  built-in probe also sends full modern-Chrome client hints + Sec-Fetch-* so\n  header-only WAF rules stop challenging it.\n\n- Real bypass. New sources/browserProbe.ts re-probes Cloudflare-challenged hosts\n  through the headless Chromium already in the image (--dump-dom, 15s virtual-\n  time budget): it runs the challenge JS and reaches the real app exactly like\n  the operator''s browser, then we read title/content/up from the rendered DOM.\n  Bounded to 25 hosts/run at concurrency 3, skipped when Chromium is absent, and\n  SSRF-guarded identically to the screenshot path (resolve -> vet -> pin\n  --host-resolver-rules, block all other DNS). Cleared hosts flip 403 -> 200.\n  Solves JS challenges (auto-solve); an interactive CAPTCHA still won''t pass.\n\nTests: detectWaf, httpx Cloudflare parse, isChallengePage; subdomains query\nfixture gains the waf column.","tree":{"sha":"ccb0eb95b13b0f31050604d729d14717a1c35533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/ccb0eb95b13b0f31050604d729d14717a1c35533"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDUwYzkyOTUyYTEzZDZhNTQ1ZTY2Mjc5Y2NhYjFmZjJiN2ZkOGQ0YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f","sha":"9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f"}],"sha":"50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/50c92952a13d6a545e66279ccab1ff2b7fd8d4b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:19:40Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:19:40Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"fix(nav): stop sidebar result-dots lighting up on every startup\n\nThe green ''new results'' dot used seen[key] ?? 0 as its baseline, so any\nmodule with a historically-completed job lit up green on every load/reload\n(finishedAt always beats 0). Baseline is now the shell mount time, so a job\nmust finish after you open the app to count as new.","tree":{"sha":"b8447b05c1e4db88a254f9b0d55e69454e34f6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/b8447b05c1e4db88a254f9b0d55e69454e34f6aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDllYjllMTlkMTAzM2FlMTMzOGZmN2I1OGM5YTAwYjZmMGJiZGEyMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/f56f130e6889799300c370cc09e43ff1f0a9c6ab","sha":"f56f130e6889799300c370cc09e43ff1f0a9c6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/f56f130e6889799300c370cc09e43ff1f0a9c6ab"}],"sha":"9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/9eb9e19d1033ae1338ff7b58c9a00b6f0bbda22f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/f56f130e6889799300c370cc09e43ff1f0a9c6ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T00:07:08Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T00:07:08Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(a11y): focus-trap, focus-restore and labelling for the confirm dialog\n\nThe app-wide confirm dialog (every scan/delete/retest confirmation) had a\nrole and Esc handling but leaked keyboard focus: Tab could move into the\npage behind it, focus was never returned to the trigger on close, and the\ntitle/message weren''t wired as the dialog''s accessible name/description.\n\n- Confirm.tsx: trap Tab within the dialog (wraps at both ends and pulls a\n  stray focus back in), record the element focused before opening and\n  restore it on close, and link the title/message via\n  aria-labelledby/aria-describedby (useId). Esc-cancel and confirm-button\n  auto-focus are kept.\n- Confirm.test.tsx: labelled/described modal + confirm-button focus, no axe\n  violations, Tab is trapped, Esc resolves false and restores focus to the\n  trigger, and confirming resolves true.\n\nScoped to the shared dialog — the highest-impact keyboard/focus surface\nsince it is reused everywhere. Broader keyboard/focus coverage (Replay,\nCommand Center, mobile nav) remains a follow-up.","tree":{"sha":"0e5723eeaff07df62ce23c699ccb2f1f88d91031","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/0e5723eeaff07df62ce23c699ccb2f1f88d91031"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repo