ew_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/29ff5ae38b778fec70d94e157e6c22f5e38ec62b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:30:01Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:30:01Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"refactor(api-surface): split the page into per-capability cards\n\nApiSurface.tsx was 941 lines holding the page shell plus every result card\n(spec, GraphQL, JS recon, crawl, ffuf) and the JWT inspector in one file.\nIt is now split by capability under pages/apisurface/, with the page down\nto ~350 lines. No behaviour change — a move + re-export.\n\n- pages/apisurface/types.ts — the shared finding shapes (SpecData/\n  SpecEndpoint/…, GqlData/GqlOperation, JsData).\n- pages/apisurface/GraphqlCard.tsx — GraphQL endpoint card (+ its\n  gqlToReplay starter builder).\n- pages/apisurface/SpecCard.tsx — OpenAPI/Swagger spec card (+ its\n  method tones and the specToReplay/pickServer/sampleForType helpers).\n- pages/apisurface/JsCard.tsx — endpoints/params/secrets mined from JS.\n- pages/apisurface/CrawlCard.tsx and FfufCard.tsx — katana-crawled and\n  ffuf-fuzzed endpoint lists.\n- pages/apisurface/JwtInspector.tsx — the local JWT decoder (+ its\n  b64urlToJson and JsonBlock helpers).\n- pages/ApiSurface.tsx — now just the page: discovery/crawl/fuzz actions,\n  polling + classification of api findings, the summary, and dispatch to\n  the cards (keeping the isApiUrl helper it alone uses).\n\nVerified: frontend lint clean, 15 files / 48 tests passing, production\nbuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"b189c729ec308e23a3fdc1923142340c4d085a41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/b189c729ec308e23a3fdc1923142340c4d085a41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/29ff5ae38b778fec70d94e157e6c22f5e38ec62b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu