_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d42ebe7b68a694b9f46c607e2ab3f70e9481def2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:21:32Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:21:32Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"refactor(replay): split the page into per-capability panels\n\nReplay.tsx had grown to 2038 lines — the biggest page — holding the shell,\nthe shared request editor, and all six tool panels plus their helpers in\none file. It is now split by capability under pages/replay/, with the page\nitself down to ~240 lines. No behaviour change — a move + re-export.\n\n- pages/replay/shared.tsx — the cross-panel types (BuiltReq, BuiltRequest),\n  constants (METHODS, PAYLOAD_MARKER), pure helpers (parseHeaders,\n  statusTone) and the small NumField input reused by several panels.\n- pages/replay/RequestEditor.tsx — the left-hand method/URL/headers/body\n  composer.\n- pages/replay/IdentityBar.tsx — named identities (A/B/anon) manager.\n- pages/replay/SitemapPanel.tsx — endpoint tree (+ its method tones).\n- pages/replay/RepeaterPanel.tsx — send + response viewer + history\n  (+ the isolated-preview and shortUrl helpers it alone uses).\n- pages/replay/IntruderPanel.tsx — fuzzing config/run/results (+ its\n  AttemptTable, detectPositions, attack modes), composing PayloadLibrary\n  and EncoderBar.\n- pages/replay/PayloadLibrary.tsx and EncoderBar.tsx — the payload-set\n  picker and the encoder chain used inside Intruder.\n- pages/replay/InjectPanel.tsx, JwtPanel.tsx, AuthzPanel.tsx — the blind\n  SQLi, JWT alg-confusion and IDOR/authz confirmers.\n- pages/Replay.tsx — now just the shell: mode tabs, the shared editor\n  state, the Traffic/Findings handoff, and dispatch to the panels.\n\nVerified: frontend lint clean, 15 files / 48 tests passing, production\nbuild clean (main entry index-*.js unchanged at ~221 kB).","tree":{"sha":"4642119cdda763203b202b1a65377f37dcd82ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/4642119cdda763203b202b1a65377f37dcd82ee1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/d42ebe7b68a694b9f46c607e2ab3f70e9481def2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d42ebe7b68a694b9f46c607e2ab3f70e9481def2","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGQ0MmViZTdiNjhhNjk0YjlmNDZjNjA3ZTJhYjNmNzBlOTQ4MWRlZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25","sha":"4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25"}],"sha":"d42ebe7b68a694b9f46c607e2ab3f70e9481def2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d42ebe7b68a694b9f46c607e2ab3f70e9481def2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:31:37Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:31:37Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"refactor(findings): split the page into per-capability components\n\nFindings.tsx had grown to 1245 lines mixing the page shell, the row, the\nwhole expanded-detail view, and the snapshots panel. It is now split by\ncapability under pages/findings/, with the page itself down to ~600 lines.\nNo behaviour change — purely a move + re-export.\n\n- pages/findings/constants.ts — the shared status/type/severity/since\n  vocabularies, risk colours and tagTone helper used across the components.\n- pages/findings/FindingDetail.tsx — the expanded detail view and every\n  part it owns: Detail, ScoreReasons, CveList, NoteEditor, the loud\n  CveVerifyButton, the Repeater/Intruder pivots (findingUrl/markParamUrl)\n  and LinkedFindings. Only FindingDetail is exported.\n- pages/findings/FindingRow.tsx — the collapsed row (score, tags, inline\n  triage select) that expands into FindingDetail.\n- pages/findings/SnapshotsPanel.tsx — the frozen-report snapshots panel.\n- pages/Findings.tsx — now just the page: filters, server-side query +\n  keyset pagination, selection/bulk-triage, keyboard triage, and the AI\n  narrative/triage panels, composing the extracted components.\n\nVerified: frontend lint clean, 15 files / 48 tests passing, production\nbuild clean.","tree":{"sha":"89d07b35ba2b878936ea8c32c910c4eefc4154f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/89d07b35ba2b878936ea8c32c910c4eefc4154f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDQzNDhkNGEzYTg3ODYxMjkzOGU3NjVmMjFkM2I2ODc4N2VlOTVjMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31","sha":"014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31"}],"sha":"4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4348d4a3a878612938e765f21d3b68787ee95c25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:13:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T21:13:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(captures): server-side filtering and cursor pagination\n\nThe Traffic page fetched the newest 300 captures every 2s and filtered\nthem in the browser, so a heavy browsing session''s older requests fell off\nthe end and the full set re-shipped each poll. The list is now paged and\nfiltered in SQL, while the bulk store helper stays intact for the callers\nthat need every row.\n\nBackend capture/store.ts gains `queryCaptures`: an exact `method` facet and\na free-text `q` (substring over host, URL or method — mirroring the page''s\nsingle search box) are WHERE clauses, and results page with a keyset cursor\nover the primary key (monotonic id, so `id desc` is newest-first and the\nkeyset is a single-id comparison). LIKE uses an explicit `escape ''\\''` so a\nliteral % / _ matches as text; an invalid cursor is ignored. New\n`summarizeCaptures` returns total + per-method counts (method facet\nexcluded). The list projection (everything except the up-to-512KB body,\nwhich stays lazy-loaded) is now shared by listCaptures and queryCaptures;\n`listCaptures` itself is unchanged for its bulk callers (owaspActive,\nsitemap).\n\nBackend routes/capture.ts: `GET /api/capture` now returns\n`{ captures, nextCursor }` and accepts method/q/cursor (shared\n`parseCaptureFilters`); new `GET /api/capture/summary`. `/capture/:id`,\ndelete and clear are unchanged.\n\nFrontend api/captures.ts: `api.captures` gains a query object + paged\nreturn (`CapturePage`); new `api.capturesSummary`. Facade `api.ts`\nre-exports the new types; `api.facade.test.ts` adds `capturesSummary`.\n\nFrontend pages/Traffic.tsx: the search box (debounced 200ms) and a new\nmethod dropdown (fed by the summary) moved server-side, a \"Load more\"\nbutton driven by `nextCursor`, and a header total from the summary. The 2s\nlive poll refreshes the newest page but pauses once the operator pages back\nthrough history (so appended pages aren''t clobbered); a \"jump to latest\"\ncontrol resumes it.\n\nTests: backend capture/query.test.ts (newest-first + body omitted/hasBody,\nkeyset paging with no gaps/dupes, method filter, q over host/url/method,\nliteral-_ escape, invalid-cursor restart, summary counts); frontend\napi.test.ts (facet/cursor serialization + summary endpoint).","tree":{"sha":"79c2b367af6662cc3e07d800018556458ac6a6e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/79c2b367af6662cc3e07d800018556458ac6a6e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDAxNGM0M2I1OThlM2NiYzU2MmMyZWI3NWQxYWI1ZTMyMWZkODljMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01","sha":"81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01"}],"sha":"014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/014c43b598e3cbc562c2eb75d1ab5e321fd89c31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:58:44Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:58:44Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(subdomains): server-side filtering, sorting and cursor pagination\n\nThe Subdomains page fetched every host for a domain (listSubdomains has no\nlimit) and sorted/filtered them in the browser, so a domain with thousands\nof discovered hosts shipped the whole set on every 3s poll and grew slow.\nThe page''s data layer is now SQL, while the full unpaged list is preserved\nfor the callers that genuinely need every row.\n\nBackend subdomains/store.ts gains `querySubdomains`: the host filter and\nthe new-only facet are WHERE clauses, and results page with a keyset cursor\nover the chosen sort column plus the primary key as a stable tiebreak. The\nkeyset comparison mirrors the ORDER BY exactly (same coalesce sentinel for\nNULLs, same direction, same id tiebreak) for all five sorts\n(status/host/ip/lastSeen/new) in both directions, so pages never overlap or\ndrop a row. Host/ip use `collate nocase` so the order matches the browser''s\nprevious localeCompare; the host filter uses LIKE with an explicit\n`escape ''\\''` so a literal % / _ matches as text. An invalid cursor is\nignored (restart from top). New `summarizeSubdomains` returns total +\nnew-host count (newOnly facet excluded) for the header. `listSubdomains` is\nleft untouched for export, correlation, scan seeding and global counts.\n\nBackend routes/domains.ts: new `GET /api/domains/:id/subdomains/page`\nreturning `{ subdomains, nextCursor }` (q/newOnly/sort/dir/limit/cursor)\nand `GET /api/domains/:id/subdomains/summary`. The existing bare\n`/subdomains` full-list route is unchanged.\n\nFrontend api/recon.ts: new `api.subdomainsPage` (paged) and\n`api.subdomainsSummary`, with `SubdomainQuery`/`SubdomainPage`/\n`SubdomainSummary`/`SubdomainSort` types; `api.subdomains` (full list) and\nits four callers (app state, API Surface, Changes) are unchanged. Facade\n`api.ts` re-exports the new types; `api.facade.test.ts` adds the two\nmethods.\n\nFrontend pages/Subdomains.tsx: sorting and a debounced (200ms) host search\nplus a \"New only\" toggle moved server-side, a \"Load more\" button driven by\n`nextCursor`, and the header total/new counts from the summary. The 3s poll\nnow runs only while a discovery/permute job is active, so loaded pages\naren''t clobbered when idle.\n\nTests: backend subdomains/query.test.ts (every sort in both directions,\nkeyset paging with no gaps/dupes for asc and desc, host filter incl.\nliteral-_ escape, new-only, domain scoping, invalid-cursor restart, summary\ncounts); frontend api.test.ts (page facet/cursor serialization + summary).","tree":{"sha":"3e30c0a056aa76dedbc6f4ca3a3dbd8019cd1033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/3e30c0a056aa76dedbc6f4ca3a3dbd8019cd1033"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDgxYzQxZGJkYTMxNjNjZmJjZDk4NTU5YmQzMjJiMGFiM2U2NjZjMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6","sha":"27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6"}],"sha":"81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/81c41dbda3163cfbcd98559bd322b0ab3e666c01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:43:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:43:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(audit): server-side filtering and cursor pagination\n\nThe audit ledger page pulled up to 500 rows and had no way to page past\nthem, so a long-running engagement silently truncated its own record, and\nit re-shipped the whole set on every load with no filtering beyond the\ndomain scope. All of that is now SQL.\n\nBackend audit/store.ts gains `queryAudit`: every facet (domain, actor,\naction, mode, target, since) is a WHERE clause and results page with a\nkeyset cursor over the primary key. The id is a monotonic autoincrement\nwritten in insertion order, so `id desc` is newest-first and the keyset\nneeds only a single-id comparison (no composite tuple). `target` uses\nLIKE with an explicit `escape ''\\''` so a user `%`/`_` matches literally.\nA garbled/out-of-range cursor is ignored (restart from top), never thrown.\nNew `summarizeAudit`: total + per-action counts (GROUP BY) with the action\nfacet excluded, so the header/dropdown counts never load every row.\n`listAudit` is left untouched.\n\nBackend routes/audit.ts: `GET /api/audit` now returns\n`{ entries, nextCursor }` and accepts actor/action/mode/target/since/cursor\n(shared `parseAuditFilters`); new `GET /api/audit/summary`.\n\nFrontend api/content.ts: `api.audit` gains the new params and a paged\nreturn type (`AuditPage`); new `api.auditSummary`. Facade `api.ts`\nre-exports the new types; `api.facade.test.ts` adds `auditSummary`.\n\nFrontend pages/Audit.tsx: action filter (a frequency-sorted dropdown fed\nby the summary) and a debounced (200ms) target search moved server-side, a\n\"Load more\" button driven by `nextCursor`, and a total from the summary.\n\nTests: backend audit/query.test.ts (id ordering, keyset paging with no\ngaps/dupes, each filter, literal-`%`/`_` escape, exclusive `since` on the\ntimestamp not the id, invalid-cursor restart, summary counts); frontend\napi.test.ts (audit facet/cursor serialization + summary endpoint).","tree":{"sha":"9356fae7da4ccaddf357900e6ae6d913b506ad76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/9356fae7da4ccaddf357900e6ae6d913b506ad76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDI3ZWZhZWM3ZGY0MGM5MjI4MWY4YzM4YjI2MjY0MDVjMzVhYWQ3ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c","sha":"d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c"}],"sha":"27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/27efaec7df40c92281f8c38b2626405c35aad7d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:12:51Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:12:51Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(findings): server-side filtering and cursor pagination\n\nThe Findings page pulled up to 500 rows and filtered, sorted, and counted\nthem in the browser, which truncated on a busy engagement and re-shipped the\nwhole set on every load. Push all of that into SQL.\n\nBackend:\n- queryFindings: every facet (domain, type, status, severity, asset, tag,\n  since) is a WHERE clause and results page with a keyset cursor over the\n  (score, createdAt, id) sort, so a page is O(page) regardless of table size.\n  NULL scores are coalesced to -1 so they sort last consistently in both the\n  ORDER BY and the row-value cursor comparison. asset/tag use LIKE with an\n  explicit escape so a user % or _ matches literally. A garbled cursor is\n  ignored rather than throwing.\n- summarizeFindings: total plus per-status and per-severity counts for the\n  filter set (status/severity facets excluded) via GROUP BY, so the header\n  and facet counts never require loading every row.\n- GET /api/findings now returns { findings, nextCursor } and accepts status,\n  severity, asset, tag, cursor; new GET /api/findings/summary. listFindings\n  and its other callers are untouched.\n\nFrontend:\n- api.findings gains the new query params and paged return type; new\n  api.findingsSummary. Facade re-exports and the characterization surface are\n  updated (findingsSummary added).\n- Findings page moves status/tag/asset filtering to the server, adds a\n  severity filter, a \"Load more\" button driven by the cursor, and a total\n  from the summary. Text inputs are debounced so typing does not fire a\n  request per keystroke.\n\nTests: backend query.test.ts (ordering, keyset paging with no gaps/dupes,\neach filter, literal-% escape, summary counts); frontend api.test.ts covers\nthe new facet/cursor serialization and the summary endpoint.","tree":{"sha":"a3751f2640c0e49b7ac7f4dd32e1143944defc0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/a3751f2640c0e49b7ac7f4dd32e1143944defc0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGQ3MzczYThhYjBlYmMyYzhhNjc0YzUwMDE0NGFiY2UzODFkNmQzNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93","sha":"7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93"}],"sha":"d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d7373a8ab0ebc2c8a674c500144abce381d6d34c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:27:48Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:27:48Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(frontend): surface offline and expired-session state\n\nBackground pollers previously swallowed transport failures, so a dropped\nTailscale link or an expired session left the UI frozen with no\nexplanation. Add a small framework-free connection store fed from the\nsingle transport choke point in http.ts: a network-level fetch rejection\nmarks the app offline (ignoring intentional aborts), any response marks it\nback online, and a 401 flags the session as expired.\n\nA fixed ConnectionBanner shows on both the login screen and the shell\nwhenever the backend is unreachable, reacting to the browser offline event\nfor instant feedback and clearing on the next successful request. A 401\nfrom any request now expires an authenticated session: the app routes back\nto the login screen, which explains why. The initial anonymous auth probe\nis distinguished from a genuine mid-session expiry so the notice never\nshows on a normal first login.\n\nAdds connection and banner tests; lint, 40 frontend tests, typecheck, and\nthe production build pass.","tree":{"sha":"441a2418f93abb39ef7389306f57b503f80cac97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/441a2418f93abb39ef7389306f57b503f80cac97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDdkOWJkMDYzNTNhMDk4MGI0ZjVhM2MwN2E3YWNkNWEwYzc5NGRkOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/d1e5304951833ce5b3265b27a24fd47a6cc0a30e","sha":"d1e5304951833ce5b3265b27a24fd47a6cc0a30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d1e5304951833ce5b3265b27a24fd47a6cc0a30e"}],"sha":"7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/7d9bd06353a0980b4f5a3c07a7acd5a0c794dd93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/d1e5304951833ce5b3265b27a24fd47a6cc0a30e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:14:22Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:14:22Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"refactor(api): split api client into per-domain modules\n\nThe monolithic frontend/src/api.ts (932 lines) held every request method\nand interface in one object. Extract cohesive per-domain clients under\nsrc/api/ (auth, home, domains, recon, scans, intel, replay, captures,\njobs, findings, tools, content), each owning its own types, and reduce\napi.ts to a thin facade that composes the clients and re-exports their\ntypes. Existing `import { api, type Finding } from ''./api''` call sites are\nunchanged; the transport (http.ts) and system client stay as they were.\n\nAdd api.facade.test.ts as a characterization guard: it pins the exact\npre-split set of 121 public methods, asserts each is callable, checks a\nsample of clients still route through the shared transport, and verifies\nthe pure URL-builder helpers. Lint, 32 frontend tests, typecheck, and the\nproduction build all pass; the main entry chunk is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"b32be0e0cd4e56523ed8baf33bcf1f7dfed08ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/b32be0e0cd4e56523ed8baf33bcf1f7dfed08ece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/d1e5304951833ce5b3265b27a24fd47a6cc0a30e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1OD