owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/38ca0584e844440c9c450469dbd60ecac766f972/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:49:20Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:49:20Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(platform): per-asset change watch (detect -> suggest, never auto-fire)\n\nGeneralize the cveWatch baseline pattern into a per-IP attribute baseline.\nmigration 0030: asset_snapshots(domainId, ip, ports, tech, up). On each\nexposure scan, findings/changeWatch.ts snapshots the IP''s open ports / tech\n(CPEs) / up-ness, diffs it against the baseline (pure diffSnapshot), and on a\nmaterial change - a new open port, new tech, a host newly reachable or gone\ndark - files a `changed_*` (type asset_change) finding + a grouped Discord\nalert. The first snapshot only baselines, so initial discovery never floods.\n\nAutomatic DETECTION, operator-gated EXECUTION: each finding carries a\nsuggested one-click action (nmap the IP / OWASP the host), but nothing loud\nis ever enqueued from the watch. diffSnapshot unit-tested (new port, new\ntech case-insensitive, up/down, no-change, removed-port-not-flagged).","tree":{"sha":"bf82d866802133fdaf9546440f145774c29e202d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/bf82d866802133fdaf9546440f145774c29e202d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/38ca0584e844440c9c450469dbd60ecac766f972","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/