}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/6fcd23aa3bd5852ccbcef55e44829416565581ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:37:02Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:37:02Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(replay): payload-library depth + base64url/fromCharCode encoders\n\nNew builtin payload sets: XXE, CRLF/header-injection, Log4Shell/JNDI (incl.\nobfuscated ${lower:...} forms), mass-assignment field lists, and prototype\npollution. Extend the SSRF set with Azure IMDS\n(169.254.169.254/metadata/instance?... - needs Metadata: true) and the AWS\nIAM security-credentials path. Add base64url (+ decode) and a from-char-code\nencoder (String.fromCharCode wrapper for JS-string XSS evasion). New encoders\nunit-tested (url-safe alphabet round-trip + fromCharCode shape).","tree":{"sha":"1d60734a3a30fb2d517fdee7d82e9d8f63466d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/1d60734a3a30fb2d517fdee7d82e9d8f63466d22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/6fcd23aa3bd5852ccbcef55e44829416565581ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://a