sers/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/67aedd0e4b6703e96a4aff0f958b93d20230c5ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:30:23Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:30:23Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(owasp): open-redirect @-userinfo / fullwidth / null-byte bypasses\n\nAdd the payload forms a naive allowlist misses: @-userinfo (the real host\nis after the @), encoded-slash + @ (defeats servers that decode %2f),\nfullwidth slashes some parsers normalize to //, and null-byte truncation.\nredirectsToAttacker already resolves the server''s ACTUAL Location via WHATWG\nURL, so whichever form the server honors is attributed correctly - tests\nconfirm the @-userinfo host is read as the target, and an attacker only in\nuserinfo (host is the real target) is NOT flagged.","tree":{"sha":"35992b18b68d5f105860f6e5f564ae5d2c4903c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/35992b18b68d5f105860f6e5f564ae5d2c4903c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/67aedd0e4b6703e96a4aff0f958b93d20230c5ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz"