user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/818514c30d6c7fe79e8d570a5d43b3ecc0224834/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:28:49Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:28:49Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(offense): param discovery for body + header params (not just query)\n\nparamDiscovery only did u.searchParams.set, but mass-assignment / IDOR\nparams live in the body and a few auth/routing params only take effect as\nheaders. The bisection engine is transport-agnostic, so this is a probe\nfactory: makeProbe(transport, baseUrl, fetch) places candidates in the\nquery string, a JSON body, a form body, or request headers. Added\nHEADER_PARAMS (X-Forwarded-*, X-Original-URL, X-Rewrite-URL, ...) and\nmass-assignment fields (verified/is_active/enabled/...) to the catalog.\n\nThe handler now probes all four transports by default (operator-selectable\nvia params.transports), tags each finding with its transport, and the\nfinding key includes transport so the same name found in query vs body vs\nheader dedupes apart. Per-transport request-shape + an end-to-end\nbody-only-honored-param discovery are unit-tested.","tree":{"sha":"52e57ee20ac9eeccc3f590d5613c9ad4e91e6587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/52e57ee20ac9eeccc3f590d5613c9ad4e91e6587"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/818514c30d6c7fe79e8d570a5d43b3ecc0224834","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/818514c30d6c7fe79e8d570a5d43b3ecc0224834","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDgxODUxNGMzMGQ2YzdmZTc5ZThkNTcwYTVkNDNiM2VjYzAyMjQ4MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f","sha":"a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f"}],"sha":"818514c30d6c7fe79e8d570a5d43b3ecc0224834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/818514c30d6c7fe79e8d570a5d43b3ecc0224834"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:25:28Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:25:28Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(replay): intruder quality - time-FP weighting, body excerpts, multi-extract\n\nThree Intruder quality fixes:\n\n- Anomaly detection weighted timeMs equally with status/length/words, so a\n  single slow network response false-positived. Time now needs a much larger\n  modified-z (6 vs 3.5) AND must be SLOWER than baseline; a zero-spread time\n  dimension no longer flags on jitter. Deterministic dimensions keep 3.5.\n- The response body was discarded, so the operator couldn''t see WHY a row\n  deviated. Retain a bounded 512B bodyExcerpt, kept only on the (<=200)\n  interesting rows and stripped elsewhere so large attacks stay small.\n- grep-extract pulled only the first match. Compile the regex global and\n  matchAll (capped at 20) into extractAll for token/CSRF harvesting; extract\n  keeps the first for back-compat.\n\nfindInteresting is now exported and unit-tested (jitter not flagged, real\nstatus/length change flagged, errors/matches always flagged); a mocked\nrunIntruder test covers multi-extract + excerpt-on-interesting-only. The\nIntruder table shows the excerpt on hover and a +N multi-extract hint.","tree":{"sha":"b01640bdd24635e780240d4e68459009baf7634e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/b01640bdd24635e780240d4e68459009baf7634e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGE1YzNjY2FmNGM2MjMyOGI2OTcwZTJjMWNjNTM5NGZjMGExM2VjNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728","sha":"cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728"}],"sha":"a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/a5c3ccaf4c62328b6970e2c1cc5394fc0a13ec5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:18:37Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:18:37Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(recon): favicon-hash + cert-fingerprint asset correlation\n\ncorrelate.ts joined assets by IP only, which over-links on shared CDN IPs\nand misses same-asset hosts fronted behind different edges. Add two\nsignals that survive CDN fronting:\n\n- util/mmh3.ts: MurmurHash3 x86_32 + Shodan-style faviconHash (mmh3 of the\n  newline-wrapped base64). Verified against the canonical mmh3 vector.\n- fingerprint.ts fetches the favicon (<link rel=icon> or /favicon.ico) and\n  attaches faviconHash; new guardedFetchBytes returns raw SSRF-guarded,\n  byte-capped bytes for it.\n- migration 0029: subdomains.cert_fp + favicon_hash. The exposure scan\n  collects both per host (bounded, sources/hostSignature.ts) via grabTlsCert\n  + a guarded favicon fetch, stored by updateSignature.\n- correlate.ts: pure clusterBySignature groups hosts sharing a cert fp /\n  favicon hash across DIFFERENT IPs (≥2 hosts), exposed as\n  signatureClusters(domainId) on GET /domains/:id/correlate; a \"Same-asset\n  clusters\" card renders on Intel.\n\nCloses Phase D. Grouping + mmh3 unit-tested. Backend + frontend green.","tree":{"sha":"36343165dc10759bd778c1e447a1ead9794c552c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/36343165dc10759bd778c1e447a1ead9794c552c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKGNkNTllNDdmZjIxMTY0NzI5ZWM2ODkzZGQwODkwZmM4MmQ0NzE3Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932","sha":"8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932"}],"sha":"cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/cd59e47ff21164729ec6893dd0890fc82d471728"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:09:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:09:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(recon): harvest JS source maps (.js.map) for hidden endpoints/secrets\n\njsRecon mined minified bundles with 7 regexes and actively skipped .js.map.\nA reachable source map reverses the whole bundle back to original\nTypeScript - full route tables, API clients, comments, far more secrets\nthan survive minification.\n\nRefactor the per-body extraction into a pure extractSignals(body), then\nafter fetching each bundle: find //# (or legacy //@) sourceMappingURL,\nguardedFetch the .map (SSRF-guarded, 8MB byte cap; inline data: maps\nskipped), parse sourcesContent, and run extractSignals over each original\nsource. Results merge into the same accumulators (globally capped);\nmapsScanned is reported. sourceMapUrl + parseSourceMapSources + extractSignals\nare pure and unit-tested, including a case where an internal endpoint present\nonly in the un-minified source is recovered.","tree":{"sha":"1bbd1d671a29e5369b9d0559cec351db205968c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/1bbd1d671a29e5369b9d0559cec351db205968c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDhlZjhlMWRiNmQ5ZDNiZjA5YzljMzlmNzIwZTY0NzkyMzE2MDA5MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d","sha":"4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d"}],"sha":"8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8ef8e1db6d9d3bf09c9c39f720e6479231600932"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:05:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:05:03Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(recon): parse SPF/DMARC/CAA into osint findings + infra pivots\n\nsources/dns.ts collected raw TXT but nothing parsed it. Extend resolveDns\nwith CAA and add sources/dnsIntel.ts (pure parsers):\n\n- parseSpf: include: / ip4: / ip6: / redirect= / the trailing all-qualifier.\n- parseDmarc: p / sp / pct / rua / ruf.\n- parseCaaIssuers: authorized CA hostnames.\n- buildDnsIntelFindings: weak posture -> osint findings (no SPF/DMARC or\n  DMARC p=none = spoofable, medium/low; +all permissive = medium), and the\n  third-party SPF includes + ip4/ip6 ranges as info-level recon pivots.\n\nosintHandler resolves _dmarc.<host> and folds the intel into result.dnsIntel\nalongside result.dns; SPF ip4:/ip6: ranges are surfaced as candidate infra\nranges (ASN/exposure pivots). Passive - reads DNS only. Parsers unit-tested.","tree":{"sha":"282f5a47d8cfa69442161d82bd01834a96ccbe10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/282f5a47d8cfa69442161d82bd01834a96ccbe10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDQwMDJlZTM1MzJhNmE3MmJhYWRmMmE4N2EwOWRhMWQzNWU4ZTBmMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450","sha":"51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450"}],"sha":"4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/4002ee3532a6a72baadf2a87a09da1d35e8e0f2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:01:15Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T23:01:15Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(recon): DNS permutation + brute-resolve (wildcard-guarded)\n\nDiscovery was 100% passive (CT + subfinder + SANs) with no name\npermutation. New sources/dnsPermute.ts generates candidates from a curated\nwordlist (envs / infra / regions) and from the existing inventory (numeric\nneighbours + word-affixes of known labels), then resolves them with bounded\nconcurrency (mapLimit). A MANDATORY wildcard-zone guard runs first: if a\nrandom label resolves the zone is catch-all and brute-force is worthless, so\nit is skipped (residual catch-all IPs are also filtered from any hits).\n\nDriven by a new PASSIVE dns_permute job (DNS lookups only, no target HTTP)\n- not in LOUD_TYPES, not scheduled/chained (operator-triggered, the spec''s\nconservative default). Route POST /domains/:id/dns-permute + a \"Permute DNS\"\nbutton on the Subdomains page; hits fold into the inventory via diffAndStore\n(source dns-permute), so new-host diffing/alerting comes for free. Honors\nctx.signal. Pure candidate-generation + wildcard-guard + filter unit-tested.","tree":{"sha":"f3f738973293ea72437f36b2f3b4fda82386c059","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/f3f738973293ea72437f36b2f3b4fda82386c059"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450","node_id":"C_kwDOTJBoQtoAKDUxZjZiNTdlNDAwY2NlM2Y5NDgxNThiMDlhYTVlZDdmMzZiZTI0NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commit/8df3ab717a8d5cae031251cc0d1590266d5e8f6c","sha":"8df3ab717a8d5cae031251cc0d1590266d5e8f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8df3ab717a8d5cae031251cc0d1590266d5e8f6c"}],"sha":"51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/51f6b57e400cce3f948158b09aa5ed7f36be2450"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maiiaa30","id":46065883,"login":"Maiiaa30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDY1ODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/commits/8df3ab717a8d5cae031251cc0d1590266d5e8f6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:56:11Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:56:11Z","email":"diogomaia2003@gmail.com","name":"Maia"},"message":"feat(replay): named identities reusable across repeater/intruder/authz\n\nPer-identity request context didn''t exist: authz_diff took identity-B\nheaders as ad-hoc job params, Repeater/Intruder carried whatever was typed,\nand history had no identity column. Add a named identities table so\ncredentials are defined ONCE and reused.\n\n- migration 0028: identities(id, domainId, name, headers JSON, isAnon) +\n  identity_id on replay_history. identities/store.ts (upsert by\n  domain+name, header sanitize/cap, cross-domain-guarded resolve).\n- routes/identities.ts: session-authed CRUD (not scan-gated - defining an\n  identity sends nothing; the creds only hit the wire through the gated\n  senders).\n- Repeater send, Intruder, and authz_diff now accept an identityId (authz:\n  identityBId) and merge that identity''s headers server-side; an anonymous\n  identity strips credential headers. replay_history records the identityId\n  (\"show every request I sent as B\") and the list route filters by it.\n- Audit of the actual sends logs the identity NAME, never header values\n  (matching the existing authz_diff redaction).\n- Frontend: an IdentityBar (define/select/delete) on Repeater/Intruder with\n  a \"Send as\" picker, and an identity-B selector in the Authz panel.\n\nCloses Phase B. identities store unit-tested (upsert/dedup, per-domain\nscope, anon, header sanitize). Backend + frontend green.","tree":{"sha":"b41108066b03645a27b291ed5048cb3a6d95e39a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/trees/b41108066b03645a27b291ed5048cb3a6d95e39a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maiiaa30/ReconDashboard/git/commits/8df3ab717a8d5cae031251cc0d1590266d5e8f6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46065883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maiiaa30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g